      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Mantenga la contracción en la parte superior. Evite compensar con la espalda.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Sostén los extremos de la cuerda a tus costados. Gira la cuerda sobre tu cabeza y salta cuando pase bajo tus pies.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'En decúbito prono apoyado sobre los antebrazos y los dedos de los pies. Tu cuerpo forma una línea recta desde la cabeza hasta los talones. Manténgase contrayendo su núcleo.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'En decúbito prono con las manos a la altura de los hombros. Baje el pecho hacia el suelo doblando los codos. Empuja hacia arriba volviendo a la posición inicial manteniendo tu cuerpo en línea recta.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'En posición de flexión. Alternativamente, lleve las rodillas hacia el pecho rápidamente mientras mantiene las caderas bajas.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'En posición de postura dividida. Baje el cuerpo doblando la rodilla delantera. Empuja hacia arriba volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Mantenga el pie opuesto completamente en el suelo. Torso erguido.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Mantenga la parte superior del brazo paralela al suelo. Evite el impulso.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Mantenga los brazos rectos. Concéntrate en la contracción dorsal.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Mantenga la espalda plana y el núcleo comprometido. Evite balancear el torso.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Mantenga la espalda en una posición neutral. Tire hacia la cintura o el pecho. Contrae los músculos de la espalda al final del movimiento.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Mantenga la espalda paralela al suelo. Gira ligeramente el torso al final del movimiento.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Mantenga el pecho erguido y las rodillas alineadas con los dedos de los pies. No dejes que tus rodillas colapsen hacia adentro.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Mantenga su núcleo comprometido y su espalda recta. Evite hiperextender la columna lumbar.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Mantenga su núcleo comprometido para proteger su espalda. Evite hiperextender la columna lumbar.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Mantén tu núcleo comprometido. Adapta la velocidad a tu nivel de condición física.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Mantén tu núcleo comprometido. Evite hiperextender la columna.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Mantenga los codos a la altura de los hombros o ligeramente por encima. Esencial para la salud del manguito rotador.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Mantenga los codos cerca de su cuerpo. Evite ensanchar los codos.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Mantenga los codos fijos a los costados. El agarre neutral enfatiza el braquiorradial sobre el bíceps.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Mantenga los codos fijos apuntando hacia el techo. Controla el descenso.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Mantén los codos fijos durante todo el movimiento. Concéntrate en la contracción completa en la parte superior.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Mantenga los codos fijos. No uses el impulso.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Mantenga los codos fijos. Concéntrate en la contracción completa.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Mantenga los codos fijos. Concéntrate en la extensión completa.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Mantenga los codos apuntando hacia el techo y cerca de la cabeza. La cabeza larga se activa al máximo en la posición estirada.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Mantenga la rodilla delantera alineada con los dedos de los pies. Corrige los desequilibrios musculares entre las piernas.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Mantén el talón en el suelo. Doble la rodilla para estirar el sóleo.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Mantén tus caderas alineadas. Evite que se hunda hacia abajo.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Mantén tus saltos bajos. Usa tus muñecas, no tus brazos, para girar la cuerda.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Mantenga la rodilla apuntando hacia el suelo. Evite hiperextender la espalda.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Mantenga las rodillas alineadas con los dedos de los pies. La posición del pie cambia el músculo más comprometido.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Mantenga las rodillas alineadas con los dedos de los pies. La postura de sumo reduce la trayectoria de la barra.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Mantenga la pelvis nivelada. Comience con un peso ligero.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Mantenga los omóplatos retraídos. Controla el descenso durante al menos 2 segundos.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Mantenga los hombros relajados. Adapta el ritmo a la intensidad deseada.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Mantenga su torso estable evitando balancearse. Controla el descenso.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Mantenga el torso erguido y el núcleo comprometido. Evite que la rodilla delantera pase los dedos de los pies.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Mantenga el torso vertical para aislar los tríceps. Cuanto más bajo vayas, mayor será el compromiso del pecho.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Mantenga sus muñecas en una posición neutral. El curl inverso fortalece los músculos del antebrazo.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'De rodillas con el volante delante. Gire la rueda hacia adelante bajando su cuerpo hacia el piso. Tire de la rueda hacia las rodillas.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Inclinarse hacia adelante aumenta el compromiso del pecho. La posición vertical aísla los tríceps.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Acuéstate con las rodillas dobladas. Lleva los hombros hacia las rodillas contrayendo los abdominales. Baje lentamente.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Acuéstate con las piernas levantadas. Lleva las rodillas hacia el pecho levantando la pelvis. Regrese lentamente.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Acuéstese boca abajo sobre la máquina con almohadillas en los tobillos. Flexiona las rodillas llevando los talones hacia los glúteos. Baje lentamente.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Acuéstate en el banco con una mancuerna en cada mano. Baje las mancuernas hacia su pecho manteniendo estables las muñecas. Empuje hacia arriba con firmeza regresando a la posición inicial.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Acuéstate en el banco con una mancuerna en cada mano. Baje los brazos lateralmente manteniendo una ligera flexión del codo. Lleva las mancuernas hacia arriba formando un arco como si abrazaras un árbol. Regrese lentamente.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Acuéstese en el banco con un agarre a la altura de los hombros. Baje la barra manteniendo los codos cerca del torso. Empuja hacia arriba apretando tus tríceps.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Acuéstate en el banco con el implemento sobre tu pecho y los brazos extendidos. Flexiona los codos bajando el peso hacia la frente. Extender volviendo a la posición.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Acuéstese en el banco con el implemento sobre su pecho y los brazos casi extendidos. Baje el peso detrás de la cabeza manteniendo los codos ligeramente doblados. Regrese a la posición inicial formando un arco.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Acuéstate en el banco con los pies en el suelo. Agarre la barra más ancha que el ancho de los hombros. Baje la barra hasta el pecho manteniendo los codos a unos 45 grados. Empuje hacia arriba con firmeza.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Acuéstese en el banco declinado con los pies asegurados. Agarre el implemento a una distancia mayor que el ancho de los hombros. Baje hasta la parte inferior del pecho. Empuja firmemente volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Acuéstate sobre el soporte inclinado con las pesas colgando. Tira hacia tu torso contrayendo tus dorsales. Baje lentamente.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Baje hasta ponerse en cuclillas y luego salte hacia arriba explosivamente. Aterriza suavemente doblando las rodillas.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Ponte en cuclillas, coloca las manos en el suelo y salta con los pies en posición de flexión. Realice una flexión, salte con los pies hacia las manos y luego salte con los brazos por encima de la cabeza.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Mantenga un ritmo constante. Postura correcta durante todo el ejercicio.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Mantenga una postura erguida con una ligera inclinación hacia adelante. Pasos alternos a un ritmo constante. Aterriza con el pie a mitad del paso.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Mantenga la misma flexión del codo durante todo el movimiento. Concéntrate en la contracción del pecho al final del movimiento.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Mantenga la misma flexión del codo. Controla el descenso durante 2 segundos.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Mantenga la ligera flexión del codo. El jersey es uno de los pocos ejercicios que estira el dorsal.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Tensión moderada, nunca dolor. Exhala mientras te estiras.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'Sobre manos y rodillas o de pie junto al cable. Extiende la pierna hacia atrás apretando el glúteo. Regrese lentamente.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'De lado apoyado sobre el antebrazo con el cuerpo en línea recta. Levanta las caderas manteniendo la posición.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Pedalea manteniendo un ritmo constante. Mantenga la espalda en una posición neutral.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Realizar la fase de levantamiento con agarre supinado. Gire las muñecas hasta la pronación en la parte superior. Baje con un agarre en pronación. Vuelva a estar en supinación en la parte inferior.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Realiza el movimiento controlando tanto la fase excéntrica como la concéntrica. Mantén tu núcleo comprometido.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Realiza el movimiento controlando tanto la fase excéntrica como la concéntrica. Mantenga los omóplatos retraídos.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Realiza el movimiento de forma explosiva hacia arriba o hacia adelante. Aterriza suavemente doblando las rodillas. Controla el aterrizaje.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Realiza el movimiento lentamente en ambas fases. La pausa en la parte inferior aumenta el estiramiento de la pantorrilla.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Realizar la rotación de forma fluida y continua. La prensa Arnold es uno de los pocos ejercicios que involucra todas las fibras musculares.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Coloque sus manos en forma de diamante debajo de su pecho. Baje el cuerpo manteniendo los codos cerca del torso. Empuja hacia arriba apretando tus tríceps.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Colóquese en la máquina de sentadillas con los hombros debajo de las almohadillas. Desciende doblando las rodillas a 90 grados y luego empuja hacia arriba.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Empuje principalmente con el pie sobre la superficie elevada. Mantenga su torso erguido.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Empuja con las piernas, luego inclina el torso hacia atrás, finalmente tira el remo hacia tu abdomen. Invierta el orden en la devolución.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Requiere excelente movilidad de hombros, cadera y tobillos. Empieza sin peso.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Retraiga los omóplatos y manténgalos bloqueados. No hagas rebotar el peso en tu pecho.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Retraiga los omóplatos para estabilizar el hombro.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Gire desde la cintura, no solo desde los brazos.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Gire el torso llevando un codo hacia la rodilla opuesta. Repita desde el otro lado.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Gire la muñeca hacia afuera en la parte superior para maximizar el pico. Mantén tu torso estable.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Sentado con mancuernas a la altura de los hombros y las palmas hacia ti. Presione hacia arriba girando las muñecas hacia afuera hasta que las palmas miren hacia adelante. Bajar volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Sentado con el codo apoyado en la parte interna del muslo. Flexiona el codo llevando la mancuerna hacia el hombro. Baje lentamente.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Sentado con los pies levantados y el torso a 45 grados. Gira tu torso de lado a lado llevando tus manos al suelo al lado de tus caderas.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Secuencia: piernas, luego torso y luego brazos durante el tirón.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Siéntese en la máquina de jalones laterales y agarre la barra con un agarre en pronación amplia. Tira de la barra hacia tu pecho inclinando el torso ligeramente hacia atrás. Controlar el regreso a la posición inicial.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Siéntese en la máquina de jalones laterales con un agarre estrecho o neutral. Tire de la barra hacia su pecho manteniendo los codos cerca de su cuerpo. Controla la devolución.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Siéntate en el cable bajo con los pies sobre los soportes. Tire del asa hacia su cintura manteniendo la espalda recta. Contrae los músculos de la espalda y regresa lentamente.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Siéntate frente a la máquina con almohadillas en los tobillos. Extiende las piernas hacia arriba contrayendo los cuádriceps. Baje lentamente.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Siéntate frente a la máquina con almohadillas en los tobillos. Flexiona las rodillas llevando los talones hacia los glúteos. Baje lentamente.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Siéntese en el banco del predicador con los brazos apoyados en la plataforma. Flexiona los codos llevando el implemento hacia tus hombros. Baje lentamente casi hasta alcanzar la extensión completa.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Siéntese en la máquina con la espalda apoyada contra la almohadilla. Coloque los codos sobre las almohadillas. Lleva tus brazos hacia el centro contrayendo tu pecho. Regrese lentamente a la posición inicial.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Siéntese en la máquina con los pies sobre la plataforma al ancho de las caderas. Baje doblando las rodillas a 90 grados. Empuja extendiendo las piernas.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Siéntate en el banco inclinado con los pies en el suelo. Agarre el implemento a una distancia mayor que el ancho de los hombros. Baje hasta el nivel superior del pecho. Empuja firmemente volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Siéntate con los antebrazos sobre los muslos. Agarre el implemento con agarre supinado. Flexiona las muñecas hacia arriba y hacia abajo lentamente.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Separe la cuerda en la parte inferior para maximizar la contracción. Mantenga los codos fijos.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'De pie en el centro del cable con un asa por mano. Mantenga los brazos ligeramente doblados. Lleva tus manos hacia el centro cruzándolas. Regrese lentamente a la posición inicial.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'De pie junto al cable alto con la cuerda. Mantenga los codos fijos a los lados del torso. Empuja la cuerda hacia abajo separando los extremos. Regrese lentamente.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'De pie en el cable alto. Mantenga los codos fijos a los lados del torso. Empuja hacia abajo extendiendo completamente los brazos. Regrese lentamente.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'De pie frente al cable alto con los brazos casi extendidos. Lleva la barra hacia tus muslos formando un arco manteniendo los brazos rectos. Regrese lentamente a la posición inicial.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'De pie frente a un banco. Coloque un pie en la superficie elevada y empuje hacia arriba. Baja lentamente controlando el movimiento.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'De pie sobre una pierna. Baja el torso hacia adelante manteniendo la espalda recta mientras la pierna libre se extiende hacia atrás. Vuelve a la posición erguida apretando los glúteos.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'De pie o sentado con el implemento a la altura de los hombros. Empuja hacia arriba extendiendo completamente los brazos. Baja lentamente volviendo a la posición inicial con el peso a la altura de los hombros.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'De pie o sentado con el implemento a la altura de los hombros. Empuja hacia arriba extendiendo completamente los brazos. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'De pie o sentado con el implemento por encima de la cabeza y los brazos extendidos. Flexiona los codos bajando el peso detrás de la cabeza. Extender volviendo hacia arriba.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'De pie con una mancuerna en cada mano a los costados. Levanta los brazos lateralmente hasta la altura de los hombros manteniendo los codos ligeramente flexionados. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'De pie con una pesa en cada mano a los costados. Levanta los hombros hacia las orejas apretando los trapecios. Mantenga la contracción por un segundo y luego baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'De pie con mancuernas a los lados con un agarre neutral (pulgares hacia arriba). Flexiona los codos llevando las mancuernas hacia los hombros. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'De pie con los pies al ancho de las caderas. Gire las caderas balanceando el peso entre las piernas, luego impulse explosivamente las caderas hacia adelante balanceando el peso hasta la altura de los hombros.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'De pie con los pies al ancho de las caderas. Baja la barra a lo largo de tus piernas manteniendo las rodillas ligeramente dobladas y la espalda recta. Desciende hasta sentir tensión en los isquiotibiales y luego vuelve a subir.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'De pie con los pies al ancho de las caderas. Baja con la espalda recta y el pecho hacia arriba. Empuja los pies contra el suelo y extiende las caderas y las rodillas simultáneamente manteniendo la barra cerca de tus piernas.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'De pie con los pies a la altura de los hombros, sostenga una mancuerna frente a su pecho. Desciende manteniendo el pecho en alto. Vuelve hacia arriba empujando los talones.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'De pie con los pies al ancho de los hombros. Baje el cuerpo doblando las rodillas y las caderas como si estuviera sentado en una silla. Desciende hasta que tus muslos queden paralelos al suelo. Empuja tus talones.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'De pie con los pies juntos. Da un paso lateral amplio manteniendo fijo el pie opuesto. Baje hacia ese lado doblando la rodilla.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'De pie con la barra sobre los hombros. Inclina el torso hacia adelante manteniendo la espalda recta y las rodillas ligeramente flexionadas. Siente el estiramiento en tus isquiotibiales. Regrese a la posición vertical.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'De pie con el implemento delante de los muslos utilizando un agarre en pronación. Tire hacia la barbilla manteniendo los codos más altos que las muñecas. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'De pie con el implemento delante de tus muslos. Levante los brazos frente a usted hasta la altura de los hombros manteniendo los codos ligeramente doblados. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'De pie con el implemento utilizando un agarre en pronación (palmas hacia abajo). Flexiona los codos llevando el implemento hacia tus hombros. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'De pie con el implemento mediante agarre supinado. Flexione los codos llevando el implemento hacia los hombros manteniendo los codos fijos a los lados del torso. Baja lentamente volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'De pie con el torso inclinado a 45 grados. Agarre la barra con un agarre en pronación. Tire hacia el abdomen manteniendo la espalda neutra. Baje lentamente.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'De pie con los talones fuera del borde de una plataforma. Ponte de puntillas apretando las pantorrillas. Baje lentamente permitiendo que los talones caigan por debajo del nivel de la plataforma.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Comience a un ritmo moderado y aumente gradualmente.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Empiece por la retracción de los omóplatos. Controla la fase excéntrica.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Empiece por la retracción de los omóplatos. No incline el torso demasiado hacia atrás.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Inicia el movimiento desde la retracción de los omóplatos. Evite utilizar el impulso.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Inicia el movimiento desde la retracción de los omóplatos. Controlar la fase de alargamiento.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Da un paso hacia atrás bajando la rodilla trasera hacia el suelo. La rodilla delantera permanece alineada con el tobillo.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Da un paso adelante bajando la rodilla trasera hacia el suelo. La rodilla delantera permanece alineada con el tobillo. Empuje hacia arriba.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Da un paso adelante bajando la rodilla trasera. Continúe dando pasos hacia adelante alternando piernas continuamente.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Entra en la barra trampa. Pies al ancho de las caderas. Bájate agarrando las asas con la espalda recta. Empuja con los pies extendiendo las caderas y las rodillas simultáneamente.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Da pasos largos para involucrar más tus glúteos.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'El curl Zottman entrena tanto la flexión como la extensión del antebrazo.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'La barra debe rozar tus piernas durante todo el movimiento. Concéntrate en el estiramiento de los isquiotibiales durante el descenso.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Cuanto más alta es la superficie, más trabaja la parte superior del pecho.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'El banco inclinado realza la parte superior del pecho. Mantenga los omóplatos retraídos durante todo el movimiento.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'La versión inclinada es más fácil y se adapta a la parte inferior del pecho.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Cuanto más horizontal sea tu cuerpo, más difícil será. Mantenga siempre su núcleo comprometido.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'El movimiento proviene de las caderas, no de la espalda. Mantenga la espalda recta durante la fase de empuje.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'El banco del predicador elimina el uso del impulso. No dejes que el peso caiga al fondo.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'La estocada inversa es más segura para las rodillas que la estocada hacia adelante.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'La rotación proviene de la cintura, no de la cabeza.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'La flexión de piernas sentado aumenta el rango de movimiento. Evite levantar los glúteos del asiento.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'El soporte elimina el estrés lumbar. Centrarse en la retracción.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'La barra trampa reduce la tensión en la columna. Mantenga los hombros alineados con las asas.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'El peso al frente ayuda con la postura vertical. Mantenga las rodillas alineadas.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Utilice un peso ligero. Mantenga los antebrazos todavía sobre los muslos.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Con una mano y una rodilla en el banco. Tire de la mancuerna hacia su costado manteniendo el codo cerca del cuerpo. Baje lentamente.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Con la barra sobre tu cabeza, desciende hasta ponerse en cuclillas manteniendo los brazos rectos y estables. Vuelve hacia arriba manteniendo la barra alineada.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Con los brazos al frente a la altura del cable o con mancuernas, tira del implemento hacia tu cara manteniendo los codos en alto. Separa las manos acercando los puños a las orejas. Regrese lentamente.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Con el cuerpo inclinado debajo de una barra baja, agarre en pronación. Lleva tu pecho hacia la barra manteniendo tu cuerpo rígido. Baje lentamente.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Con los pies sobre una superficie elevada, baje el pecho hacia el suelo. Empuja hacia arriba volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Con las manos sobre una superficie elevada, baje el pecho hacia las manos. Empuja hacia arriba volviendo a la posición inicial.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Con las manos en el borde de un banco, da un paso adelante con los glúteos hacia afuera. Baja el cuerpo doblando los codos a 90 grados. Hacer subir.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Con el torso inclinado y el codo doblado a 90 grados, extienda el brazo hacia atrás hasta alcanzar la extensión completa. Vuelve lentamente.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Con la parte superior de la espalda sobre un banco y el peso sobre las caderas. Empuja tus caderas hacia arriba apretando tus glúteos. Regrese lentamente.',
    },
    'pt': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'Execute o movimento lentamente e com controle. Mantenha uma postura correta.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Comece com um peso moderado para dominar a técnica.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Respire profundamente. Nunca force além do seu limite natural.',
      'Breathe deeply. Do not force beyond your limit.': 'Respire profundamente. Não force além do seu limite.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Mantenha o core ativado durante todo o exercício. Controle a fase excêntrica.',
      'Focus on squeezing your glutes and keep your core stable.': 'Concentre-se em contrair os glúteos e mantenha o core estável.',
      'Control both the eccentric and concentric phases of the movement.': 'Controle tanto a fase excêntrica quanto a concêntrica do movimento.',
      'Perform the movement under control and keep your core stable.': 'Execute o movimento com controle e mantenha o core estável.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': 'Mantenha o core estável durante todo o exercício.',
      'Avoid swinging. Control both the ascending and descending phases.': 'Evite balanços. Controle as fases ascendente e descendente.',
      'Lower slowly': 'Desça lentamente', 'lower slowly': 'desça lentamente',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Respire profundamente',
      'Squeeze your glutes': 'Contraia os glúteos',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Use a amplitude completa de movimento.',
      'Keep your feet shoulder-width apart.': 'Mantenha os pés na largura dos ombros.',
      'Bring your arms into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Leve os braços à posição de alongamento e segure por 20-30 segundos.',
      'Bring your legs into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Leve as pernas à posição de alongamento e segure por 20-30 segundos.',
      'Move into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Adote a posição de alongamento e segure por 20-30 segundos.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'Uma pegada fechada aumenta a amplitude de movimento. Comece pela retração.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'Uma pegada fechada isola o tríceps. Mantenha seu corpo em linha reta.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'Uma pegada supinada aumenta o envolvimento do bíceps. Evite usar impulso.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Ajuste o assento: seus joelhos não devem hiperestender.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Sempre pouse suavemente. Não trave os joelhos.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Evite impulso. Concentre-se em levantar a pélvis.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Evite levantar os cotovelos acima da altura dos ombros. Uma aderência mais ampla reduz o risco de impacto.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Evite girar os ombros. Concentre-se apenas no movimento vertical.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Evite balançar o tronco. Controle ambas as fases.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Barra na frente dos ombros com cotovelos altos. Desça mantendo o tronco o mais vertical possível. Empurre de volta para cima.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Traga a perna para uma posição alongada, mantendo o tronco ereto. Segure por 20-30 segundos.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Coloque a perna em uma posição alongada com as costas retas. Segure por 20-30 segundos respirando profundamente.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Traga a perna para fora em abdução, controlando o movimento. Volte devagar. Mantenha seu núcleo estável.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Traga a perna em direção ao centro em adução, controlando o movimento. Volte devagar. Mantenha seu núcleo estável.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Contraia seu abdômen durante todo o exercício. Controle a fase excêntrica.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'Não hiperestenda os braços durante a fase de abertura. Concentre-se na contração do peito.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Não deixe suas costas arquearem. Comece com implementações parciais.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Não deixe seus quadris caírem para baixo. Retraia as omoplatas.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Não levante os quadris. Segure a contração na parte superior por um segundo.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Não trave os joelhos em extensão. Pés mais altos na plataforma envolvem mais os glúteos.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Não puxe o pescoço. Concentre-se na contração abdominal.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Não levante os braços acima da altura dos ombros. Gire os pulsos ligeiramente para baixo (como se estivesse derramando água) para isolar o deltóide lateral.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Não levante os quadris. Mantenha os ombros sobre os pulsos.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'Não arredonde as costas em nenhum momento. Envolva seu núcleo antes de puxar.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Não arredonde as costas. Controle a fase excêntrica.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'Não arredonde as costas. Controle a fase de alongamento.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'Não arredonde as costas. Comece com um peso leve.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Não use balanço corporal. Concentre-se em isolar o glúteo médio.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'Não use impulso. Concentre-se em isolar os adutores.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'Não use impulso. Concentre-se na contração.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Halteres permitem uma maior amplitude de movimento. Mantenha as omoplatas retraídas durante todo o movimento.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'Pés mais largos que a largura dos ombros, com dedos apontando para fora. Abaixe segurando a barra com uma pegada interna. Empurre com as pernas e estenda os quadris simultaneamente, mantendo as costas retas.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Flexione os cotovelos trazendo o peso em direção aos ombros. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Estenda totalmente os braços na fase concêntrica. Retorne lentamente à posição inicial controlando o movimento.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Segure a barra com uma pegada pronada na largura dos ombros. Começando com os braços estendidos, puxe o corpo para cima até que o queixo ultrapasse a barra. Abaixe lentamente de volta à posição inicial.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Segure a barra com uma pegada supinada (palmas voltadas para você) na largura dos ombros. Começando com os braços estendidos, puxe o corpo para cima até que o queixo ultrapasse a barra. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Segure as barras paralelas com os braços estendidos. Abaixe o corpo inclinando-se ligeiramente para a frente e dobrando os cotovelos. Empurre para cima retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'Pendurado na barra ou deitado, levante as pernas controlando o movimento. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'Cotovelos altos evitam que a barra deslize. Requer mobilidade significativa do punho e tornozelo.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Segure a contração na parte superior por um segundo. Evite impulso.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Segure a contração na parte superior por um segundo. Mantenha o queixo voltado para o peito.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Segure a contração no topo. Evite compensar com as costas.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Segure as pontas da corda ao lado do corpo. Gire a corda acima da cabeça e pule quando ela passar sob seus pés.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'Em posição de bruços, apoiado nos antebraços e dedos dos pés. Seu corpo forma uma linha reta da cabeça aos calcanhares. Segure contraindo seu núcleo.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'Em posição prona com as mãos na largura dos ombros. Abaixe o peito em direção ao chão dobrando os cotovelos. Empurre para cima, retornando à posição inicial, mantendo o corpo em linha reta.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'Em posição de flexão. Alternadamente, traga os joelhos em direção ao peito rapidamente, enquanto mantém os quadris baixos.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'Em uma posição de postura dividida. Abaixe o corpo dobrando o joelho da frente. Empurre para cima retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Mantenha o pé oposto completamente no chão. Torso ereto.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Mantenha o braço paralelo ao chão. Evite impulso.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Mantenha os braços retos. Concentre-se na contração posterior.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Mantenha as costas retas e o núcleo engajado. Evite balançar o tronco.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Mantenha as costas em posição neutra. Puxe em direção à cintura ou ao peito. Contraia os músculos das costas no final do movimento.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Mantenha as costas paralelas ao chão. Gire ligeiramente o tronco no final do movimento.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Mantenha o peito para cima e os joelhos alinhados com os dedos dos pés. Não deixe seus joelhos caírem para dentro.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Mantenha seu núcleo engajado e suas costas retas. Evite hiperestender a coluna lombar.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Mantenha seu núcleo engajado para proteger suas costas. Evite hiperestender a coluna lombar.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Mantenha seu núcleo engajado. Adapte a velocidade ao seu nível de condicionamento físico.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Mantenha seu núcleo engajado. Evite hiperestender a coluna.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos na altura dos ombros ou ligeiramente acima. Essencial para a saúde do manguito rotador.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos próximos ao corpo. Evite alargar os cotovelos.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos fixos ao lado do corpo. A pegada neutra enfatiza o braquiorradial sobre o bíceps.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos fixos apontando para o teto. Controle a descida.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos fixos durante todo o movimento. Concentre-se na contração completa na parte superior.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos fixos. Não use impulso.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos fixos. Concentre-se na contração completa.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos fixos. Concentre-se na extensão completa.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Mantenha os cotovelos apontando para o teto e próximos à cabeça. A cabeça longa é ativada ao máximo na posição esticada.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Mantenha o joelho da frente alinhado com os dedos dos pés. Corrige desequilíbrios musculares entre as pernas.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Mantenha o calcanhar no chão. Dobre o joelho para alongar o sóleo.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Mantenha os quadris alinhados. Evite deixá-los cair para baixo.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Mantenha seus saltos baixos. Use os pulsos, não os braços, para girar a corda.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Mantenha o joelho apontando para o chão. Evite hiperestender as costas.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Mantenha os joelhos alinhados com os dedos dos pés. A posição do pé altera o músculo mais engajado.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Mantenha os joelhos alinhados com os dedos dos pés. A postura de sumô reduz o caminho da barra.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Mantenha a pélvis nivelada. Comece com um peso leve.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Mantenha as omoplatas retraídas. Controle a descida por pelo menos 2 segundos.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Mantenha os ombros relaxados. Adapte o ritmo à intensidade desejada.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Mantenha o tronco estável evitando balançar. Controle a descida.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Mantenha o tronco ereto e o núcleo engajado. Evite deixar o joelho da frente passar dos dedos dos pés.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Mantenha o tronco vertical para isolar o tríceps. Quanto mais baixo você desce, maior será o envolvimento do peito.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Mantenha os pulsos em posição neutra. A curva reversa fortalece os músculos do antebraço.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'Ajoelhado com a roda na frente. Role a roda para frente, abaixando o corpo em direção ao chão. Puxe a roda em direção aos joelhos.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Inclinar-se para frente aumenta o envolvimento do peito. A posição vertical isola o tríceps.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Deite-se com os joelhos dobrados. Traga os ombros em direção aos joelhos, contraindo os abdominais. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Deite-se com as pernas levantadas. Traga os joelhos em direção ao peito, levantando a pélvis. Volte devagar.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Deite-se de bruços na máquina com almofadas nos tornozelos. Flexione os joelhos aproximando os calcanhares dos glúteos. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Deite-se no banco com um haltere em cada mão. Abaixe os halteres em direção ao peito, mantendo os pulsos estáveis. Empurre para cima com firmeza, retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Deite-se no banco com um haltere em cada mão. Abaixe os braços lateralmente mantendo uma leve flexão dos cotovelos. Traga os halteres para cima em um arco, como se estivesse abraçando uma árvore. Volte devagar.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Deite-se no banco com uma pegada na largura dos ombros. Abaixe a barra mantendo os cotovelos próximos ao tronco. Empurre para cima, apertando o tríceps.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Deite-se no banco com o implemento acima do peito e os braços estendidos. Flexione os cotovelos baixando o peso em direção à testa. Estenda retornando à posição.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Deite-se no banco com o implemento acima do peito e os braços quase estendidos. Abaixe o peso atrás da cabeça, mantendo os cotovelos ligeiramente flexionados. Retorne à posição inicial em um arco.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Deite-se no banco com os pés no chão. Segure a barra mais larga que a largura dos ombros. Abaixe a barra até o peito, mantendo os cotovelos em cerca de 45 graus. Empurre para cima com firmeza.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Deite-se no banco declinado com os pés protegidos. Segure o implemento mais largo que a largura dos ombros. Abaixe até a parte inferior do tórax. Empurre firmemente retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Deite-se no suporte inclinado com os pesos pendurados. Puxe em direção ao tronco, contraindo o grande dorsal. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Abaixe-se em um agachamento e salte para cima de forma explosiva. Pouse suavemente dobrando os joelhos.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Agache-se, coloque as mãos no chão e pule os pés para uma posição de flexão. Faça uma flexão, pule os pés em direção às mãos e depois pule com os braços acima da cabeça.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Mantenha um ritmo constante. Postura correta durante todo o exercício.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Mantenha uma postura ereta com uma ligeira inclinação para a frente. Passos alternados em um ritmo constante. Aterrisse com o pé no meio do passo.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Mantenha a mesma flexão do cotovelo durante todo o movimento. Concentre-se na contração torácica no final do movimento.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Mantenha a mesma flexão do cotovelo. Controle a descida por 2 segundos.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Mantenha a leve flexão do cotovelo. O pulôver é um dos poucos exercícios que alonga o dorsal.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Tensão moderada, nunca dor. Expire enquanto se alonga.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'De mãos e joelhos ou em pé no cabo. Estenda a perna para trás apertando o glúteo. Volte devagar.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'De lado, apoiado no antebraço, com o corpo em linha reta. Levante os quadris mantendo a posição.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Pedale mantendo um ritmo constante. Mantenha as costas em posição neutra.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Execute a fase de levantamento com pegada supinada. Gire os pulsos para pronação na parte superior. Abaixe com uma pegada pronada. Volte para supinado na parte inferior.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Execute o movimento controlando as fases excêntrica e concêntrica. Mantenha seu núcleo engajado.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Execute o movimento controlando as fases excêntrica e concêntrica. Mantenha as omoplatas retraídas.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Execute o movimento de forma explosiva para cima ou para frente. Pouse suavemente dobrando os joelhos. Controle o pouso.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Execute o movimento lentamente em ambas as fases. A pausa na parte inferior aumenta o alongamento da panturrilha.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Execute a rotação de forma fluida e contínua. O Arnold Press é um dos poucos exercícios que envolve todas as fibras musculares.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Posicione as mãos em forma de diamante sob o peito. Abaixe o corpo mantendo os cotovelos próximos ao tronco. Empurre para cima, apertando o tríceps.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Posicione-se na máquina de agachamento com os ombros sob as almofadas. Desça dobrando os joelhos a 90 graus e empurre para cima.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Empurre principalmente com o pé na superfície elevada. Mantenha o tronco ereto.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Empurre com as pernas, depois incline o tronco para trás e, por fim, puxe o remo em direção ao abdômen. Inverta a ordem na devolução.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Requer excelente mobilidade de ombros, quadris e tornozelos. Comece sem peso.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Retraia as omoplatas e mantenha-as travadas. Não tire o peso do peito.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Retraia as omoplatas para estabilizar o ombro.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Gire a partir da cintura, não apenas a partir dos braços.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Gire o tronco trazendo um cotovelo em direção ao joelho oposto. Repita do outro lado.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Gire o pulso para fora na parte superior para maximizar o pico. Mantenha seu tronco estável.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Sentado com halteres na altura dos ombros e palmas voltadas para você. Pressione para cima girando os pulsos para fora até que as palmas das mãos fiquem voltadas para a frente. Abaixe retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Sentado com o cotovelo apoiado na parte interna da coxa. Flexione o cotovelo trazendo o haltere em direção ao ombro. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Sentado com os pés elevados e o tronco a 45 graus. Gire o tronco de um lado para o outro, colocando as mãos no chão ao lado dos quadris.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Sequência: pernas, depois tronco e depois braços durante a puxada.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Sente-se na máquina de pulldown e segure a barra com uma pegada ampla e pronada. Puxe a barra em direção ao peito, inclinando o tronco ligeiramente para trás. Controle o retorno à posição inicial.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Sente-se na máquina de pulldown com uma pegada fechada ou neutra. Puxe a barra em direção ao peito, mantendo os cotovelos próximos ao corpo. Controle o retorno.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Sente-se no cabo baixo com os pés apoiados nos suportes. Puxe a alça em direção à cintura, mantendo as costas retas. Contraia os músculos das costas e retorne lentamente.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Sente-se na máquina com almofadas nos tornozelos. Estenda as pernas para cima, contraindo o quadríceps. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Sente-se na máquina com almofadas nos tornozelos. Flexione os joelhos aproximando os calcanhares dos glúteos. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Sente-se no banco do pregador com os braços apoiados na almofada. Flexione os cotovelos trazendo o implemento em direção aos ombros. Abaixe lentamente quase até a extensão total.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Sente-se na máquina com as costas apoiadas na almofada. Posicione os cotovelos nas almofadas. Traga os braços em direção ao centro, contraindo o peito. Retorne lentamente à posição inicial.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Sente-se na máquina com os pés na plataforma, na largura do quadril. Abaixe dobrando os joelhos a 90 graus. Empurre estendendo as pernas.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Sente-se no banco inclinado com os pés no chão. Segure o implemento mais largo que a largura dos ombros. Abaixe até o nível superior do tórax. Empurre firmemente retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Sente-se com os antebraços apoiados nas coxas. Segure o implemento com uma pegada supinada. Flexione os pulsos para cima e abaixe lentamente.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Afaste a corda na parte inferior para maximizar a contração. Mantenha os cotovelos fixos.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Ficar no centro do cabo com uma alça por mão. Mantenha os braços ligeiramente flexionados. Traga as mãos em direção ao centro, cruzando-as. Retorne lentamente à posição inicial.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'De pé no cabo alto com a corda. Mantenha os cotovelos fixos nas laterais do tronco. Empurre a corda para baixo separando as pontas. Volte devagar.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'De pé no cabo alto. Mantenha os cotovelos fixos nas laterais do tronco. Empurre para baixo, estendendo totalmente os braços. Volte devagar.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Ficar de frente para o cabo alto com os braços quase estendidos. Traga a barra em direção às coxas em um arco, mantendo os braços retos. Retorne lentamente à posição inicial.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Parado na frente de um banco. Coloque um pé na superfície elevada e empurre para cima. Abaixe lentamente controlando o movimento.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'De pé sobre uma perna só. Abaixe o tronco para a frente, mantendo as costas retas enquanto a perna livre se estende para trás. Volte à posição vertical apertando os glúteos.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'Em pé ou sentado com o implemento na altura dos ombros. Empurre para cima, estendendo totalmente os braços. Abaixe lentamente retornando à posição inicial com o peso na altura dos ombros.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'Em pé ou sentado com o implemento na altura dos ombros. Empurre para cima, estendendo totalmente os braços. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'Em pé ou sentado com o implemento acima da cabeça, braços estendidos. Flexione os cotovelos baixando o peso atrás da cabeça. Estenda o retorno.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Em pé com um haltere em cada mão ao lado do corpo. Levante os braços lateralmente até a altura dos ombros, mantendo os cotovelos levemente flexionados. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Em pé com um peso em cada mão ao lado do corpo. Levante os ombros em direção às orelhas, apertando as armadilhas. Segure a contração por um segundo e depois abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Em pé com halteres ao lado do corpo com pegada neutra (polegar para cima). Flexione os cotovelos trazendo os halteres em direção aos ombros. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Em pé com os pés na largura do quadril. Dobre os quadris balançando o peso entre as pernas e, em seguida, mova os quadris para a frente de forma explosiva, balançando o peso até a altura dos ombros.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Em pé com os pés na largura do quadril. Abaixe a barra ao longo das pernas, mantendo os joelhos ligeiramente flexionados e as costas retas. Desça até sentir tensão nos isquiotibiais e depois volte para cima.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Em pé com os pés na largura do quadril. Abaixe com as costas retas e o peito para cima. Empurre os pés no chão e estenda os quadris e joelhos simultaneamente, mantendo a barra próxima às pernas.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Em pé, com os pés na largura dos ombros, segure um haltere na frente do peito. Desça mantendo o peito para cima. Volte empurrando os calcanhares.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Em pé com os pés na largura dos ombros. Abaixe o corpo dobrando os joelhos e quadris como se estivesse sentado em uma cadeira. Desça até que as coxas fiquem paralelas ao chão. Empurre os calcanhares.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Em pé com os pés juntos. Dê um passo lateral largo mantendo o pé oposto fixo. Abaixe para esse lado dobrando o joelho.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Em pé com a barra nos ombros. Incline o tronco para a frente mantendo as costas retas e os joelhos ligeiramente flexionados. Sinta o alongamento dos isquiotibiais. Retorne à posição vertical.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Ficar em pé com o implemento na frente das coxas usando uma pegada pronada. Puxe em direção ao queixo, mantendo os cotovelos mais altos que os pulsos. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Em pé com o implemento na frente das coxas. Levante os braços à sua frente até a altura dos ombros, mantendo os cotovelos ligeiramente flexionados. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Em pé com o implemento em pegada pronada (palmas voltadas para baixo). Flexione os cotovelos trazendo o implemento em direção aos ombros. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Ficar em pé com o implemento em pegada supinada. Flexione os cotovelos trazendo o implemento em direção aos ombros, mantendo os cotovelos fixos nas laterais do tronco. Abaixe lentamente retornando à posição inicial.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Em pé com tronco inclinado a 45 graus. Segure a barra com uma pegada pronada. Puxe em direção ao abdômen, mantendo as costas neutras. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Em pé, com os calcanhares fora da borda de uma plataforma. Fique na ponta dos pés, apertando as panturrilhas. Abaixe lentamente, permitindo que os calcanhares caiam abaixo do nível da plataforma.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Comece em um ritmo moderado e aumente gradualmente.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Comece pela retração das omoplatas. Controle a fase excêntrica.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Comece pela retração das omoplatas. Não incline o tronco muito para trás.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Inicie o movimento a partir da retração das omoplatas. Evite usar impulso.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Inicie o movimento a partir da retração das omoplatas. Controle a fase de alongamento.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Dê um passo para trás, abaixando o joelho traseiro em direção ao chão. O joelho da frente fica alinhado com o tornozelo.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Dê um passo à frente, abaixando o joelho traseiro em direção ao chão. O joelho da frente fica alinhado com o tornozelo. Empurre de volta para cima.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Dê um passo à frente abaixando o joelho traseiro. Continue avançando alternando as pernas continuamente.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Entre na barra de armadilha. Pés na largura do quadril. Abaixe-se segurando as alças com as costas retas. Empurre os pés, estendendo os quadris e os joelhos simultaneamente.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Dê passos longos para envolver mais os glúteos.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'A rosca Zottman treina flexão e extensão do antebraço.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'A barra deve roçar suas pernas durante todo o movimento. Concentre-se no alongamento dos isquiotibiais durante a descida.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Quanto mais alta a superfície, mais funciona a parte superior do tórax.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'O banco inclinado enfatiza a parte superior do tórax. Mantenha as omoplatas retraídas durante todo o movimento.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'A versão inclinada é mais fácil e envolve a parte inferior do tórax.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Quanto mais horizontal for o seu corpo, mais difícil será. Sempre mantenha seu núcleo engajado.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'O movimento vem dos quadris, não das costas. Mantenha as costas retas durante a fase de empurrar.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'O banco do pregador elimina o uso de impulso. Não deixe o peso cair na parte inferior.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'A estocada reversa é mais segura para os joelhos do que a estocada para frente.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'A rotação vem da cintura, não da cabeça.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'A flexão da perna sentada aumenta a amplitude de movimento. Evite levantar os glúteos do assento.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'O suporte elimina o estresse lombar. Concentre-se na retração.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'A barra de armadilha reduz o estresse na coluna. Mantenha os ombros alinhados com as alças.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'O peso na frente ajuda na postura vertical. Mantenha os joelhos alinhados.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Use um peso leve. Mantenha os antebraços ainda nas coxas.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Com uma mão e um joelho no banco. Puxe o haltere para o lado, mantendo o cotovelo próximo ao corpo. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Com a barra acima da cabeça, agache-se mantendo os braços retos e estáveis. Volte mantendo a barra alinhada.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Com os braços à frente no cabo ou com halteres, puxe o implemento em direção ao rosto mantendo os cotovelos elevados. Separe as mãos aproximando os punhos das orelhas. Volte devagar.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Com o corpo inclinado sob uma barra baixa, segure com uma pegada pronada. Puxe o peito até a barra mantendo o corpo rígido. Abaixe lentamente.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Com os pés em uma superfície elevada, abaixe o peito em direção ao chão. Empurre para cima retornando à posição inicial.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Com as mãos em uma superfície elevada, abaixe o peito em direção às mãos. Empurre para cima retornando à posição inicial.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Com as mãos na beirada de um banco, dê um passo à frente com os glúteos para fora. Abaixe o corpo dobrando os cotovelos a 90 graus. Empurre para cima.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Com o tronco inclinado e o cotovelo dobrado a 90 graus, estenda o braço para trás até a extensão total. Volte lentamente.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Com a parte superior das costas apoiada em um banco e o peso nos quadris. Empurre os quadris para cima, apertando os glúteos. Volte devagar.',
    },
    'fr': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': "Effectuez le mouvement lentement et avec contrôle. Maintenez une posture correcte.",
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Commencez avec un poids modéré pour maîtriser la technique.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Respirez profondément. Ne forcez jamais au-delà de votre limite naturelle.',
      'Breathe deeply. Do not force beyond your limit.': 'Respirez profondément. Ne forcez pas au-delà de votre limite.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': "Gardez le gainage actif tout au long de l'exercice. Contrôlez la phase excentrique.",
      'Focus on squeezing your glutes and keep your core stable.': 'Concentrez-vous sur la contraction des fessiers et gardez le gainage stable.',
      'Control both the eccentric and concentric phases of the movement.': 'Contrôlez les phases excentrique et concentrique du mouvement.',
      'Perform the movement under control and keep your core stable.': 'Effectuez le mouvement avec contrôle et gardez le gainage stable.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': "Gardez le gainage stable tout au long de l'exercice.",
      'Avoid swinging. Control both the ascending and descending phases.': 'Évitez de vous balancer. Contrôlez les phases montante et descendante.',
      'Lower slowly': 'Descendez lentement', 'lower slowly': 'descendez lentement',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Respirez profondément',
      'Squeeze your glutes': 'Contractez les fessiers',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Utilisez une amplitude complète de mouvement.',
      'Keep your feet shoulder-width apart.': 'Gardez les pieds à la largeur des épaules.',
      'Bring your arms into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': "Amenez vos bras en position d'étirement et maintenez 20-30 secondes.",
      'Bring your legs into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': "Amenez vos jambes en position d'étirement et maintenez 20-30 secondes.",
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'Une prise serrée augmente l’amplitude des mouvements. Commencez par la rétraction.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'Une prise serrée isole les triceps. Gardez votre corps en ligne droite.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'Une prise en supination augmente l’engagement des biceps. Évitez d\'utiliser l\'élan.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Réglez le siège : vos genoux ne doivent pas être en hyperextension.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Atterrissez toujours en douceur. Ne verrouillez pas vos genoux.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Évitez l\'élan. Concentrez-vous sur le soulèvement du bassin.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Évitez de lever les coudes au-dessus de la hauteur des épaules. Une prise plus large réduit le risque de conflit.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Évitez de faire pivoter vos épaules. Concentrez-vous uniquement sur le mouvement vertical.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Évitez de balancer votre torse. Contrôlez les deux phases.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Haltères sur le devant des épaules avec coudes hauts. Descendez en gardant le torse le plus vertical possible. Repoussez.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Amenez votre jambe dans une position d\'étirement en gardant votre torse droit. Tenez pendant 20 à 30 secondes.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Mettez votre jambe en position d\'étirement avec le dos droit. Tenez pendant 20 à 30 secondes en respirant profondément.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Amenez votre jambe vers l\'extérieur en abduction en contrôlant le mouvement. Revenez lentement. Gardez votre noyau stable.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Amenez votre jambe vers le centre en adduction en contrôlant le mouvement. Revenez lentement. Gardez votre noyau stable.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Contractez vos abdominaux tout au long de l\'exercice. Contrôlez la phase excentrique.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'N’étendez pas trop les bras pendant la phase d’ouverture. Concentrez-vous sur la contraction de la poitrine.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Ne laissez pas votre dos se cambrer. Commencez par des déploiements partiels.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Ne laissez pas vos hanches s’affaisser vers le bas. Rétractez vos omoplates.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Ne soulevez pas vos hanches. Maintenez la contraction en haut pendant une seconde.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Ne bloquez pas vos genoux en extension. Les pieds plus hauts sur la plateforme engagent davantage les fessiers.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Ne vous tirez pas le cou. Concentrez-vous sur la contraction abdominale.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Ne levez pas les bras au-dessus de la hauteur des épaules. Faites pivoter légèrement vos poignets vers le bas (comme si vous versiez de l’eau) pour isoler le deltoïde latéral.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Ne soulevez pas vos hanches. Gardez vos épaules au-dessus de vos poignets.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'N’arrondissez à aucun moment votre dos. Engagez votre cœur avant de tirer.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'N\'arrondissez pas le dos. Contrôlez la phase excentrique.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'N\'arrondissez pas le dos. Contrôlez la phase d’étirement.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'N\'arrondissez pas le dos. Commencez avec un poids léger.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Do not use body swing. Concentrez-vous sur l’isolement du moyen fessier.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'N\'utilisez pas l\'élan. Concentrez-vous sur l’isolement des adducteurs.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'N\'utilisez pas l\'élan. Concentrez-vous sur la contraction.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Les haltères permettent une plus grande amplitude de mouvement. Gardez vos omoplates rétractées tout au long du mouvement.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'Pieds plus larges que la largeur des épaules avec les orteils pointés vers l’extérieur. Abaissez la barre en saisissant la barre avec une poignée intérieure. Poussez avec vos jambes et étendez vos hanches simultanément en gardant le dos droit.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Fléchissez vos coudes en ramenant le poids vers vos épaules. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Étendez complètement vos bras dans la phase concentrique. Revenez lentement à la position de départ en contrôlant le mouvement.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Saisissez la barre avec une prise en pronation à la largeur des épaules. En commençant avec les bras tendus, tirez votre corps vers le haut jusqu\'à ce que votre menton dépasse la barre. Redescendez lentement jusqu’à la position de départ.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Saisissez la barre en supination (paumes face à vous) à la largeur des épaules. En commençant avec les bras tendus, tirez votre corps vers le haut jusqu\'à ce que votre menton dépasse la barre. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Saisissez les barres parallèles avec les bras tendus. Abaissez votre corps en vous penchant légèrement en avant et en pliant les coudes. Push up pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'Suspendu à la barre ou allongé, levez vos jambes vers le haut en contrôlant le mouvement. Abaissez lentement.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'Les coudes hauts empêchent la barre de glisser. Cela nécessite une mobilité importante du poignet et de la cheville.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Maintenez la contraction en haut pendant une seconde. Évitez l\'élan.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Maintenez la contraction en haut pendant une seconde. Gardez votre menton vers votre poitrine.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Maintenez la contraction en haut. Évitez de compenser avec votre dos.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Tenez les extrémités de la corde à vos côtés. Faites pivoter la corde au-dessus de votre tête et sautez lorsqu\'elle passe sous vos pieds.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'En position couchée, appuyée sur vos avant-bras et vos orteils. Votre corps forme une ligne droite de la tête aux talons. Tenez en contractant votre cœur.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'En position couchée, les mains à la largeur des épaules. Abaissez votre poitrine vers le sol en pliant les coudes. Poussez vers le haut pour revenir à la position de départ en gardant votre corps en ligne droite.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'En position de pompes. Alternativement, ramenez rapidement vos genoux vers votre poitrine tout en gardant vos hanches basses.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'En position de position divisée. Abaissez votre corps en pliant votre genou avant. Poussez vers le haut pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Gardez le pied opposé complètement au sol. Torse droit.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Gardez le haut du bras parallèle au sol. Évitez l\'élan.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Gardez vos bras tendus. Concentrez-vous sur la dernière contraction.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Gardez votre dos plat et votre corps engagé. Évitez de balancer votre torse.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Gardez votre dos dans une position neutre. Tirez vers votre taille ou votre poitrine. Contractez les muscles de votre dos à la fin du mouvement.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Gardez votre dos parallèle au sol. Faites légèrement pivoter votre torse à la fin du mouvement.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Gardez votre poitrine relevée et vos genoux alignés avec vos orteils. Ne laissez pas vos genoux s’effondrer vers l’intérieur.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Gardez votre cœur engagé et votre dos droit. Évitez d’hyperétendre votre colonne lombaire.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Gardez votre cœur engagé pour protéger votre dos. Évitez d’hyperétendre votre colonne lombaire.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Gardez votre cœur engagé. Adaptez la vitesse à votre niveau de forme physique.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Gardez votre cœur engagé. Évitez d’hyperétendre votre colonne vertébrale.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Gardez vos coudes à hauteur d’épaule ou légèrement au-dessus. Indispensable pour la santé de la coiffe des rotateurs.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Gardez vos coudes près de votre corps. Évitez d\'évaser vos coudes.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Gardez vos coudes fixés à vos côtés. La prise neutre met l\'accent sur le brachioradial par rapport au biceps.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Gardez vos coudes fixes et pointés vers le plafond. Contrôlez la descente.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Gardez vos coudes fixes tout au long du mouvement. Concentrez-vous sur la contraction complète en haut.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Gardez vos coudes fixes. N\'utilisez pas l\'élan.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Gardez vos coudes fixes. Concentrez-vous sur la contraction complète.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Gardez vos coudes fixes. Concentrez-vous sur l’extension complète.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Gardez vos coudes pointés vers le plafond et près de votre tête. La tête longue est activée au maximum en position tendue.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Gardez votre genou avant aligné avec vos orteils. Il corrige les déséquilibres musculaires entre les jambes.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Gardez votre talon au sol. Pliez le genou pour étirer le soléaire.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Gardez vos hanches alignées. Évitez de les laisser s\'affaisser vers le bas.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Gardez vos sauts bas. Utilisez vos poignets, et non vos bras, pour faire tourner la corde.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Gardez votre genou pointé vers le sol. Évitez d’hyperétendre votre dos.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Gardez vos genoux alignés avec vos orteils. La position du pied modifie le muscle le plus sollicité.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Gardez vos genoux alignés avec vos orteils. La position sumo réduit le trajet des haltères.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Gardez votre bassin au niveau. Commencez avec un poids léger.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Gardez vos omoplates rétractées. Contrôlez la descente pendant au moins 2 secondes.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Gardez vos épaules détendues. Adaptez le rythme à l’intensité souhaitée.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Gardez votre torse stable en évitant de vous balancer. Contrôlez la descente.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Gardez votre torse droit et votre tronc engagé. Évitez de laisser votre genou avant dépasser vos orteils.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Gardez votre torse vertical pour isoler les triceps. Plus vous descendez, plus l’engagement de la poitrine est important.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Gardez vos poignets dans une position neutre. La boucle inversée renforce les muscles de l’avant-bras.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'A genoux avec la roue devant. Faites rouler la roue vers l’avant en abaissant votre corps vers le sol. Tirez la roue vers vos genoux.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Se pencher en avant augmente l’engagement de la poitrine. La position verticale isole les triceps.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Allongez-vous avec les genoux pliés. Amenez vos épaules vers vos genoux en contractant vos abdominaux. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Allongez-vous avec les jambes relevées. Ramenez vos genoux vers votre poitrine en soulevant votre bassin. Revenez lentement.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Allongez-vous face contre terre sur la machine avec des coussinets sur vos chevilles. Fléchissez vos genoux en ramenant vos talons vers vos fessiers. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc avec un haltère dans chaque main. Abaissez les haltères vers votre poitrine en gardant vos poignets stables. Poussez fermement vers le haut pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc avec un haltère dans chaque main. Abaissez vos bras latéralement en maintenant une légère flexion du coude. Amenez les haltères vers le haut en formant un arc comme si vous étreigniez un arbre. Revenez lentement.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc avec une prise à la largeur des épaules. Abaissez la barre en gardant vos coudes près de votre torse. Poussez vers le haut en serrant vos triceps.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc avec l\'outil au-dessus de votre poitrine, les bras tendus. Fléchissez vos coudes en abaissant le poids vers votre front. Prolongez le retour à la position.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc avec l\'outil au-dessus de votre poitrine, les bras presque étendus. Abaissez le poids derrière votre tête en gardant vos coudes légèrement pliés. Revenez à la position de départ en arc de cercle.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc, les pieds sur le sol. Saisissez la barre plus large que la largeur des épaules. Abaissez la barre sur votre poitrine en gardant vos coudes à environ 45 degrés. Poussez fermement vers le haut.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Allongez-vous sur le banc décliné avec vos pieds sécurisés. Saisissez l’outil plus large que la largeur des épaules. Abaisser jusqu\'au bas de la poitrine. Poussez fermement pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Allongez-vous sur le support incliné avec les poids suspendus. Tirez vers votre torse en contractant vos dorsaux. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Abaissez-vous en position accroupie, puis sautez vers le haut de manière explosive. Atterrissez doucement en pliant les genoux.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Abaissez-vous en position accroupie, placez vos mains sur le sol et sautez vos pieds en position de pompes. Effectuez des pompes, sautez vos pieds vers vos mains, puis sautez avec vos bras au-dessus de votre tête.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Maintenez un rythme constant. Posture correcte tout au long de l’exercice.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Maintenez une posture droite avec une légère inclinaison vers l’avant. Alternez les étapes à un rythme constant. Atterrissez avec votre pied à mi-pas.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Maintenez la même flexion du coude tout au long du mouvement. Concentrez-vous sur la contraction thoracique à la fin du mouvement.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Maintenez le même pli du coude. Contrôlez la descente pendant 2 secondes.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Maintenez la légère courbure du coude. Le pull est l\'un des rares exercices qui étire les dorsaux.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Tension modérée, jamais de douleur. Expirez en vous étirant.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'À quatre pattes ou debout près du câble. Étendez votre jambe vers l\'arrière en serrant le fessier. Revenez lentement.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'Sur le côté, appuyé sur votre avant-bras, le corps en ligne droite. Soulevez vos hanches en maintenant la position.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Pédalez en maintenant un rythme constant. Gardez votre dos dans une position neutre.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Effectuez la phase de levage avec une prise en supination. Faites pivoter vos poignets vers la pronation en haut. Abaissez avec une prise en pronation. Retour en supination en bas.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Effectuez le mouvement en contrôlant les phases excentriques et concentriques. Gardez votre cœur engagé.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Effectuez le mouvement en contrôlant les phases excentriques et concentriques. Gardez vos omoplates rétractées.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Effectuez le mouvement de manière explosive vers le haut ou vers l’avant. Atterrissez doucement en pliant les genoux. Contrôlez l\'atterrissage.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. La pause en bas augmente l\'étirement du mollet.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Effectuez la rotation de manière fluide et continue. La presse Arnold est l’un des rares exercices qui sollicite toutes les fibres musculaires.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Placez vos mains en forme de losange sous votre poitrine. Abaissez votre corps en gardant vos coudes près de votre torse. Poussez vers le haut en serrant vos triceps.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Positionnez-vous dans la machine hack squat avec les épaules sous les coussinets. Descendez en pliant les genoux à 90 degrés puis poussez vers le haut.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Poussez principalement avec le pied sur la surface surélevée. Gardez votre torse droit.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Poussez avec vos jambes, puis penchez votre torse en arrière, enfin tirez la rame vers votre abdomen. Inversez la commande au retour.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Nécessite une excellente mobilité des épaules, des hanches et des chevilles. Commencez sans poids.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Rétractez vos omoplates et gardez-les verrouillées. Ne faites pas rebondir le poids sur votre poitrine.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Rétractez vos omoplates pour stabiliser l’épaule.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Faites une rotation à partir de la taille, pas seulement à partir des bras.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Faites pivoter votre torse en amenant un coude vers le genou opposé. Répétez de l’autre côté.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Faites pivoter votre poignet vers l\'extérieur en haut pour maximiser la pointe. Gardez votre torse stable.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Assis avec des haltères à hauteur d’épaule et les paumes face à vous. Appuyez vers le haut en faisant pivoter vos poignets vers l’extérieur jusqu’à ce que vos paumes soient tournées vers l’avant. Abaissez en revenant à la position initiale.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Assis avec votre coude posé sur l’intérieur de votre cuisse. Fléchissez votre coude en amenant l\'haltère vers votre épaule. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Assis, les pieds surélevés et le torse à 45 degrés. Faites pivoter votre torse d’un côté à l’autre en amenant vos mains au sol à côté de vos hanches.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Séquence : jambes puis torse puis bras pendant la traction.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Asseyez-vous devant la machine à tirage latéral et saisissez la barre avec une large prise en pronation. Tirez la barre vers votre poitrine en inclinant légèrement votre torse vers l\'arrière. Contrôler le retour à la position de départ.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Asseyez-vous devant la machine à tirage latéral avec une prise proche ou neutre. Tirez la barre vers votre poitrine en gardant vos coudes près de votre corps. Contrôlez le retour.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Asseyez-vous au niveau du câble bas avec vos pieds sur les supports. Tirez la poignée vers votre taille en gardant le dos droit. Contractez les muscles de votre dos et revenez lentement.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Asseyez-vous devant la machine avec des coussinets sur vos chevilles. Étendez vos jambes vers le haut en contractant vos quadriceps. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Asseyez-vous devant la machine avec des coussinets sur vos chevilles. Fléchissez vos genoux en ramenant vos talons vers vos fessiers. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Asseyez-vous sur le banc du prédicateur, les bras posés sur le coussin. Fléchissez vos coudes en amenant l\'outil vers vos épaules. Abaissez lentement presque jusqu’à l’extension complète.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Asseyez-vous dans la machine, le dos appuyé contre le coussin. Placez vos coudes sur les coussinets. Amenez vos bras vers le centre en contractant votre poitrine. Revenez lentement à la position de départ.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Asseyez-vous dans la machine avec vos pieds sur la plate-forme à la largeur des hanches. Abaissez en pliant les genoux à 90 degrés. Poussez en étendant les jambes.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Asseyez-vous sur le banc incliné, les pieds sur le sol. Saisissez l’outil plus large que la largeur des épaules. Abaisser jusqu\'au niveau supérieur de la poitrine. Poussez fermement pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Asseyez-vous avec vos avant-bras sur vos cuisses. Saisissez l\'outil avec une poignée en supination. Fléchissez vos poignets vers le haut et descendez lentement.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Écartez la corde en bas pour maximiser la contraction. Gardez vos coudes fixes.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Debout au centre du câble avec une poignée par main. Gardez vos bras légèrement pliés. Amenez vos mains vers le centre en les croisant. Revenez lentement à la position de départ.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'Debout au câble haut avec la corde. Gardez vos coudes fixés sur les côtés de votre torse. Poussez la corde vers le bas en séparant les extrémités. Revenez lentement.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'Debout au câble haut. Gardez vos coudes fixés sur les côtés de votre torse. Poussez vers le bas en étendant complètement vos bras. Revenez lentement.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Debout face au câble haut, les bras presque tendus. Amenez la barre vers vos cuisses en formant un arc de cercle en gardant les bras tendus. Revenez lentement à la position de départ.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Debout devant un banc. Placez un pied sur la surface surélevée et poussez vers le haut. Abaissez lentement en contrôlant le mouvement.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'Debout sur une jambe. Abaissez votre torse vers l’avant en gardant le dos droit tandis que votre jambe libre s’étend derrière. Revenez à la position verticale en serrant vos fessiers.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'Debout ou assis avec l\'outil à hauteur d\'épaule. Poussez vers le haut en étendant complètement vos bras. Descendez lentement en revenant à la position de départ avec le poids à hauteur d’épaule.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'Debout ou assis avec l\'outil à hauteur d\'épaule. Poussez vers le haut en étendant complètement vos bras. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'Debout ou assis avec l\'outil au-dessus de votre tête, bras tendus. Fléchissez vos coudes en abaissant le poids derrière votre tête. Prolongez le retour vers le haut.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Debout avec un haltère dans chaque main à vos côtés. Levez vos bras latéralement à la hauteur des épaules en gardant les coudes légèrement pliés. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Debout avec un poids dans chaque main à vos côtés. Levez vos épaules vers vos oreilles en serrant vos pièges. Maintenez la contraction pendant une seconde puis abaissez-la lentement.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Debout avec des haltères à vos côtés avec une prise neutre (pouce levé). Fléchissez vos coudes en amenant les haltères vers vos épaules. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Debout, les pieds à la largeur des hanches. Charnière au niveau des hanches en balançant le poids entre vos jambes, puis poussez vos hanches vers l\'avant de manière explosive en balançant le poids jusqu\'à la hauteur des épaules.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Debout, les pieds à la largeur des hanches. Abaissez la barre le long de vos jambes en gardant les genoux légèrement pliés et le dos droit. Descendez jusqu’à ressentir une tension au niveau des ischio-jambiers puis remontez.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Debout, les pieds à la largeur des hanches. Abaissez-vous avec le dos droit et la poitrine relevée. Poussez vos pieds dans le sol et étendez simultanément les hanches et les genoux en gardant la barre près de vos jambes.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Debout, les pieds à la largeur des épaules, tenez un haltère devant votre poitrine. Descendez en gardant la poitrine relevée. Remontez en poussant sur vos talons.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Debout, les pieds à la largeur des épaules. Abaissez votre corps en pliant les genoux et les hanches comme si vous étiez assis sur une chaise. Descendez jusqu\'à ce que vos cuisses soient parallèles au sol. Poussez sur vos talons.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Debout, les pieds joints. Faites un large pas latéral en gardant le pied opposé fixe. Abaissez vers ce côté en pliant le genou.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Debout avec la barre sur les épaules. Penchez votre torse vers l’avant en gardant le dos droit et les genoux légèrement fléchis. Sentez l\'étirement de vos ischio-jambiers. Revenez à la position verticale.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Debout avec l\'outil devant vos cuisses en utilisant une prise en pronation. Tirez vers votre menton en gardant vos coudes plus hauts que vos poignets. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Debout avec l’outil devant vos cuisses. Levez vos bras devant vous à la hauteur des épaules en gardant les coudes légèrement pliés. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Se tenir debout avec l\'outil en pronation (paumes vers le bas). Fléchissez vos coudes en amenant l\'outil vers vos épaules. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Se tenir debout avec l\'outil en utilisant une poignée en supination. Fléchissez vos coudes en amenant l\'outil vers vos épaules en gardant vos coudes fixés sur les côtés de votre torse. Abaissez lentement en revenant à la position de départ.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Debout, le torse incliné à 45 degrés. Saisissez la barre avec une prise en pronation. Tirez vers votre abdomen en gardant votre dos neutre. Abaissez lentement.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Debout, les talons hors du bord d’une plate-forme. Mettez-vous sur la pointe des pieds en serrant vos mollets. Abaissez lentement en permettant à vos talons de descendre en dessous du niveau de la plateforme.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Commencez à un rythme modéré et augmentez progressivement.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Commencez par la rétraction des omoplates. Contrôlez la phase excentrique.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Commencez par la rétraction des omoplates. Ne penchez pas votre torse trop en arrière.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Commencez le mouvement à partir de la rétraction des omoplates. Évitez d\'utiliser l\'élan.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Commencez le mouvement à partir de la rétraction des omoplates. Contrôlez la phase d’allongement.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Reculez en abaissant votre genou arrière vers le sol. Le genou avant reste aligné avec la cheville.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Avancez en abaissant votre genou arrière vers le sol. Le genou avant reste aligné avec la cheville. Repoussez.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Avancez en abaissant votre genou arrière. Continuez à avancer en alternant les jambes continuellement.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Entrez dans la barre du piège. Pieds à la largeur des hanches. Abaissez-vous en saisissant les poignées avec le dos droit. Poussez sur vos pieds en étendant simultanément les hanches et les genoux.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Faites de longs pas pour engager davantage vos fessiers.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'Le curl Zottman entraîne à la fois la flexion et l’extension de l’avant-bras.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'La barre doit effleurer vos jambes tout au long du mouvement. Concentrez-vous sur l’étirement des ischio-jambiers pendant la descente.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Plus la surface est haute, plus le haut de la poitrine travaille.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Le banc incliné met en valeur le haut de la poitrine. Gardez vos omoplates rétractées tout au long du mouvement.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'La version inclinée est plus facile et engage le bas de la poitrine.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Plus votre corps est horizontal, plus il est dur. Gardez toujours votre cœur engagé.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'Le mouvement vient des hanches et non du dos. Gardez le dos droit pendant la phase de poussée.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'Le banc du prédicateur élimine l’utilisation de l’élan. Ne laissez pas le poids tomber vers le bas.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'La fente inversée est plus sûre pour les genoux que la fente avant.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'La rotation vient de la taille et non de la tête.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'La flexion des jambes assises augmente l’amplitude des mouvements. Évitez de soulever vos fessiers du siège.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'Le support élimine le stress lombaire. Concentrez-vous sur la rétraction.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'La barre de piège réduit le stress sur la colonne vertébrale. Gardez vos épaules alignées avec les poignées.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'Le poids devant aide à la posture verticale. Gardez vos genoux alignés.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Utilisez un poids léger. Gardez vos avant-bras toujours sur vos cuisses.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Avec une main et un genou sur le banc. Tirez l\'haltère vers votre côté en gardant votre coude près de votre corps. Abaissez lentement.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Avec la barre au-dessus de votre tête, descendez en position accroupie en gardant vos bras tendus et stables. Remontez en gardant la barre alignée.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Avec vos bras devant le câble ou avec des haltères, tirez l\'outil vers votre visage en gardant les coudes hauts. Séparez vos mains en ramenant vos poings près de vos oreilles. Revenez lentement.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Avec votre corps incliné sous une barre basse, saisissez avec une prise en pronation. Tirez votre poitrine vers la barre en gardant votre corps rigide. Abaissez lentement.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Avec vos pieds sur une surface surélevée, abaissez votre poitrine vers le sol. Push up pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Avec vos mains sur une surface surélevée, abaissez votre poitrine vers vos mains. Push up pour revenir à la position de départ.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Avec vos mains sur le bord d’un banc, avancez avec vos fessiers sortis. Abaissez votre corps en pliant les coudes à 90 degrés. Faire monter.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Avec votre torse incliné et votre coude plié à 90 degrés, étendez votre bras vers l’arrière jusqu’à l’extension complète. Revenez lentement.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Avec le haut du dos sur un banc et le poids sur les hanches. Poussez vos hanches vers le haut en serrant vos fessiers. Revenez lentement.',
    },
    'de': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'Führe die Bewegung langsam und kontrolliert aus. Halte eine korrekte Haltung.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Beginne mit einem moderaten Gewicht, um die Technik zu meistern.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Atme tief. Zwinge dich nie über deinen natürlichen Bereich hinaus.',
      'Breathe deeply. Do not force beyond your limit.': 'Atme tief. Gehe nicht über deine Grenzen hinaus.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Halte den Rumpf während der ganzen Übung angespannt. Kontrolliere die exzentrische Phase.',
      'Focus on squeezing your glutes and keep your core stable.': 'Konzentriere dich auf die Gesäßmuskeln und halte den Rumpf stabil.',
      'Control both the eccentric and concentric phases of the movement.': 'Kontrolliere sowohl die exzentrische als auch die konzentrische Phase.',
      'Perform the movement under control and keep your core stable.': 'Führe die Bewegung kontrolliert aus und halte den Rumpf stabil.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': 'Halte den Rumpf während der gesamten Übung stabil.',
      'Avoid swinging. Control both the ascending and descending phases.': 'Vermeide Schwingen. Kontrolliere Auf- und Abwärtsphase.',
      'Lower slowly': 'Langsam senken', 'lower slowly': 'langsam senken',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Tief atmen',
      'Squeeze your glutes': 'Gesäß anspannen',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Nutze den vollen Bewegungsumfang.',
      'Keep your feet shoulder-width apart.': 'Halte die Füße schulterbreit auseinander.',
      'Bring your arms into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Bringe die Arme in die Dehnposition und halte 20-30 Sekunden.',
      'Bring your legs into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Bringe die Beine in die Dehnposition und halte 20-30 Sekunden.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'Ein fester Griff erhöht die Bewegungsfreiheit. Beginnen Sie mit dem Zurückziehen.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'Ein enger Griff isoliert den Trizeps. Halten Sie Ihren Körper in einer geraden Linie.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'Ein supinierter Griff erhöht den Einsatz des Bizeps. Vermeiden Sie Schwung.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Passen Sie den Sitz an: Ihre Knie sollten nicht überstreckt werden.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Landen Sie immer sanft. Blockieren Sie Ihre Knie nicht.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Vermeiden Sie Schwung. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf das Anheben des Beckens.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Vermeiden Sie es, Ihre Ellbogen über Schulterhöhe zu heben. Ein breiterer Griff verringert das Risiko eines Aufpralls.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Vermeiden Sie es, Ihre Schultern zu drehen. Konzentrieren Sie sich nur auf die vertikale Bewegung.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Vermeiden Sie es, Ihren Oberkörper zu schwingen. Kontrollieren Sie beide Phasen.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Hantel auf der Vorderseite der Schultern mit hohen Ellbogen. Beim Abstieg den Oberkörper möglichst senkrecht halten. Zurück nach oben drücken.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Bringen Sie Ihr Bein in eine gestreckte Position und halten Sie Ihren Oberkörper aufrecht. 20–30 Sekunden lang gedrückt halten.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Bringen Sie Ihr Bein mit geradem Rücken in eine Streckposition. Halten Sie die Position 20 bis 30 Sekunden lang und atmen Sie dabei tief ein.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Bringen Sie Ihr Bein in Abduktion nach außen und kontrollieren Sie die Bewegung. Kehren Sie langsam zurück. Halten Sie Ihren Rumpf stabil.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Bringen Sie Ihr Bein in Adduktion zur Mitte und kontrollieren Sie die Bewegung. Kehren Sie langsam zurück. Halten Sie Ihren Rumpf stabil.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Spannen Sie Ihre Bauchmuskeln während der gesamten Übung an. Kontrollieren Sie die exzentrische Phase.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'Überstrecken Sie Ihre Arme während der Öffnungsphase nicht. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Brustkontraktion.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Lassen Sie Ihren Rücken nicht durchwölben. Beginnen Sie mit Teil-Rollouts.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Lassen Sie Ihre Hüften nicht nach unten hängen. Ziehen Sie Ihre Schulterblätter zurück.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Heben Sie Ihre Hüften nicht an. Halten Sie die Kontraktion oben eine Sekunde lang gedrückt.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Blockieren Sie Ihre Knie nicht in Streckung. Füße, die höher auf der Plattform stehen, beanspruchen die Gesäßmuskulatur stärker.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Ziehen Sie nicht am Hals. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Bauchkontraktion.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Heben Sie Ihre Arme nicht über Schulterhöhe. Drehen Sie Ihre Handgelenke leicht nach unten (als würden Sie Wasser einschenken), um den seitlichen Deltamuskel zu isolieren.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Heben Sie Ihre Hüften nicht an. Halten Sie Ihre Schultern über Ihren Handgelenken.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'Runden Sie Ihren Rücken zu keinem Zeitpunkt ab. Spannen Sie Ihren Rumpf an, bevor Sie ziehen.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Machen Sie Ihren Rücken nicht rund. Kontrollieren Sie die exzentrische Phase.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'Machen Sie Ihren Rücken nicht rund. Kontrollieren Sie die Dehnungsphase.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'Machen Sie Ihren Rücken nicht rund. Beginnen Sie mit einem leichten Gewicht.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Verwenden Sie keinen Körperschwung. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Isolierung des Gluteus medius.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'Verwenden Sie keinen Schwung. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Isolierung der Adduktoren.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'Verwenden Sie keinen Schwung. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Kontraktion.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Hanteln ermöglichen eine größere Bewegungsfreiheit. Halten Sie Ihre Schulterblätter während der gesamten Bewegung zurückgezogen.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'Füße breiter als schulterbreit, die Zehen zeigen nach außen. Senken Sie sich ab und greifen Sie die Hantel mit einem Innengriff. Drücken Sie mit den Beinen und strecken Sie die Hüften, während Sie gleichzeitig den Rücken gerade halten.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Beuge deine Ellenbogen und verlagere das Gewicht auf deine Schultern. Langsam absenken.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Strecken Sie Ihre Arme in der konzentrischen Phase vollständig aus. Kehren Sie langsam in die Ausgangsposition zurück und kontrollieren Sie die Bewegung.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Fassen Sie die Stange mit einem pronierten Griff auf Schulterbreite. Beginnen Sie mit ausgestreckten Armen und ziehen Sie Ihren Körper nach oben, bis Ihr Kinn die Stange freigibt. Senken Sie sich langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Fassen Sie die Stange mit supiniertem Griff (Handflächen zeigen zu Ihnen) auf Schulterbreite. Beginnen Sie mit ausgestreckten Armen und ziehen Sie Ihren Körper nach oben, bis Ihr Kinn die Stange freigibt. Langsam absenken.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Fassen Sie den Barren mit ausgestreckten Armen. Senken Sie Ihren Körper, indem Sie sich leicht nach vorne beugen und die Ellbogen beugen. Drücken Sie sich nach oben und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'Hängen Sie sich an die Stange oder legen Sie sich hin. Heben Sie Ihre Beine nach oben und steuern Sie die Bewegung. Langsam absenken.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'Hohe Ellenbogen verhindern ein Verrutschen der Hantel. Es erfordert eine erhebliche Beweglichkeit von Handgelenk und Knöchel.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Halten Sie die Kontraktion oben eine Sekunde lang gedrückt. Vermeiden Sie Schwung.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Halten Sie die Kontraktion oben eine Sekunde lang gedrückt. Halten Sie Ihr Kinn zur Brust.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Halten Sie die Kontraktion oben. Vermeiden Sie einen Ausgleich mit Ihrem Rücken.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Halten Sie die Enden des Seils an Ihren Seiten. Drehen Sie das Seil über Ihren Kopf und springen Sie, während es unter Ihren Füßen hindurchläuft.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'In Bauchlage auf Unterarmen und Zehen ruhend. Ihr Körper bildet vom Kopf bis zu den Fersen eine gerade Linie. Halten Sie, indem Sie Ihren Rumpf anspannen.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'In Bauchlage mit schulterbreit auseinander liegenden Händen. Senken Sie Ihre Brust zum Boden, indem Sie Ihre Ellbogen beugen. Drücken Sie nach oben und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück, wobei Sie Ihren Körper in einer geraden Linie halten.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'In einer Liegestützposition. Bringen Sie abwechselnd Ihre Knie schnell zur Brust und halten Sie dabei Ihre Hüften niedrig.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'In einer geteilten Haltung. Senken Sie Ihren Körper, indem Sie Ihr vorderes Knie beugen. Drücken Sie nach oben und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Lassen Sie den gegenüberliegenden Fuß vollständig auf dem Boden. Oberkörper aufrecht.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Halten Sie den Oberarm parallel zum Boden. Vermeiden Sie Schwung.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Arme gerade. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Lat-Kontraktion.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Rücken flach und Ihren Rumpf angespannt. Vermeiden Sie es, Ihren Oberkörper zu schwingen.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Rücken in einer neutralen Position. Ziehen Sie in Richtung Ihrer Taille oder Brust. Spannen Sie am Ende der Bewegung Ihre Rückenmuskulatur an.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Rücken parallel zum Boden. Drehen Sie Ihren Oberkörper am Ende der Bewegung leicht.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Brust hoch und Ihre Knie auf einer Linie mit Ihren Zehen. Lassen Sie Ihre Knie nicht nach innen kollabieren.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Rumpf angespannt und Ihren Rücken gerade. Vermeiden Sie eine Überdehnung Ihrer Lendenwirbelsäule.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Rumpf angespannt, um Ihren Rücken zu schützen. Vermeiden Sie eine Überdehnung Ihrer Lendenwirbelsäule.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Kern in Bewegung. Passen Sie die Geschwindigkeit an Ihr Fitnessniveau an.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Kern in Bewegung. Vermeiden Sie eine Überstreckung Ihrer Wirbelsäule.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen auf Schulterhöhe oder leicht darüber. Unverzichtbar für die Gesundheit der Rotatorenmanschette.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellenbogen nah am Körper. Vermeiden Sie es, Ihre Ellbogen zu strecken.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen fest an Ihren Seiten. Der neutrale Griff betont den Brachioradialis über dem Bizeps.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen fest und zeigen Sie zur Decke. Kontrollieren Sie den Abstieg.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellenbogen während der gesamten Bewegung fixiert. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die volle Kontraktion oben.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellenbogen fixiert. Verwenden Sie keinen Schwung.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellenbogen fixiert. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die vollständige Kontraktion.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellenbogen fixiert. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Vollausdehnung.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen zur Decke und nahe an Ihrem Kopf. Der lange Kopf wird in der gestreckten Position maximal aktiviert.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Halten Sie Ihr vorderes Knie in einer Linie mit Ihren Zehen. Es korrigiert Muskelungleichgewichte zwischen den Beinen.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Ferse auf dem Boden. Beugen Sie Ihr Knie, um den Soleus zu strecken.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Hüften ausgerichtet. Vermeiden Sie es, sie nach unten durchhängen zu lassen.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Sprünge niedrig. Benutzen Sie Ihre Handgelenke, nicht Ihre Arme, um das Seil zu drehen.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Halten Sie Ihr Knie zum Boden zeigend. Vermeiden Sie eine Überdehnung Ihres Rückens.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Knie auf einer Linie mit Ihren Zehen. Die Fußposition verändert den am stärksten beanspruchten Muskel.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Knie auf einer Linie mit Ihren Zehen. Die Sumo-Haltung verkürzt den Langhantelweg.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Halten Sie Ihr Becken gerade. Beginnen Sie mit einem leichten Gewicht.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Schulterblätter zurückgezogen. Kontrollieren Sie den Abstieg mindestens 2 Sekunden lang.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Schultern entspannt. Passen Sie das Tempo an die gewünschte Intensität an.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Oberkörper stabil und vermeiden Sie Schwingungen. Kontrollieren Sie den Abstieg.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Oberkörper aufrecht und den Rumpf angespannt. Vermeiden Sie, dass Ihr vorderes Knie über Ihre Zehen hinausragt.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Oberkörper vertikal, um den Trizeps zu isolieren. Je tiefer Sie gehen, desto größer ist der Eingriff in die Brust.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Halten Sie Ihre Handgelenke in einer neutralen Position. Der umgekehrte Curl stärkt die Unterarmmuskulatur.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'Kniend mit dem Rad nach vorne. Rollen Sie das Rad nach vorne und senken Sie Ihren Körper in Richtung Boden. Ziehen Sie das Rad zurück in Richtung Ihrer Knie.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Wenn Sie sich nach vorne beugen, erhöht sich der Eingriff in die Brust. Die vertikale Position isoliert den Trizeps.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Legen Sie sich mit gebeugten Knien hin. Bringen Sie Ihre Schultern zu Ihren Knien und spannen Sie Ihre Bauchmuskeln an. Langsam absenken.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Legen Sie sich mit erhobenen Beinen hin. Bringen Sie Ihre Knie zur Brust und heben Sie Ihr Becken an. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Legen Sie sich mit Polstern an den Knöcheln mit dem Gesicht nach unten auf die Maschine. Beugen Sie Ihre Knie und bringen Sie Ihre Fersen in Richtung Ihrer Gesäßmuskulatur. Langsam absenken.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Legen Sie sich mit einer Hantel in jeder Hand auf die Bank. Senken Sie die Hanteln in Richtung Brust und halten Sie Ihre Handgelenke stabil. Drücken Sie fest nach oben und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Legen Sie sich mit einer Hantel in jeder Hand auf die Bank. Senken Sie Ihre Arme seitlich und behalten Sie dabei eine leichte Ellbogenbeugung bei. Führen Sie die Hanteln in einem Bogen nach oben, als ob Sie einen Baum umarmen würden. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Legen Sie sich mit schulterbreitem Griff auf die Bank. Senken Sie die Hantel ab und halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen nah am Oberkörper. Drücken Sie nach oben und spannen Sie dabei Ihren Trizeps an.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Legen Sie sich mit ausgestreckten Armen auf die Bank, das Gerät über der Brust. Beugen Sie Ihre Ellenbogen und senken Sie das Gewicht in Richtung Stirn. Verlängern Sie die Position und kehren Sie in die Position zurück.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Legen Sie sich auf die Bank, das Gerät über der Brust und die Arme fast ausgestreckt. Senken Sie das Gewicht hinter Ihren Kopf und halten Sie die Ellbogen leicht gebeugt. Kehren Sie in einem Bogen in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Legen Sie sich mit den Füßen auf den Boden auf die Bank. Greifen Sie die Hantel breiter als schulterbreit. Senken Sie die Hantel auf Ihre Brust und halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen in einem Winkel von etwa 45 Grad. Drücken Sie fest nach oben.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Legen Sie sich mit gesicherten Füßen auf die Absenkbank. Fassen Sie das Gerät breiter als schulterbreit an. Bis zur unteren Brust senken. Drücken Sie fest und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Legen Sie sich mit hängenden Gewichten auf die geneigte Unterlage. Ziehen Sie sich in Richtung Ihres Oberkörpers und ziehen Sie Ihre Latissimusmuskeln zusammen. Langsam absenken.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Gehen Sie in die Hocke und springen Sie dann explosionsartig nach oben. Landen Sie sanft, indem Sie die Knie beugen.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Gehen Sie in die Hocke, legen Sie Ihre Hände auf den Boden und springen Sie mit den Füßen in eine Liegestützposition. Machen Sie einen Liegestütz, springen Sie mit den Füßen zu den Händen und springen Sie dann mit den Armen über dem Kopf nach oben.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Behalten Sie ein gleichmäßiges Tempo bei. Korrekte Körperhaltung während der gesamten Übung.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Behalten Sie eine aufrechte Haltung mit einer leichten Vorwärtsneigung bei. Wechseln Sie die Schritte in gleichmäßigem Tempo ab. Landen Sie mit dem Fuß in der Mitte des Schrittes.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Behalten Sie während der gesamten Bewegung die gleiche Ellenbogenbeugung bei. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Brustkontraktion am Ende der Bewegung.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Behalten Sie die gleiche Ellenbogenbeuge bei. Kontrollieren Sie den Abstieg 2 Sekunden lang.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Behalten Sie die leichte Ellenbogenbeugung bei. Der Pullover ist eine der wenigen Übungen, die den Latissimus streckt.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Mäßige Spannung, nie Schmerzen. Atme aus, während du dich dehnst.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'Auf Händen und Knien oder stehend am Kabel. Strecken Sie Ihr Bein nach hinten und spannen Sie dabei den Gesäßmuskel an. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'Auf der Seite auf dem Unterarm ruhend, der Körper in einer geraden Linie. Heben Sie Ihre Hüften an und behalten Sie die Position bei.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Treten Sie in gleichmäßigem Tempo in die Pedale. Halten Sie Ihren Rücken in einer neutralen Position.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Führen Sie die Hebephase mit supiniertem Griff durch. Drehen Sie Ihre Handgelenke nach oben in die Pronation. Mit proniertem Griff absenken. Kehren Sie nach unten in die Supination zurück.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Führen Sie die Bewegung aus und kontrollieren Sie sowohl die exzentrische als auch die konzentrische Phase. Halten Sie Ihren Kern in Bewegung.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Führen Sie die Bewegung aus und kontrollieren Sie sowohl die exzentrische als auch die konzentrische Phase. Halten Sie Ihre Schulterblätter zurückgezogen.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Führen Sie die Bewegung explosionsartig nach oben oder nach vorne aus. Landen Sie sanft, indem Sie die Knie beugen. Kontrollieren Sie die Landung.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Führen Sie die Bewegung in beiden Phasen langsam aus. Die Pause unten erhöht die Wadendehnung.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Führen Sie die Rotation flüssig und kontinuierlich durch. Die Arnold-Presse ist eine der wenigen Übungen, die alle Muskelfasern beansprucht.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Positionieren Sie Ihre Hände rautenförmig unter Ihrer Brust. Senken Sie Ihren Körper und halten Sie die Ellbogen nah am Oberkörper. Drücken Sie nach oben und spannen Sie dabei Ihren Trizeps an.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Positionieren Sie sich in der Hack-Squat-Maschine mit den Schultern unter den Polstern. Beim Abstieg die Knie im 90-Grad-Winkel beugen und dann nach oben drücken.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Schieben Sie hauptsächlich mit dem Fuß auf der erhöhten Fläche. Halten Sie Ihren Oberkörper aufrecht.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Drücken Sie mit den Beinen, lehnen Sie dann den Oberkörper nach hinten und ziehen Sie schließlich das Ruder in Richtung Bauch. Bei der Rücksendung die Reihenfolge umkehren.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Erfordert eine ausgezeichnete Beweglichkeit von Schulter, Hüfte und Knöchel. Beginnen Sie ohne Gewicht.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Ziehen Sie Ihre Schulterblätter ein und halten Sie sie fest. Lassen Sie das Gewicht nicht von Ihrer Brust abprallen.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Ziehen Sie Ihre Schulterblätter zurück, um die Schulter zu stabilisieren.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Drehen Sie von der Taille aus, nicht nur von den Armen.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Drehen Sie Ihren Oberkörper und bringen Sie einen Ellbogen zum gegenüberliegenden Knie. Von der anderen Seite wiederholen.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Drehen Sie Ihr Handgelenk oben nach außen, um die Spitze zu maximieren. Halten Sie Ihren Oberkörper stabil.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Sitzen mit Hanteln auf Schulterhöhe und den Handflächen zu Ihnen gerichtet. Drücken Sie nach oben und drehen Sie Ihre Handgelenke nach außen, bis Ihre Handflächen nach vorne zeigen. Senken Sie die Rückkehr in die Ausgangsposition.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Sitzen, der Ellenbogen ruht auf der Innenseite des Oberschenkels. Beugen Sie Ihren Ellbogen und bringen Sie die Hantel in Richtung Ihrer Schulter. Langsam absenken.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Sitzen Sie mit erhobenen Füßen und einem 45-Grad-Rumpf. Drehen Sie Ihren Oberkörper von einer Seite zur anderen und legen Sie Ihre Hände neben Ihren Hüften auf den Boden.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Reihenfolge: Beine, dann Rumpf, dann Arme beim Ziehen.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Setzen Sie sich an die Latzugmaschine und greifen Sie die Stange mit weitem Pronationsgriff. Ziehen Sie die Stange in Richtung Brust und neigen Sie Ihren Oberkörper leicht nach hinten. Kontrollieren Sie die Rückkehr in die Ausgangsposition.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Setzen Sie sich mit engem oder neutralem Griff an die Latzugmaschine. Ziehen Sie die Stange in Richtung Brust und halten Sie die Ellbogen nah am Körper. Kontrollieren Sie die Rückkehr.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Setzen Sie sich mit den Füßen auf die Stützen an das niedrige Kabel. Ziehen Sie den Griff in Richtung Ihrer Taille und halten Sie Ihren Rücken gerade. Spannen Sie Ihre Rückenmuskeln an und kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Setzen Sie sich mit Polstern an den Knöcheln an die Maschine. Strecken Sie Ihre Beine nach oben und kontrahieren Sie Ihren Quadrizeps. Langsam absenken.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Setzen Sie sich mit Polstern an den Knöcheln an die Maschine. Beugen Sie Ihre Knie und bringen Sie Ihre Fersen in Richtung Ihrer Gesäßmuskulatur. Langsam absenken.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Setzen Sie sich auf die Predigerbank und legen Sie Ihre Arme auf die Unterlage. Beugen Sie Ihre Ellbogen und bringen Sie das Gerät zu Ihren Schultern. Senken Sie sich langsam fast bis zur vollständigen Streckung ab.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Setzen Sie sich in die Maschine und stützen Sie Ihren Rücken auf dem Polster ab. Positionieren Sie Ihre Ellenbogen auf den Polstern. Bringen Sie Ihre Arme zur Mitte und ziehen Sie Ihre Brust zusammen. Kehren Sie langsam in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Setzen Sie sich in die Maschine und stellen Sie Ihre Füße hüftbreit auf die Plattform. Senken Sie die Position, indem Sie die Knie um 90 Grad beugen. Drücken Sie, indem Sie Ihre Beine ausstrecken.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Setzen Sie sich mit den Füßen auf den Boden auf die Schrägbank. Fassen Sie das Gerät breiter als schulterbreit an. Bis zur oberen Brusthöhe absenken. Drücken Sie fest und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Setzen Sie sich mit den Unterarmen auf die Oberschenkel. Fassen Sie das Gerät mit supiniertem Griff. Beugen Sie Ihre Handgelenke langsam nach oben und unten.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Spreizen Sie das Seil unten auseinander, um die Kontraktion zu maximieren. Halten Sie Ihre Ellenbogen fixiert.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Mit einem Griff pro Hand in der Mitte des Kabels stehen. Halten Sie Ihre Arme leicht gebeugt. Bringen Sie Ihre Hände zur Mitte und kreuzen Sie sie. Kehren Sie langsam in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'Mit dem Seil am Hochseil stehen. Halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen an den Seiten Ihres Oberkörpers fixiert. Schieben Sie das Seil nach unten und trennen Sie die Enden. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'Am Hochseil stehend. Halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen an den Seiten Ihres Oberkörpers fixiert. Drücken Sie die Arme vollständig nach unten. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Stehen Sie mit fast ausgestreckten Armen vor dem hohen Kabel. Führen Sie die Stange in einem Bogen zu Ihren Oberschenkeln und halten Sie dabei Ihre Arme gerade. Kehren Sie langsam in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Vor einer Bank stehen. Stellen Sie einen Fuß auf die erhöhte Fläche und drücken Sie ihn nach oben. Senken Sie sich langsam ab und kontrollieren Sie die Bewegung.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'Auf einem Bein stehend. Senken Sie Ihren Oberkörper nach vorne und halten Sie Ihren Rücken gerade, während Ihr freies Bein nach hinten gestreckt ist. Kehren Sie in die aufrechte Position zurück und spannen Sie dabei Ihre Gesäßmuskeln an.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'Stehend oder sitzend mit dem Gerät auf Schulterhöhe. Drücken Sie die Arme nach oben und strecken Sie sie vollständig aus. Senken Sie sich langsam ab und kehren Sie mit dem Gewicht auf Schulterhöhe in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'Stehend oder sitzend mit dem Gerät auf Schulterhöhe. Drücken Sie die Arme nach oben und strecken Sie sie vollständig aus. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'Stehend oder sitzend mit dem Gerät über dem Kopf und ausgestreckten Armen. Beugen Sie Ihre Ellenbogen und senken Sie das Gewicht hinter Ihrem Kopf. Verlängern Sie die Rückkehr nach oben.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Stehen Sie mit einer Hantel in jeder Hand an Ihrer Seite. Heben Sie Ihre Arme seitlich auf Schulterhöhe und halten Sie die Ellbogen leicht gebeugt. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Stehen Sie mit einem Gewicht in jeder Hand an Ihrer Seite. Heben Sie Ihre Schultern in Richtung Ihrer Ohren und drücken Sie Ihre Fallen zusammen. Halten Sie die Kontraktion eine Sekunde lang und senken Sie sie dann langsam ab.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Stehen Sie mit Hanteln an der Seite und neutralem Griff (Daumen nach oben). Beuge deine Ellenbogen und bringe die Hanteln zu deinen Schultern. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Stehend mit hüftbreiten Füßen. Bewegen Sie sich an den Hüften und schwingen Sie das Gewicht zwischen Ihren Beinen. Bewegen Sie dann Ihre Hüften explosionsartig nach vorne und schwingen Sie das Gewicht bis auf Schulterhöhe.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Stehend mit hüftbreiten Füßen. Senken Sie die Hantel entlang Ihrer Beine ab und halten Sie dabei die Knie leicht gebeugt und den Rücken gerade. Gehen Sie nach unten, bis Sie eine Spannung in den hinteren Oberschenkelmuskeln spüren, und kehren Sie dann nach oben zurück.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Stehend mit hüftbreiten Füßen. Senken Sie sich mit geradem Rücken und nach oben gerichteter Brust. Drücken Sie Ihre Füße in den Boden und strecken Sie Hüfte und Knie, während Sie gleichzeitig die Stange nah an Ihren Beinen halten.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Stehen Sie mit schulterbreit auseinander stehenden Füßen und halten Sie eine Hantel vor Ihre Brust. Steigen Sie ab und halten Sie die Brust hoch. Kehren Sie nach oben zurück, indem Sie sich durch die Fersen drücken.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Stehend mit schulterbreit auseinander stehenden Füßen. Senken Sie Ihren Körper, indem Sie Ihre Knie und Hüften beugen, als würden Sie auf einem Stuhl sitzen. Steigen Sie ab, bis Ihre Oberschenkel parallel zum Boden sind. Drücken Sie durch Ihre Fersen.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Stehend mit zusammengefügten Füßen. Machen Sie einen weiten Seitwärtsschritt und halten Sie dabei den gegenüberliegenden Fuß fest. Senken Sie sich zu dieser Seite ab, indem Sie Ihr Knie beugen.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Stehend mit der Hantel auf den Schultern. Lehnen Sie Ihren Oberkörper nach vorne, halten Sie den Rücken gerade und die Knie leicht gebeugt. Spüren Sie die Dehnung Ihrer Oberschenkelmuskulatur. Kehren Sie in die aufrechte Position zurück.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Stehen Sie mit dem Gerät vor Ihren Oberschenkeln und greifen Sie es pronativ. Ziehen Sie zum Kinn und halten Sie die Ellbogen höher als die Handgelenke. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Stehen Sie mit dem Gerät vor Ihren Oberschenkeln. Heben Sie Ihre Arme vor sich auf Schulterhöhe und halten Sie die Ellbogen leicht gebeugt. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Stehen mit dem Gerät mit proniertem Griff (Handflächen nach unten). Beugen Sie Ihre Ellbogen und bringen Sie das Gerät zu Ihren Schultern. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Stehen mit dem Gerät im supinierten Griff. Beugen Sie Ihre Ellbogen, bringen Sie das Gerät zu Ihren Schultern und halten Sie Ihre Ellbogen an den Seiten Ihres Oberkörpers fixiert. Senken Sie sich langsam ab und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Stehend mit um 45 Grad geneigtem Oberkörper. Fassen Sie die Hantel mit einem pronierten Griff. Ziehen Sie in Richtung Ihres Bauches und halten Sie Ihren Rücken neutral. Langsam absenken.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Stehen Sie mit den Fersen über der Kante einer Plattform. Stellen Sie sich auf die Zehenspitzen und drücken Sie dabei Ihre Waden. Senken Sie sich langsam ab, sodass Ihre Fersen unter die Plattformebene fallen.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Beginnen Sie mit einem moderaten Tempo und steigern Sie es allmählich.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Beginnen Sie mit dem Zurückziehen der Schulterblätter. Kontrollieren Sie die exzentrische Phase.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Beginnen Sie mit dem Zurückziehen der Schulterblätter. Lehnen Sie Ihren Oberkörper nicht zu weit nach hinten.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Beginnen Sie die Bewegung mit dem Zurückziehen der Schulterblätter. Vermeiden Sie Schwung.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Beginnen Sie die Bewegung mit dem Zurückziehen der Schulterblätter. Kontrollieren Sie die Verlängerungsphase.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Machen Sie einen Schritt nach hinten und senken Sie Ihr hinteres Knie in Richtung Boden. Das vordere Knie bleibt auf einer Linie mit dem Knöchel.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Machen Sie einen Schritt nach vorne und senken Sie Ihr hinteres Knie in Richtung Boden. Das vordere Knie bleibt auf einer Linie mit dem Knöchel. Zurück nach oben drücken.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Machen Sie einen Schritt nach vorne und senken Sie Ihr hinteres Knie. Machen Sie weiterhin abwechselnde Schritte vorwärts und wechseln Sie die Beine ab.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Betreten Sie die Fallenleiste. Füße hüftbreit. Senken Sie sich ab und fassen Sie die Griffe mit geradem Rücken. Drücken Sie durch Ihre Füße und strecken Sie gleichzeitig Hüfte und Knie.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Machen Sie lange Schritte, um Ihre Gesäßmuskulatur stärker zu beanspruchen.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'Der Zottman-Curl trainiert sowohl die Beugung als auch die Streckung des Unterarms.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'Die Stange sollte während der gesamten Bewegung Ihre Beine berühren. Konzentrieren Sie sich beim Abstieg auf die Dehnung der Oberschenkelmuskulatur.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Je höher die Oberfläche, desto stärker arbeitet die obere Brust.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Die Schrägbank betont die obere Brust. Halten Sie Ihre Schulterblätter während der gesamten Bewegung zurückgezogen.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'Die geneigte Version ist einfacher und greift in den unteren Brustbereich ein.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Je horizontaler Ihr Körper ist, desto schwieriger ist es. Halten Sie Ihren Kern immer in Bewegung.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'Die Bewegung kommt von der Hüfte, nicht vom Rücken. Halten Sie Ihren Rücken während der Schubphase gerade.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'Die Predigerbank macht den Einsatz von Schwung überflüssig. Lassen Sie das Gewicht nicht nach unten fallen.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'Der Ausfallschritt nach hinten ist sicherer für die Knie als der Ausfallschritt nach vorne.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'Die Drehung kommt von der Taille, nicht vom Kopf.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'Der Beinbeuger im Sitzen erhöht die Bewegungsfreiheit. Vermeiden Sie es, Ihre Gesäßmuskulatur vom Sitz abzuheben.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'Die Unterstützung beseitigt die Belastung der Lendenwirbelsäule. Konzentrieren Sie sich auf den Rückzug.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'Die Fangstange reduziert die Belastung der Wirbelsäule. Halten Sie Ihre Schultern in einer Linie mit den Griffen.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'Das Gewicht vorne hilft bei der vertikalen Haltung. Halten Sie Ihre Knie gerade.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Verwenden Sie ein leichtes Gewicht. Halten Sie Ihre Unterarme ruhig auf Ihren Oberschenkeln.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Mit einer Hand und einem Knie auf der Bank. Ziehen Sie die Hantel zu Ihrer Seite und halten Sie Ihren Ellenbogen nah am Körper. Langsam absenken.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Gehen Sie mit der Langhantel über dem Kopf in die Hocke und halten Sie Ihre Arme gerade und stabil. Kehren Sie nach oben zurück und halten Sie die Hantel ausgerichtet.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Ziehen Sie das Gerät mit den Armen vor dem Kabel oder mit Hanteln in Richtung Ihres Gesichts und halten Sie die Ellbogen hoch. Trennen Sie Ihre Hände und bringen Sie Ihre Fäuste in die Nähe Ihrer Ohren. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Halten Sie Ihren Körper unter einer niedrigen Stange geneigt und greifen Sie mit einem pronierten Griff. Ziehen Sie Ihre Brust zur Stange und halten Sie Ihren Körper steif. Langsam absenken.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Stellen Sie Ihre Füße auf eine erhöhte Fläche und senken Sie Ihre Brust zum Boden. Drücken Sie sich nach oben und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Legen Sie Ihre Hände auf eine erhöhte Fläche und senken Sie Ihre Brust in Richtung Ihrer Hände. Drücken Sie sich nach oben und kehren Sie in die Ausgangsposition zurück.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Legen Sie Ihre Hände auf die Kante einer Bank und machen Sie einen Schritt nach vorne, wobei Ihre Gesäßmuskulatur ausgestreckt ist. Senken Sie Ihren Körper und beugen Sie die Ellbogen um 90 Grad. Hochdrücken.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Strecken Sie Ihren Arm mit geneigtem Oberkörper und im 90-Grad-Winkel gebeugtem Ellbogen nach hinten bis zur vollständigen Streckung aus. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Mit dem oberen Rücken auf einer Bank und dem Gewicht auf den Hüften. Drücken Sie Ihre Hüften nach oben und spannen Sie dabei Ihre Gesäßmuskeln an. Kehren Sie langsam zurück.',
    },
    'el': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'Εκτέλεσε την κίνηση αργά και ελεγχόμενα. Διατήρησε σωστή στάση.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Ξεκίνα με μέτριο βάρος για να κατακτήσεις την τεχνική.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Ανάπνεε βαθιά. Μην πιέζεις ποτέ πέρα από το φυσικό σου εύρος.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': "Κράτα τον κορμό σφιγμένο καθ' όλη την άσκηση. Έλεγξε την εκκεντρική φάση.",
      'Focus on squeezing your glutes and keep your core stable.': 'Επικεντρώσου στη σύσπαση των γλουτών και κράτα τον κορμό σταθερό.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': "Κράτα τον κορμό σταθερό καθ' όλη τη διάρκεια της άσκησης.",
      'Lower slowly': 'Κατέβα αργά', 'lower slowly': 'κατέβα αργά',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Ανάπνεε βαθιά',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Χρησιμοποίησε πλήρες εύρος κίνησης.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'Μια στενή λαβή αυξάνει το εύρος κίνησης. Ξεκινήστε από την ανάκληση.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'Μια στενή λαβή απομονώνει τους τρικέφαλους. Κρατήστε το σώμα σας σε ευθεία γραμμή.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'Η ύπτια λαβή αυξάνει την εμπλοκή του δικεφάλου. Αποφύγετε τη χρήση ορμής.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Ρυθμίστε το κάθισμα: τα γόνατά σας δεν πρέπει να υπερεκτείνονται.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Πάντα να προσγειώνεστε απαλά. Μην κλειδώνετε τα γόνατά σας.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Αποφύγετε την ορμή. Επικεντρωθείτε στην ανύψωση της λεκάνης.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Αποφύγετε να σηκώνετε τους αγκώνες σας πάνω από το ύψος των ώμων. Ένα ευρύτερο κράτημα μειώνει τον κίνδυνο πρόσκρουσης.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Αποφύγετε την περιστροφή των ώμων σας. Εστιάστε μόνο στην κάθετη κίνηση.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Αποφύγετε να ταλαντεύετε τον κορμό σας. Ελέγξτε και τις δύο φάσεις.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Μπάρα στο μπροστινό μέρος των ώμων με ψηλούς αγκώνες. Κατεβείτε κρατώντας τον κορμό όσο πιο κατακόρυφο γίνεται. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Φέρτε το πόδι σας σε θέση τέντωμα κρατώντας τον κορμό σας όρθιο. Κρατήστε για 20-30 δευτερόλεπτα.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Φέρτε το πόδι σας σε θέση τέντωμα με την πλάτη σας ίσια. Κρατήστε για 20-30 δευτερόλεπτα αναπνέοντας βαθιά.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Φέρτε το πόδι σας προς τα έξω σε απαγωγή ελέγχοντας την κίνηση. Επιστρέψτε αργά. Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας σταθερό.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Φέρτε το πόδι σας προς το κέντρο στην προσαγωγή ελέγχοντας την κίνηση. Επιστρέψτε αργά. Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας σταθερό.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Συσπάστε τους κοιλιακούς σας καθ\' όλη τη διάρκεια της άσκησης. Ελέγξτε την έκκεντρη φάση.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'Μην υπερτείνετε τα χέρια σας κατά τη φάση ανοίγματος. Εστιάστε στη σύσπαση του στήθους.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Μην αφήνετε την πλάτη σας να κάψει. Ξεκινήστε με μερική διάθεση.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Μην αφήνετε τους γοφούς σας να πέφτουν προς τα κάτω. Τραβήξτε τις ωμοπλάτες σας.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Μην σηκώνετε τους γοφούς σας. Κρατήστε τη σύσπαση στην κορυφή για ένα δευτερόλεπτο.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Μην κλειδώνετε τα γόνατά σας σε έκταση. Τα πόδια ψηλότερα στην πλατφόρμα εμπλέκουν περισσότερο τους γλουτούς.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Μην τραβάτε το λαιμό σας. Επικεντρωθείτε στην κοιλιακή σύσπαση.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Μην σηκώνετε τα χέρια σας πάνω από το ύψος των ώμων. Περιστρέψτε τους καρπούς σας ελαφρώς προς τα κάτω (σαν να ρίχνετε νερό) για να απομονώσετε τον πλάγιο δελτοειδή.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Μην σηκώνετε τους γοφούς σας. Κρατήστε τους ώμους σας πάνω από τους καρπούς σας.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'Μην στρογγυλοποιείτε την πλάτη σας σε κανένα σημείο. Εμπλέξτε τον πυρήνα σας πριν τραβήξετε.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Μην στρογγυλοποιείτε την πλάτη σας. Ελέγξτε την έκκεντρη φάση.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'Μην στρογγυλοποιείτε την πλάτη σας. Ελέγξτε τη φάση του τεντώματος.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'Μην στρογγυλοποιείτε την πλάτη σας. Ξεκινήστε με ένα μικρό βάρος.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Μην χρησιμοποιείτε αιώρηση σώματος. Επικεντρωθείτε στην απομόνωση του μέσου γλουτιαίου.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'Μην χρησιμοποιείτε ορμή. Επικεντρωθείτε στην απομόνωση των προσαγωγών.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'Μην χρησιμοποιείτε ορμή. Επικεντρωθείτε στη συστολή.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Οι αλτήρες επιτρέπουν μεγαλύτερο εύρος κίνησης. Κρατήστε τις ωμοπλάτες σας ανασυρμένες καθ\' όλη τη διάρκεια της κίνησης.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'Πόδια φαρδύτερα από το πλάτος των ώμων με τα δάχτυλα στραμμένα προς τα έξω. Χαμηλώστε πιάνοντας τη μπάρα με μια εσωτερική λαβή. Σπρώξτε με τα πόδια σας και τεντώστε τους γοφούς σας ταυτόχρονα κρατώντας την πλάτη σας ίσια.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας φέρνοντας το βάρος προς τους ώμους σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Τεντώστε πλήρως τα χέρια σας στην ομόκεντρη φάση. Επιστρέψτε αργά στην αρχική θέση ελέγχοντας την κίνηση.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Πιάστε τη μπάρα με μια πρηνισμένη λαβή στο πλάτος των ώμων. Ξεκινώντας με τα χέρια τεντωμένα, τραβήξτε το σώμα σας προς τα πάνω μέχρι το πηγούνι σας να καθαρίσει τη μπάρα. Χαμηλώστε αργά πίσω στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Πιάστε τη μπάρα με μια ύπτια λαβή (οι παλάμες προς το μέρος σας) στο πλάτος των ώμων. Ξεκινώντας με τα χέρια τεντωμένα, τραβήξτε το σώμα σας προς τα πάνω μέχρι το πηγούνι σας να καθαρίσει τη μπάρα. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Πιάστε τις παράλληλες ράβδους με τους βραχίονες σε έκταση. Χαμηλώστε το σώμα σας γέρνοντας ελαφρώς προς τα εμπρός και λυγίζοντας τους αγκώνες σας. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'Κρεμασμένοι από τη μπάρα ή ξαπλωμένοι, σηκώστε τα πόδια σας προς τα πάνω ελέγχοντας την κίνηση. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'Οι ψηλοί αγκώνες εμποδίζουν την ολίσθηση της μπάρας. Απαιτεί σημαντική κινητικότητα στον καρπό και στον αστράγαλο.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Κρατήστε τη σύσπαση στην κορυφή για ένα δευτερόλεπτο. Αποφύγετε την ορμή.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Κρατήστε τη σύσπαση στην κορυφή για ένα δευτερόλεπτο. Κρατήστε το πηγούνι σας προς το στήθος σας.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Κρατήστε τη σύσπαση στην κορυφή. Αποφύγετε την αποζημίωση με την πλάτη σας.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Κρατήστε τις άκρες του σχοινιού στα πλάγια σας. Περιστρέψτε το σχοινί από πάνω και πηδήξτε καθώς περνά κάτω από τα πόδια σας.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'Σε πρηνή θέση που στηρίζεται στους πήχεις και τα δάχτυλα των ποδιών σας. Το σώμα σας σχηματίζει μια ευθεία γραμμή από το κεφάλι μέχρι τις φτέρνες. Κρατήστε συστέλλοντας τον πυρήνα σας.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'Σε πρηνή θέση με τα χέρια στο πλάτος των ώμων. Χαμηλώστε το στήθος σας προς το πάτωμα λυγίζοντας τους αγκώνες σας. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση κρατώντας το σώμα σας σε ευθεία γραμμή.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'Σε θέση ώθησης. Εναλλακτικά, φέρτε τα γόνατά σας προς το στήθος σας γρήγορα ενώ κρατάτε τους γοφούς σας χαμηλά.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'Σε θέση διχασμένης στάσης. Χαμηλώστε το σώμα σας λυγίζοντας το μπροστινό σας γόνατο. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Κρατήστε το αντίθετο πόδι εντελώς στο πάτωμα. Κορμός όρθιος.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Κρατήστε τον βραχίονα παράλληλα με το πάτωμα. Αποφύγετε την ορμή.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Κρατήστε τα χέρια σας ίσια. Επικεντρωθείτε στην τελική συστολή.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Κρατήστε την πλάτη σας επίπεδη και τον πυρήνα σας δεσμευμένο. Αποφύγετε να ταλαντεύετε τον κορμό σας.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Κρατήστε την πλάτη σας σε ουδέτερη θέση. Τραβήξτε προς τη μέση ή το στήθος σας. Συσπάστε τους μύες της πλάτης σας στο τέλος της κίνησης.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Κρατήστε την πλάτη σας παράλληλα με το πάτωμα. Περιστρέψτε ελαφρά τον κορμό σας στο τέλος της κίνησης.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Κρατήστε το στήθος σας ψηλά και τα γόνατά σας ευθυγραμμισμένα με τα δάχτυλα των ποδιών σας. Μην αφήνετε τα γόνατά σας να πέφτουν προς τα μέσα.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας δεσμευμένο και την πλάτη σας ίσια. Αποφύγετε την υπερέκταση της οσφυϊκής σας μοίρας.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας δεσμευμένο για να προστατεύσετε την πλάτη σας. Αποφύγετε την υπερέκταση της οσφυϊκής σας μοίρας.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας απασχολημένο. Προσαρμόστε την ταχύτητα στο επίπεδο φυσικής σας κατάστασης.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας απασχολημένο. Αποφύγετε την υπερέκταση της σπονδυλικής σας στήλης.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας στο ύψος των ώμων ή λίγο πιο πάνω. Απαραίτητο για την υγεία του περιστροφικού πετάλου.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας κοντά στο σώμα σας. Αποφύγετε να φουντώσετε τους αγκώνες σας.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς στα πλάγια σας. Η ουδέτερη λαβή τονίζει το brachioradialis πάνω από τον δικέφαλο.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς στραμμένους προς το ταβάνι. Ελέγξτε την κατάβαση.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς σε όλη τη διάρκεια της κίνησης. Εστιάστε στην πλήρη συστολή στην κορυφή.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς. Μην χρησιμοποιείτε ορμή.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς. Επικεντρωθείτε στην πλήρη συστολή.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς. Εστιάστε στην πλήρη επέκταση.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας στραμμένους προς το ταβάνι και κοντά στο κεφάλι σας. Η μακριά κεφαλή ενεργοποιείται στο μέγιστο βαθμό στη θέση τεντώματος.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Κρατήστε το μπροστινό σας γόνατο ευθυγραμμισμένο με τα δάχτυλα των ποδιών σας. Διορθώνει τις μυϊκές ανισορροπίες μεταξύ των ποδιών.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Κρατήστε τη φτέρνα σας στο πάτωμα. Λυγίστε το γόνατό σας για να τεντώσετε το πέλμα.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Κρατήστε τους γοφούς σας ευθυγραμμισμένους. Αποφύγετε να τα αφήσετε να κρεμούν προς τα κάτω.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Κρατήστε τα άλματά σας χαμηλά. Χρησιμοποιήστε τους καρπούς σας, όχι τα χέρια σας, για να περιστρέψετε το σχοινί.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Κρατήστε το γόνατό σας στραμμένο προς το πάτωμα. Αποφύγετε την υπερέκταση της πλάτης σας.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Κρατήστε τα γόνατά σας ευθυγραμμισμένα με τα δάχτυλα των ποδιών σας. Η θέση του ποδιού αλλάζει τον πιο εμπλεκόμενο μυ.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Κρατήστε τα γόνατά σας ευθυγραμμισμένα με τα δάχτυλα των ποδιών σας. Η στάση του σούμο μειώνει τη διαδρομή της μπάρας.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Κρατήστε τη λεκάνη σας σε επίπεδο. Ξεκινήστε με ένα μικρό βάρος.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Κρατήστε τις ωμοπλάτες σας ανασυρμένες. Ελέγξτε την κάθοδο για τουλάχιστον 2 δευτερόλεπτα.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Κρατήστε τους ώμους σας χαλαρούς. Προσαρμόστε το ρυθμό στην επιθυμητή ένταση.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Κρατήστε τον κορμό σας σταθερό αποφεύγοντας την αιώρηση. Ελέγξτε την κατάβαση.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Κρατήστε τον κορμό σας όρθιο και τον πυρήνα δεμένο. Αποφύγετε να αφήσετε το μπροστινό σας γόνατο να περάσει από τα δάχτυλα των ποδιών σας.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Κρατήστε τον κορμό σας κάθετο για να απομονώσετε τους τρικέφαλους. Όσο πιο χαμηλά πηγαίνετε, τόσο μεγαλύτερη είναι η εμπλοκή στο στήθος.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Κρατήστε τους καρπούς σας σε ουδέτερη θέση. Η ανάστροφη μπούκλα δυναμώνει τους μύες του αντιβραχίου.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'Γονατιστός με τον τροχό μπροστά. Κυλήστε τον τροχό προς τα εμπρός χαμηλώνοντας το σώμα σας προς το πάτωμα. Τραβήξτε τον τροχό πίσω προς τα γόνατά σας.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Η κλίση προς τα εμπρός αυξάνει την εμπλοκή του στήθους. Η κάθετη θέση απομονώνει τους τρικέφαλους.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Ξαπλώστε με τα γόνατα λυγισμένα. Φέρτε τους ώμους σας προς τα γόνατά σας συστέλλοντας τους κοιλιακούς σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Ξαπλώστε με τα πόδια σηκωμένα. Φέρτε τα γόνατά σας προς το στήθος σας σηκώνοντας τη λεκάνη σας. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Ξαπλώστε μπρούμυτα στο μηχάνημα με επιθέματα στους αστραγάλους σας. Λυγίστε τα γόνατά σας φέρνοντας τις φτέρνες σας προς τους γλουτούς σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο με έναν αλτήρα σε κάθε χέρι. Χαμηλώστε τους αλτήρες προς το στήθος σας κρατώντας τους καρπούς σας σταθερούς. Σπρώξτε σταθερά προς τα πάνω επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο με έναν αλτήρα σε κάθε χέρι. Χαμηλώστε τα χέρια σας πλευρικά διατηρώντας μια ελαφριά κάμψη στον αγκώνα. Φέρτε τους αλτήρες προς τα πάνω σε ένα τόξο σαν να αγκαλιάζετε ένα δέντρο. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο με μια λαβή στο πλάτος των ώμων. Χαμηλώστε τη μπάρα κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας κοντά στον κορμό σας. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω πιέζοντας τους τρικέφαλους σας.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο με το εργαλείο πάνω από το στήθος σας, με τα χέρια τεντωμένα. Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας χαμηλώνοντας το βάρος προς το μέτωπό σας. Επέκταση επιστρέφοντας στη θέση.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο με το εργαλείο πάνω από το στήθος σας, με τα χέρια σχεδόν τεντωμένα. Χαμηλώστε το βάρος πίσω από το κεφάλι σας κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας ελαφρώς λυγισμένους. Επιστρέψτε στην αρχική θέση σε ένα τόξο.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο με τα πόδια σας στο πάτωμα. Πιάστε τη μπάρα ευρύτερα από το πλάτος των ώμων. Χαμηλώστε τη μπάρα στο στήθος κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας περίπου 45 μοίρες. Σπρώξτε σταθερά προς τα πάνω.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Ξαπλώστε στον πάγκο πτώσης με τα πόδια σας ασφαλισμένα. Πιάστε το εργαλείο περισσότερο από το πλάτος των ώμων. Χαμηλότερα στο κάτω μέρος του θώρακα. Σπρώξτε σταθερά επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Ξαπλώστε στο κεκλιμένο στήριγμα με τα βάρη να κρέμονται. Τραβήξτε προς τον κορμό σας συσπώντας τα lats σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Χαμηλώστε σε ένα squat και μετά πηδήξτε προς τα πάνω εκρηκτικά. Προσγειωθείτε απαλά λυγίζοντας τα γόνατά σας.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Χαμηλώστε σε οκλαδόν, τοποθετήστε τα χέρια σας στο πάτωμα και πηδήστε τα πόδια σας σε θέση ώθησης. Εκτελέστε ένα push-up, πηδήξτε τα πόδια σας προς τα χέρια σας και μετά πηδήξτε με τα χέρια σας πάνω.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Διατηρήστε σταθερό ρυθμό. Σωστή στάση καθ\' όλη τη διάρκεια της άσκησης.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Διατηρήστε μια όρθια στάση με μια ελαφριά κλίση προς τα εμπρός. Εναλλακτικά βήματα με σταθερό ρυθμό. Προσγειωθείτε με το πόδι σας στο μέσο του βήματος.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Διατηρήστε την ίδια κάμψη του αγκώνα σε όλη την κίνηση. Εστιάστε στη σύσπαση του στήθους στο τέλος της κίνησης.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Διατηρήστε την ίδια κάμψη του αγκώνα. Ελέγξτε την κάθοδο για 2 δευτερόλεπτα.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Διατηρήστε την ελαφριά κάμψη του αγκώνα. Το πουλόβερ είναι μια από τις λίγες ασκήσεις που τεντώνουν το λατ.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Μέτρια ένταση, ποτέ πόνος. Εκπνεύστε καθώς τεντώνεστε.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'Στα χέρια και στα γόνατα ή στέκεται στο καλώδιο. Επεκτείνετε το πόδι σας προς τα πίσω πιέζοντας τους γλουτιαίους. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'Στο πλάι ακουμπώντας στον πήχη σας με το σώμα σας σε ευθεία γραμμή. Σηκώστε τους γοφούς σας διατηρώντας τη θέση.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Πεντάλ διατηρώντας σταθερό ρυθμό. Κρατήστε την πλάτη σας σε ουδέτερη θέση.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Εκτελέστε τη φάση ανύψωσης με ύπτια λαβή. Περιστρέψτε τους καρπούς σας σε πρηνισμό στην κορυφή. Χαμηλότερο με πρηνή λαβή. Επιστρέψτε στο ύπτιο στο κάτω μέρος.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Εκτελέστε την κίνηση ελέγχοντας τόσο τις έκκεντρες όσο και τις ομόκεντρες φάσεις. Κρατήστε τον πυρήνα σας απασχολημένο.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Εκτελέστε την κίνηση ελέγχοντας τόσο τις έκκεντρες όσο και τις ομόκεντρες φάσεις. Κρατήστε τις ωμοπλάτες σας ανασυρμένες.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Εκτελέστε την κίνηση εκρηκτικά προς τα πάνω ή προς τα εμπρός. Προσγειωθείτε απαλά λυγίζοντας τα γόνατά σας. Ελέγξτε την προσγείωση.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Εκτελέστε την κίνηση αργά και στις δύο φάσεις. Η παύση στο κάτω μέρος αυξάνει το τέντωμα της γάμπας.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Εκτελέστε την περιστροφή ρευστά και συνεχώς. Η πρέσα Arnold είναι μια από τις λίγες ασκήσεις που εμπλέκουν όλες τις μυϊκές ίνες.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Τοποθετήστε τα χέρια σας σε σχήμα διαμαντιού κάτω από το στήθος σας. Χαμηλώστε το σώμα σας κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας κοντά στον κορμό σας. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω πιέζοντας τους τρικέφαλους σας.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Τοποθετήστε τον εαυτό σας στη μηχανή hack squat με τους ώμους κάτω από τα μαξιλαράκια. Κατεβείτε λυγίζοντας τα γόνατά σας στις 90 μοίρες και μετά σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Σπρώξτε κυρίως με το πόδι στην υπερυψωμένη επιφάνεια. Κρατήστε τον κορμό σας όρθιο.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Σπρώξτε με τα πόδια σας, στη συνέχεια γείρετε τον κορμό σας προς τα πίσω και τέλος τραβήξτε το κουπί προς την κοιλιά σας. Αντιστρέψτε τη σειρά κατά την επιστροφή.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Απαιτεί εξαιρετική κινητικότητα ώμου, ισχίου και αστραγάλου. Ξεκινήστε χωρίς βάρος.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Τραβήξτε τις ωμοπλάτες σας και κρατήστε τις κλειδωμένες. Μην αναπηδάτε το βάρος από το στήθος σας.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Τραβήξτε τις ωμοπλάτες σας για να σταθεροποιήσετε τον ώμο.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Περιστρέψτε από τη μέση, όχι μόνο από τα μπράτσα.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Περιστρέψτε τον κορμό σας φέρνοντας τον έναν αγκώνα προς το αντίθετο γόνατο. Επαναλάβετε από την άλλη πλευρά.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Περιστρέψτε τον καρπό σας προς τα έξω στην κορυφή για να μεγιστοποιήσετε την κορυφή. Κρατήστε τον κορμό σας σταθερό.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Καθισμένος με αλτήρες στο ύψος των ώμων και τις παλάμες προς το μέρος σας. Πιέστε προς τα πάνω περιστρέφοντας τους καρπούς σας προς τα έξω έως ότου οι παλάμες σας κοιτούν προς τα εμπρός. Χαμηλώστε επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Καθίστε με τον αγκώνα σας να ακουμπά στο εσωτερικό του μηρού σας. Λυγίστε τον αγκώνα σας φέρνοντας τον αλτήρα προς τον ώμο σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Καθίστε με τα πόδια ανασηκωμένα και τον κορμό στις 45 μοίρες. Περιστρέψτε τον κορμό σας από τη μία πλευρά στην άλλη φέρνοντας τα χέρια σας στο πάτωμα δίπλα στους γοφούς σας.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Ακολουθία: πόδια, μετά κορμός και μετά χέρια κατά τη διάρκεια του τραβήγματος.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Καθίστε στο πτυσσόμενο μηχάνημα lat και πιάστε τη μπάρα με μια ευρεία πρηνισμένη λαβή. Τραβήξτε τη μπάρα προς το στήθος σας, γέρνοντας τον κορμό σας ελαφρώς προς τα πίσω. Ελέγξτε την επιστροφή στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Καθίστε στο πτυσσόμενο μηχάνημα lat με στενή ή ουδέτερη λαβή. Τραβήξτε τη μπάρα προς το στήθος σας κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας κοντά στο σώμα σας. Ελέγξτε την επιστροφή.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Καθίστε στο χαμηλό καλώδιο με τα πόδια σας στα στηρίγματα. Τραβήξτε τη λαβή προς τη μέση σας κρατώντας την πλάτη σας ίσια. Συσπάστε τους μύες της πλάτης σας και επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Καθίστε στο μηχάνημα με επιθέματα στους αστραγάλους σας. Εκτείνετε τα πόδια σας προς τα πάνω συστέλλοντας τον τετρακέφαλο σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Καθίστε στο μηχάνημα με επιθέματα στους αστραγάλους σας. Λυγίστε τα γόνατά σας φέρνοντας τις φτέρνες σας προς τους γλουτούς σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Καθίστε στον πάγκο του ιεροκήρυκα με τα χέρια σας ακουμπισμένα στο μαξιλάρι. Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας φέρνοντας το εργαλείο προς τους ώμους σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά σχεδόν σε πλήρη επέκταση.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Καθίστε στο μηχάνημα με την πλάτη σας να ακουμπάει στο μαξιλάρι. Τοποθετήστε τους αγκώνες σας στα μαξιλαράκια. Φέρτε τα χέρια σας προς το κέντρο συσπώντας το στήθος σας. Επιστρέψτε αργά στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Καθίστε στο μηχάνημα με τα πόδια σας στην πλατφόρμα στο πλάτος των γοφών. Χαμηλώστε λυγίζοντας τα γόνατά σας στις 90 μοίρες. Σπρώξτε τεντώνοντας τα πόδια σας.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Καθίστε στον επικλινές πάγκο με τα πόδια σας στο πάτωμα. Πιάστε το εργαλείο περισσότερο από το πλάτος των ώμων. Χαμηλώστε στο ανώτερο επίπεδο του θώρακα. Σπρώξτε σταθερά επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Καθίστε με τους πήχεις στους μηρούς σας. Πιάστε το εργαλείο με μια ύπτια λαβή. Λυγίστε τους καρπούς σας προς τα πάνω και χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Διαδώστε το σχοινί στο κάτω μέρος για να μεγιστοποιήσετε τη συστολή. Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Στέκεται στο κέντρο του καλωδίου με μία λαβή ανά χέρι. Κρατήστε τα χέρια σας ελαφρώς λυγισμένα. Φέρτε τα χέρια σας προς το κέντρο διασχίζοντάς τα. Επιστρέψτε αργά στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'Στέκεται στο ψηλό καλώδιο με το σχοινί. Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς στα πλάγια του κορμού σας. Σπρώξτε το σχοινί προς τα κάτω χωρίζοντας τα άκρα. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'Στέκεται στο ψηλό καλώδιο. Κρατήστε τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς στα πλάγια του κορμού σας. Σπρώξτε προς τα κάτω εκτείνοντας πλήρως τα χέρια σας. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Στέκεστε κοιτάζοντας το ψηλό καλώδιο με τα χέρια σας σχεδόν τεντωμένα. Φέρτε τη ράβδο προς τους μηρούς σας σε ένα τόξο κρατώντας τα χέρια σας ίσια. Επιστρέψτε αργά στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Στέκεται μπροστά σε ένα παγκάκι. Τοποθετήστε το ένα πόδι στην υπερυψωμένη επιφάνεια και σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω. Χαμηλώστε αργά ελέγχοντας την κίνηση.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'Στέκεται στο ένα πόδι. Χαμηλώστε τον κορμό σας προς τα εμπρός κρατώντας την πλάτη σας ίσια ενώ το ελεύθερο πόδι σας εκτείνεται πίσω. Επιστρέψτε στην όρθια θέση πιέζοντας τους γλουτούς σας.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'Όρθια ή καθιστή με το εργαλείο στο ύψος των ώμων. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω τεντώνοντας πλήρως τα χέρια σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση με το βάρος στο ύψος των ώμων.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'Όρθια ή καθιστή με το εργαλείο στο ύψος των ώμων. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω τεντώνοντας πλήρως τα χέρια σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'Όρθιος ή καθισμένος με το εργαλείο πάνω από το κεφάλι, τα χέρια τεντωμένα. Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας χαμηλώνοντας το βάρος πίσω από το κεφάλι σας. Επεκτείνετε την επιστροφή.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Στέκεστε με έναν αλτήρα σε κάθε χέρι στα πλάγια σας. Σηκώστε τα χέρια σας πλευρικά στο ύψος των ώμων κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας ελαφρώς λυγισμένους. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Όρθιος με ένα βάρος σε κάθε χέρι στα πλάγια. Σηκώστε τους ώμους σας προς τα αυτιά σας πιέζοντας τις παγίδες σας. Κρατήστε τη σύσπαση για ένα δευτερόλεπτο και στη συνέχεια χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Όρθιος με αλτήρες στα πλάγια με ουδέτερη λαβή (αντίχειρες προς τα πάνω). Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας φέρνοντας τους αλτήρες προς τους ώμους σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Όρθια με τα πόδια στο πλάτος των γοφών. Αρθρώστε τους γοφούς ταλαντεύοντας το βάρος ανάμεσα στα πόδια σας και, στη συνέχεια, οδηγήστε τους γοφούς σας εκρηκτικά προς τα εμπρός ταλαντεύοντας το βάρος μέχρι το ύψος των ώμων.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Όρθια με τα πόδια στο πλάτος των γοφών. Χαμηλώστε τη μπάρα κατά μήκος των ποδιών σας κρατώντας τα γόνατά σας ελαφρώς λυγισμένα και την πλάτη ίσια. Κατεβείτε μέχρι να νιώσετε ένταση στους μηριαίους μηριαίους και μετά επιστρέψτε επάνω.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Όρθια με τα πόδια στο πλάτος των γοφών. Χαμηλώστε με την πλάτη ίσια και το στήθος ψηλά. Σπρώξτε τα πόδια σας στο έδαφος και τεντώστε τους γοφούς και τα γόνατα ταυτόχρονα κρατώντας τη μπάρα κοντά στα πόδια σας.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Όρθιος με τα πόδια στο πλάτος των ώμων, κρατήστε έναν αλτήρα μπροστά από το στήθος σας. Κατεβείτε κρατώντας το στήθος σας ψηλά. Επιστρέψτε ψηλά πιέζοντας τις φτέρνες σας.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Όρθια με τα πόδια στο πλάτος των ώμων. Χαμηλώστε το σώμα σας λυγίζοντας τα γόνατα και τους γοφούς σας σαν να κάθεστε σε μια καρέκλα. Κατεβείτε μέχρι οι μηροί σας να είναι παράλληλοι με το πάτωμα. Σπρώξτε τις φτέρνες σας.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Όρθιος με τα πόδια ενωμένα. Κάντε ένα φαρδύ πλευρικό βήμα κρατώντας το αντίθετο πόδι σταθερό. Χαμηλώστε προς εκείνη την πλευρά λυγίζοντας το γόνατό σας.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Όρθιος με τη μπάρα στους ώμους. Γείρετε τον κορμό σας προς τα εμπρός κρατώντας την πλάτη σας ίσια και τα γόνατα ελαφρώς λυγισμένα. Νιώστε το τέντωμα στους μηριαίους σας. Επιστρέψτε στην όρθια θέση.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Σταθείτε με το εργαλείο μπροστά από τους μηρούς σας χρησιμοποιώντας μια πρηνισμένη λαβή. Τραβήξτε προς το πηγούνι σας κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας ψηλότερα από τους καρπούς σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Στέκεστε με το εργαλείο μπροστά από τους μηρούς σας. Σηκώστε τα χέρια σας μπροστά σας στο ύψος των ώμων κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας ελαφρώς λυγισμένους. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Στέκεται με το εργαλείο χρησιμοποιώντας μια πρηνισμένη λαβή (οι παλάμες προς τα κάτω). Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας φέρνοντας το εργαλείο προς τους ώμους σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Όρθια με το εργαλείο χρησιμοποιώντας μια ύπτια λαβή. Λυγίστε τους αγκώνες σας φέρνοντας το εργαλείο προς τους ώμους σας, κρατώντας τους αγκώνες σας σταθερούς στα πλάγια του κορμού σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Όρθια με τον κορμό με κλίση στις 45 μοίρες. Πιάστε τη μπάρα με μια πρηνισμένη λαβή. Τραβήξτε προς την κοιλιά σας κρατώντας την πλάτη σας ουδέτερη. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Στέκεστε με τα τακούνια σας από την άκρη μιας πλατφόρμας. Σηκωθείτε στις μύτες των ποδιών σας σφίγγοντας τις γάμπες σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά επιτρέποντας στις φτέρνες σας να πέφτουν κάτω από το επίπεδο της πλατφόρμας.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Ξεκινήστε με μέτριο ρυθμό και σταδιακά αυξήστε.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Ξεκινήστε από την ανάσυρση των ωμοπλάτων. Ελέγξτε την έκκεντρη φάση.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Ξεκινήστε από την ανάσυρση των ωμοπλάτων. Μην γέρνετε τον κορμό σας πολύ πίσω.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Ξεκινήστε την κίνηση από την ανάσυρση των ωμοπλάτων. Αποφύγετε τη χρήση ορμής.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Ξεκινήστε την κίνηση από την ανάσυρση των ωμοπλάτων. Ελέγξτε τη φάση επιμήκυνσης.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Κάντε ένα βήμα προς τα πίσω χαμηλώνοντας το πίσω γόνατό σας προς το πάτωμα. Το μπροστινό γόνατο παραμένει ευθυγραμμισμένο με τον αστράγαλο.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Προχωρήστε προς τα εμπρός χαμηλώνοντας το πίσω γόνατό σας προς το πάτωμα. Το μπροστινό γόνατο παραμένει ευθυγραμμισμένο με τον αστράγαλο. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Βήμα προς τα εμπρός χαμηλώνοντας το πίσω γόνατό σας. Συνεχίστε να βαδίζετε προς τα εμπρός εναλλάσσοντας τα πόδια συνεχώς.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Μπείτε μέσα στη ράβδο παγίδας. Πόδια στο πλάτος των γοφών. Χαμηλώστε πιάνοντας τις λαβές με ίσια πλάτη. Σπρώξτε τα πόδια σας εκτείνοντας τους γοφούς και τα γόνατα ταυτόχρονα.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Κάντε μεγάλα βήματα για να δεσμεύσετε περισσότερο τους γλουτούς σας.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'Η μπούκλα Zottman εκπαιδεύει τόσο την κάμψη όσο και την επέκταση του αντιβραχίου.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'Η μπάρα πρέπει να βόσκει τα πόδια σας σε όλη τη διάρκεια της κίνησης. Εστιάστε στο τέντωμα των οπίσθιων μηριαίων κατά την κάθοδο.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Όσο υψηλότερη είναι η επιφάνεια, τόσο περισσότερο λειτουργεί το πάνω μέρος του θώρακα.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Ο κεκλιμένος πάγκος τονίζει το πάνω μέρος του στήθους. Κρατήστε τις ωμοπλάτες σας ανασυρμένες καθ\' όλη τη διάρκεια της κίνησης.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'Η κεκλιμένη έκδοση είναι πιο εύκολη και δεσμεύει το κάτω μέρος του θώρακα.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Όσο πιο οριζόντιο το σώμα σας, τόσο πιο δύσκολο είναι. Να διατηρείτε πάντα τον πυρήνα σας απασχολημένο.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'Η κίνηση προέρχεται από τους γοφούς, όχι από την πλάτη. Κρατήστε την πλάτη σας ίσια κατά τη φάση της ώθησης.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'Ο πάγκος του ιεροκήρυκα εξαλείφει τη χρήση της ορμής. Μην αφήνετε το βάρος να πέσει στο κάτω μέρος.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'Το ανάποδο βολάν είναι πιο ασφαλές για τα γόνατα από το εμπρός.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'Η περιστροφή προέρχεται από τη μέση, όχι από το κεφάλι.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'Η μπούκλα του καθιστού ποδιού αυξάνει το εύρος κίνησης. Αποφύγετε να σηκώνετε τους γλουτούς σας από το κάθισμα.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'Η υποστήριξη εξαλείφει το οσφυϊκό στρες. Εστίαση στην ανάκληση.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'Η ράβδος παγίδας μειώνει την πίεση στη σπονδυλική στήλη. Κρατήστε τους ώμους σας στην ίδια ευθεία με τις λαβές.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'Το βάρος μπροστά βοηθά στην κάθετη στάση. Κρατήστε τα γόνατά σας ευθυγραμμισμένα.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Χρησιμοποιήστε ένα μικρό βάρος. Κρατήστε τους πήχεις σας ακίνητους στους μηρούς σας.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Με ένα χέρι και ένα γόνατο στον πάγκο. Τραβήξτε τον αλτήρα προς το πλάι κρατώντας τον αγκώνα σας κοντά στο σώμα σας. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Με την μπάρα από πάνω, κατεβείτε σε ένα squat κρατώντας τα χέρια σας ίσια και σταθερά. Επιστρέψτε προς τα πάνω κρατώντας την μπάρα ευθυγραμμισμένη.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Με τα χέρια μπροστά στο καλώδιο ή με αλτήρες, τραβήξτε το εργαλείο προς το πρόσωπό σας κρατώντας τους αγκώνες ψηλά. Ξεχωρίστε τα χέρια σας φέρνοντας τις γροθιές σας κοντά στα αυτιά σας. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Με το σώμα σας κεκλιμένο κάτω από μια χαμηλή μπάρα, πιάστε με πρηνή λαβή. Τραβήξτε το στήθος σας στη μπάρα κρατώντας το σώμα σας άκαμπτο. Χαμηλώστε αργά.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Με τα πόδια σας σε υπερυψωμένη επιφάνεια, χαμηλώστε το στήθος σας προς το πάτωμα. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Με τα χέρια σας σε μια υπερυψωμένη επιφάνεια, χαμηλώστε το στήθος σας προς τα χέρια σας. Σπρώξτε προς τα πάνω επιστρέφοντας στην αρχική θέση.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Με τα χέρια σας στην άκρη ενός πάγκου, κάντε ένα βήμα μπροστά με τους γλουτούς σας έξω. Χαμηλώστε το σώμα σας λυγίζοντας τους αγκώνες σας στις 90 μοίρες. Ανεβάζω.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Με τον κορμό σε κλίση και τον αγκώνα λυγισμένο στις 90 μοίρες, τεντώστε το χέρι σας προς τα πίσω μέχρι την πλήρη έκταση. Επιστροφή σιγά σιγά.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Με το πάνω μέρος της πλάτης σε έναν πάγκο και το βάρος στους γοφούς. Σπρώξτε τους γοφούς σας προς τα πάνω πιέζοντας τους γλουτούς σας. Επιστρέψτε αργά.',
    },
    'ar': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'نفِّذ الحركة ببطء وتحكم. حافظ على وضعية صحيحة.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'ابدأ بوزن معتدل لإتقان التقنية.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'تنفس بعمق. لا تتجاوز حدودك الطبيعية أبدًا.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'حافظ على توتر عضلات الجذع طوال التمرين. تحكم في المرحلة اللامركزية.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': 'حافظ على استقرار الجذع طوال التمرين.',
      'Lower slowly': 'انزل ببطء', 'lower slowly': 'انزل ببطء',
      'Breathe deeply': 'تنفس بعمق',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'استخدم نطاق الحركة الكامل.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'قبضة قريبة تزيد من نطاق الحركة. البدء من التراجع.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'قبضة وثيقة تعزل ثلاثية الرؤوس. أبقِ جسمك في خط مستقيم.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'قبضة مستلقية تزيد من مشاركة العضلة ذات الرأسين. تجنب استخدام الزخم.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'اضبط المقعد: لا ينبغي أن تتمدد ركبتيك بشكل مفرط.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'دائما تهبط بهدوء. لا تقفل ركبتيك.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'تجنب الزخم. التركيز على رفع الحوض.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'تجنب رفع مرفقيك أعلى من مستوى الكتف. القبضة الأوسع تقلل من خطر الاصطدام.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'تجنب تدوير كتفيك. التركيز فقط على الحركة العمودية.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'تجنب تأرجح الجذع الخاص بك. السيطرة على كلا المرحلتين.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'الحديد على الجزء الأمامي من الكتفين مع ارتفاع المرفقين. النزول مع إبقاء الجذع عموديًا قدر الإمكان. ادفع للأعلى.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'أحضر ساقك إلى وضعية التمدد مع إبقاء الجذع في وضع مستقيم. استمر لمدة 20-30 ثانية.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'أحضر ساقك إلى وضعية التمدد مع استقامة ظهرك. استمر لمدة 20-30 ثانية في التنفس بعمق.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'أحضر ساقك إلى الخارج في وضعية الاختطاف المتحكمة في الحركة. العودة ببطء. حافظ على استقرار قلبك.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'أحضر ساقك نحو المركز في التقريب للتحكم في الحركة. العودة ببطء. حافظ على استقرار قلبك.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'عقد القيمة المطلقة الخاصة بك طوال التمرين. السيطرة على مرحلة غريب الأطوار.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'لا تقم بتمديد ذراعيك بشكل مفرط خلال مرحلة الافتتاح. التركيز على انقباض الصدر.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'لا تدع قوس ظهرك. ابدأ بالطرح الجزئي.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'لا تدع الوركين يتدلى إلى الأسفل. اسحب شفرات كتفك.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'لا ترفع الوركين. عقد الانكماش في الأعلى لمدة ثانية.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'لا تقفل ركبتيك في التمديد. الأقدام الأعلى على المنصة تشغل الأرداف أكثر.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'لا تسحب رقبتك. التركيز على انقباض البطن.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'لا ترفع ذراعيك فوق ارتفاع الكتف. قم بتدوير معصميك نحو الأسفل قليلاً (كما لو كنت تصب الماء) لعزل العضلة الدالية الجانبية.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'لا ترفع الوركين. أبقِ كتفيك فوق معصميك.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'لا تدور ظهرك في أي وقت. قم بإشراك قلبك قبل السحب.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'لا تدور ظهرك. السيطرة على مرحلة غريب الأطوار.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'لا تدور ظهرك. السيطرة على مرحلة التمدد.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'لا تدور ظهرك. ابدأ بوزن خفيف.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'لا تستخدم أرجوحة الجسم. التركيز على عزل الألوية الوسطى.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'لا تستخدم الزخم. التركيز على عزل المقربين.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'لا تستخدم الزخم. التركيز على الانكماش.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'تسمح الدمبل بنطاق أكبر من الحركة. حافظ على تراجع شفرات كتفك طوال الحركة.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'القدمين أوسع من عرض الكتفين مع توجيه أصابع القدم إلى الخارج. قم بإمساك الحديد بالأسفل بقبضة داخلية. ادفع بساقيك وقم بتمديد الوركين في نفس الوقت مع الحفاظ على استقامة ظهرك.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'قم بثني مرفقيك بحيث يصبح الوزن نحو كتفيك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'مد ذراعيك بالكامل في مرحلة متحدة المركز. العودة ببطء إلى وضع البداية والتحكم في الحركة.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'أمسك البار بقبضة ممتدة بعرض الكتفين. ابدأ بتمديد ذراعيك، واسحب جسمك للأعلى حتى تتجاوز ذقنك البار. اخفض ببطء إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'أمسك البار بقبضة مستلقية (راحة اليد تواجهك) بعرض الكتفين. ابدأ بتمديد ذراعيك، واسحب جسمك للأعلى حتى تتجاوز ذقنك البار. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'قبض على القضبان المتوازية مع تمديد الأسلحة. اخفض جسمك من خلال الميل قليلًا إلى الأمام وثني مرفقيك. ادفع لأعلى للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'معلقًا من البار أو مستلقيًا، ارفع ساقيك للأعلى للتحكم في الحركة. اخفض ببطء.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'الأكواع العالية تمنع الحديد من الانزلاق. يتطلب حركة كبيرة في المعصم والكاحل.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'عقد الانكماش في الأعلى لمدة ثانية. تجنب الزخم.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'عقد الانكماش في الأعلى لمدة ثانية. حافظ على ذقنك تجاه صدرك.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'عقد الانكماش في الأعلى. تجنب التعويض بظهرك.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'أمسك طرفي الحبل على جانبيك. قم بتدوير الحبل فوق رأسك واقفز أثناء مروره تحت قدميك.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'في وضعية الانبطاح، مستريحًا على ساعديك وأصابع قدميك. يشكل جسمك خطًا مستقيمًا من الرأس إلى الكعب. عقد عن طريق التعاقد الأساسية الخاصة بك.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'في وضعية الانبطاح مع وضع اليدين على عرض الكتفين. اخفض صدرك نحو الأرض عن طريق ثني مرفقيك. ادفع للأعلى عائداً إلى وضع البداية مع إبقاء جسمك في خط مستقيم.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'في وضعية الضغط. بالتناوب، أحضر ركبتيك نحو صدرك بسرعة مع إبقاء الوركين منخفضين.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'في موقف موقف الانقسام. اخفض جسمك عن طريق ثني ركبتك الأمامية. ادفع لأعلى للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'أبقِ القدم المقابلة على الأرض تمامًا. الجذع في وضع مستقيم.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'أبقِ الذراع العلوي موازيًا للأرض. تجنب الزخم.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'أبقِ ذراعيك مستقيمتين. التركيز على الانكماش اللاتيني.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'حافظ على ظهرك مسطحًا ونشاطك الأساسي. تجنب تأرجح الجذع الخاص بك.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'حافظ على ظهرك في وضع محايد. اسحب نحو خصرك أو صدرك. قم بقبض عضلات ظهرك في نهاية الحركة.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'حافظ على ظهرك موازيا للأرض. قم بتدوير جذعك قليلاً في نهاية الحركة.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'أبقِ صدرك مرتفعًا وركبتيك متوازيتين مع أصابع قدميك. لا تدع ركبتيك تنهار إلى الداخل.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'حافظ على قلبك منشغلًا وظهرك مستقيمًا. تجنب الإفراط في تمديد العمود الفقري القطني.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'حافظ على قلبك منشغلًا لحماية ظهرك. تجنب الإفراط في تمديد العمود الفقري القطني.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'حافظ على نشاطك الأساسي. قم بتكييف السرعة مع مستوى لياقتك البدنية.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'حافظ على نشاطك الأساسي. تجنب الإفراط في تمديد العمود الفقري الخاص بك.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'أبقِ مرفقيك على ارتفاع الكتف أو أعلى قليلاً. ضروري لصحة الكفة المدورة.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'أبقِ مرفقيك قريبين من جسمك. تجنب إحراق مرفقيك.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'أبقِ مرفقيك ثابتين على جانبيك. تؤكد القبضة المحايدة على العضلة العضدية العضدية فوق العضلة ذات الرأسين.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'أبقِ مرفقيك ثابتين باتجاه السقف. السيطرة على الهبوط.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'حافظ على مرفقيك ثابتين طوال الحركة. ركز على الانكماش الكامل في الأعلى.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'حافظ على مرفقيك ثابتين. لا تستخدم الزخم.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'حافظ على مرفقيك ثابتين. التركيز على الانكماش الكامل.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'حافظ على مرفقيك ثابتين. التركيز على التمديد الكامل.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'أبقِ مرفقيك متجهين نحو السقف وقريبين من رأسك. يتم تنشيط الرأس الطويل إلى أقصى حد في الوضع الممدود.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'حافظ على ركبتك الأمامية محاذية لأصابع قدميك. يصحح اختلال توازن العضلات بين الساقين.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'أبقِ كعبك على الأرض. ثني ركبتك لتمتد النعل.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'حافظ على محاذاة الوركين. تجنب تركهم يتدلى للأسفل.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'حافظ على قفزاتك منخفضة. استخدم معصميك، وليس ذراعيك، لتدوير الحبل.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'أبقِ ركبتك متجهة نحو الأرض. تجنب الإفراط في تمديد ظهرك.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'حافظ على ركبتيك متوازيتين مع أصابع قدميك. يغير موضع القدم العضلة الأكثر نشاطًا.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'حافظ على ركبتيك متوازيتين مع أصابع قدميك. موقف السومو يقلل من مسار الحديد.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'حافظ على مستوى حوضك. ابدأ بوزن خفيف.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'حافظ على تراجع شفرات كتفك. تحكم في الهبوط لمدة ثانيتين على الأقل.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'حافظ على استرخاء كتفيك. التكيف مع وتيرة الشدة المطلوبة.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'حافظ على ثبات جذعك وتجنب التأرجح. السيطرة على الهبوط.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'حافظ على جذعك منتصبًا ونشطًا. تجنب ترك ركبتك الأمامية تتجاوز أصابع قدميك.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'أبقِ جذعك عموديًا لعزل العضلة ثلاثية الرؤوس. كلما انخفضت، كلما زاد ارتباط الصدر.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'أبقِ معصميك في وضع محايد. الضفيرة العكسية تقوي عضلات الساعد.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'الركوع مع العجلة في الأمام. قم بتحريك العجلة للأمام مع خفض جسمك نحو الأرض. اسحب العجلة للخلف باتجاه ركبتيك.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'الميل إلى الأمام يزيد من ارتباط الصدر. الوضع العمودي يعزل العضلة ثلاثية الرؤوس.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'الاستلقاء مع ثني ركبتيك. اجلب كتفيك نحو ركبتيك مع قبض عضلات بطنك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'الاستلقاء مع رفع ساقيك. اجلب ركبتيك نحو صدرك وارفع حوضك. العودة ببطء.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'استلقي على وجهك لأسفل على الجهاز مع وضع وسادات على كاحليك. قم بثني ركبتيك بحيث يكون كعبك نحو المؤخرة. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'استلقي على المقعد مع الدمبل في كل يد. قم بخفض الدمبل نحو صدرك مع الحفاظ على ثبات معصميك. ادفع للأعلى بقوة للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'استلقي على المقعد مع الدمبل في كل يد. اخفض ذراعيك بشكل جانبي مع الحفاظ على ثني الكوع قليلاً. ارفع الدمبلز للأعلى على شكل قوس كما لو كنت تعانق شجرة. العودة ببطء.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'استلقي على المقعد بقبضة بعرض الكتفين. اخفض البار مع إبقاء مرفقيك قريبين من جذعك. ادفع لأعلى مع الضغط على ثلاثية الرؤوس.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'استلقي على المقعد مع وضع الأداة فوق صدرك، مع تمديد ذراعيك. قم بثني مرفقيك مع خفض الوزن باتجاه جبهتك. تمديد العودة إلى الموقف.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'استلقي على المقعد مع وضع الأداة فوق صدرك، وذراعيك ممتدتين تقريبًا. قم بخفض الوزن خلف رأسك مع إبقاء مرفقيك مثنيين قليلاً. العودة إلى وضع البداية في القوس.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'استلق على المقعد مع وضع قدميك على الأرض. أمسك بالحديد على نطاق أوسع من عرض الكتفين. أنزل الحديد إلى صدرك مع إبقاء مرفقيك عند حوالي 45 درجة. ادفع للأعلى بقوة.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'استلق على المقعد المائل مع تأمين قدميك. أمسك الأداة على نطاق أوسع من عرض الكتفين. أسفل إلى أسفل الصدر. ادفع بقوة للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'استلقي على الدعم المائل مع تعليق الأوزان. اسحب نحو الجذع الخاص بك للتعاقد مع عضلاتك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'انزل إلى وضع القرفصاء ثم اقفز للأعلى بشكل متفجر. اهبط بهدوء عن طريق ثني ركبتيك.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'انزل إلى وضع القرفصاء، ضع يديك على الأرض واقفز بقدميك إلى وضعية الضغط. قم بإجراء تمرين الضغط، واقفز بقدميك نحو يديك، ثم اقفز للأعلى مع وضع ذراعيك فوق رأسك.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'الحفاظ على وتيرة ثابتة. الوضعية الصحيحة طوال التمرين.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'الحفاظ على وضع مستقيم مع ميل طفيف إلى الأمام. خطوات بديلة بوتيرة ثابتة. اهبط بقدمك في منتصف الخطوة.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'حافظ على نفس انحناء الكوع طوال الحركة. ركز على انقباض الصدر في نهاية الحركة.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'الحفاظ على نفس ثني الكوع. السيطرة على النسب لمدة 2 ثانية.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'حافظ على انحناء الكوع الطفيف. السترة هي واحدة من التمارين القليلة التي تمد خطوط الطول.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'التوتر المعتدل، أبدا الألم. قم بالزفير أثناء التمدد.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'على اليدين والركبتين أو الوقوف عند الكابل. مد ساقك إلى الخلف مع الضغط على المؤخرة. العودة ببطء.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'على جانبك مستريحًا على ساعدك وجسمك في خط مستقيم. ارفعي الوركين مع الحفاظ على الوضعية.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'تحافظ الدواسة على وتيرة ثابتة. حافظ على ظهرك في وضع محايد.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'أداء مرحلة الرفع بقبضة مستلقية. قم بتدوير معصميك للنطق في الأعلى. أقل مع قبضة منطوقة. العودة إلى مستلق في القاع.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'أداء الحركة التي تتحكم في كل من المرحلتين غريب الأطوار ومتحدة المركز. حافظ على نشاطك الأساسي.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'أداء الحركة التي تتحكم في كل من المرحلتين غريب الأطوار ومتحدة المركز. حافظ على تراجع شفرات كتفك.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'أداء الحركة بشكل متفجر للأعلى أو للأمام. اهبط بهدوء عن طريق ثني ركبتيك. السيطرة على الهبوط.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'أداء الحركة ببطء في كلا المرحلتين. الإيقاف المؤقت في الأسفل يزيد من تمدد ربلة الساق.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'أداء التناوب بسلاسة وبشكل مستمر. يعد ضغط أرنولد أحد التمارين القليلة التي تشغل جميع ألياف العضلات.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'ضعي يديك على شكل الماسة تحت صدرك. اخفض جسمك مع إبقاء مرفقيك قريبين من جذعك. ادفع لأعلى مع الضغط على ثلاثية الرؤوس.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'ضع نفسك في آلة القرفصاء مع وضع الكتفين تحت الوسادات. انزل عن طريق ثني ركبتيك إلى 90 درجة ثم ادفع للأعلى.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'ادفع بشكل رئيسي بالقدم على السطح المرتفع. حافظ على جذعك في وضع مستقيم.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'ادفع بساقيك، ثم قم بإمالة جذعك إلى الخلف، وأخيرًا اسحب المجذاف نحو بطنك. عكس الترتيب عند العودة.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'يتطلب حركة ممتازة في الكتف والورك والكاحل. ابدأ بدون وزن.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'اسحب شفرات كتفك واحتفظ بها مغلقة. لا ترتد الوزن من صدرك.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'اسحب لوحي كتفك لتثبيت الكتف.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'قم بالتدوير من الخصر، وليس فقط من الذراعين.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'قم بتدوير جذعك بحيث يكون أحد مرفقيك باتجاه الركبة المقابلة. كرر من الجانب الآخر.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'قم بتدوير معصمك للخارج في الأعلى لتعظيم الذروة. حافظ على استقرار جذعك.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'اجلس مع الدمبل على ارتفاع الكتفين وراحتي اليد مواجهتين لك. اضغط لأعلى مع تدوير معصميك للخارج حتى تواجه راحة يدك للأمام. انخفاض العودة إلى الموقف الأولي.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'اجلس مع وضع مرفقك على فخذك الداخلي. قم بثني كوعك بحيث يكون الدمبل باتجاه كتفك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'اجلس مع رفع قدميك وجذعك بزاوية 45 درجة. قم بتدوير جذعك من جانب إلى آخر مع وضع يديك على الأرض بجانب الوركين.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'التسلسل: الساقين ثم الجذع ثم الذراعين أثناء السحب.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'اجلس على آلة السحب للأسفل وأمسك بالقضيب بقبضة واسعة. اسحب الشريط نحو صدرك مع إمالة جذعك للخلف قليلاً. السيطرة على العودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'اجلس على الآلة المنسدلة بقبضة قريبة أو محايدة. اسحب الشريط نحو صدرك مع إبقاء مرفقيك قريبين من جسمك. السيطرة على العودة.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'اجلس على الكابل المنخفض مع وضع قدميك على الدعامات. اسحب المقبض نحو خصرك مع الحفاظ على استقامة ظهرك. قم بقبض عضلات ظهرك ثم عد ببطء.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'اجلس أمام الآلة مع وضع وسادات على كاحليك. مد ساقيك إلى أعلى مع تقليص عضلات الفخذ. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'اجلس أمام الآلة مع وضع وسادات على كاحليك. قم بثني ركبتيك بحيث يكون كعبك نحو المؤخرة. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'اجلس على مقعد الواعظ واضعًا ذراعيك على الوسادة. قم بثني مرفقيك بحيث توجه الأداة نحو كتفيك. اخفض ببطء إلى الامتداد الكامل تقريبًا.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'اجلس في الآلة مع وضع ظهرك على الوسادة. ضع مرفقيك على الوسادات. أحضر ذراعيك نحو المركز مع تقليص صدرك. العودة ببطء إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'اجلس في الآلة مع وضع قدميك على المنصة بعرض الورك. اخفض عن طريق ثني ركبتيك إلى 90 درجة. ادفع عن طريق تمديد ساقيك.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'اجلس على المقعد المائل مع وضع قدميك على الأرض. أمسك الأداة على نطاق أوسع من عرض الكتفين. أقل إلى مستوى الصدر العلوي. ادفع بقوة للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'اجلس مع ساعديك على فخذيك. أمسك الأداة بقبضة مستلقية. قم بثني معصميك للأعلى وللأسفل ببطء.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'قم بتوزيع الحبل في الأسفل لتحقيق أقصى قدر من الانكماش. حافظ على مرفقيك ثابتين.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'الوقوف في منتصف الكابل بمقبض واحد لكل يد. أبقِ ذراعيك مثنيتين قليلاً. أحضر يديك نحو المركز معبراً إياهما. العودة ببطء إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'الوقوف عند الكابل العالي بالحبل. أبقِ مرفقيك ثابتين على جانبي جذعك. ادفع الحبل للأسفل مع فصل الأطراف. العودة ببطء.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'الوقوف عند الكابل العالي. أبقِ مرفقيك ثابتين على جانبي جذعك. ادفع للأسفل مع تمديد ذراعيك بالكامل. العودة ببطء.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'الوقوف في مواجهة الكابل العالي مع تمديد ذراعيك تقريبًا. أحضر البار نحو فخذيك على شكل قوس مع إبقاء ذراعيك مستقيمتين. العودة ببطء إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'يقف أمام مقاعد البدلاء. ضع قدمًا واحدة على السطح المرتفع وادفع للأعلى. انخفاض ببطء السيطرة على الحركة.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'الوقوف على ساق واحدة. اخفض جذعك للأمام مع الحفاظ على ظهرك مستقيمًا بينما تمتد ساقك الحرة للخلف. ارجع إلى الوضع المستقيم مع الضغط على عضلات المؤخرة.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'الوقوف أو الجلوس مع الأداة على ارتفاع الكتف. ادفع للأعلى مع تمديد ذراعيك بالكامل. قم بالخفض ببطء والعودة إلى وضع البداية مع الوزن عند ارتفاع الكتف.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف أو الجلوس مع الأداة على ارتفاع الكتف. ادفع للأعلى مع تمديد ذراعيك بالكامل. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'الوقوف أو الجلوس مع وضع الأداة فوق الرأس، والذراعين ممدودتين. قم بثني مرفقيك وخفض الوزن خلف رأسك. تمديد العودة لأعلى.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع الدمبل في كل يد على جانبيك. ارفع ذراعيك بشكل جانبي إلى ارتفاع الكتف مع إبقاء المرفقين مثنيين قليلاً. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع ثقل في كل يد على جانبيك. ارفع كتفيك نحو أذنيك مع الضغط على مصائدك. استمري في الانقباض لمدة ثانية ثم اخفضيه ببطء.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع الدمبل على جانبيك بقبضة محايدة (الإبهام للأعلى). قم بثني مرفقيك مع جلب الدمبل نحو كتفيك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'الوقوف مع القدمين في عرض الورك. قم بالمفصلة عند الوركين وأرجحة الوزن بين ساقيك، ثم ادفع الوركين إلى الأمام بشكل متفجر مع تأرجح الوزن حتى ارتفاع الكتف.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'الوقوف مع القدمين في عرض الورك. قم بخفض الحديد على طول ساقيك مع إبقاء ركبتيك مثنيتين قليلاً وظهرك مستقيماً. انزل حتى تشعر بتوتر في أوتار الركبة ثم ارجع للأعلى.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'الوقوف مع القدمين في عرض الورك. اخفض ظهرك بشكل مستقيم وصدرك لأعلى. ادفع قدميك إلى الأرض وقم بتمديد الوركين والركبتين في نفس الوقت مع إبقاء الشريط قريبًا من ساقيك.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'الوقوف مع القدمين على مستوى الكتف، وعقد الدمبل أمام صدرك. انزل مع إبقاء صدرك مرتفعًا. ارجع للأعلى عن طريق الضغط على كعبيك.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'الوقوف مع القدمين بعرض الكتفين. اخفض جسمك عن طريق ثني ركبتيك ووركيك كما لو كنت تجلس على كرسي. انزل حتى يصبح فخذيك موازيين للأرض. ادفع من خلال كعبك.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'الوقوف مع القدمين معًا. خذ خطوة جانبية واسعة مع الحفاظ على القدم المقابلة ثابتة. اخفض نحو هذا الجانب عن طريق ثني ركبتك.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'الوقوف مع الحديد على كتفيك. قم بإمالة جذعك إلى الأمام مع الحفاظ على ظهرك مستقيماً وثني ركبتيك قليلاً. اشعر بالتمدد في أوتار الركبة. العودة إلى الوضع المستقيم.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع الأداة أمام فخذيك باستخدام قبضة منبثقة. اسحب نحو ذقنك مع إبقاء مرفقيك أعلى من معصميك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع الأداة أمام فخذيك. ارفعي ذراعيك أمامك إلى مستوى الكتفين مع إبقاء المرفقين مثنيين قليلاً. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع الأداة باستخدام قبضة منبسطة (راحة اليد متجهة للأسفل). قم بثني مرفقيك بحيث توجه الأداة نحو كتفيك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'الوقوف مع الأداة باستخدام قبضة مستلقية. قم بثني مرفقيك مع إحضار الأداة نحو كتفيك مع إبقاء مرفقيك ثابتين على جانبي جذعك. خفض ببطء العودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'الوقوف مع ميل الجذع بزاوية 45 درجة. أمسك بالحديد بقبضة منبسطة. اسحب نحو بطنك مع الحفاظ على ظهرك محايدًا. اخفض ببطء.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'الوقوف مع كعبيك بعيدًا عن حافة المنصة. قم بالوقوف على أصابع قدميك مع الضغط على ساقيك. انزل ببطء مع السماح لكعبك بالهبوط إلى ما دون مستوى المنصة.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'ابدأ بوتيرة معتدلة وقم بالزيادة تدريجيًا.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'ابدأ بتراجع لوحي الكتف. السيطرة على مرحلة غريب الأطوار.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'ابدأ بتراجع لوحي الكتف. لا تميل جذعك إلى الخلف كثيرًا.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'ابدأ الحركة من تراجع لوحي الكتف. تجنب استخدام الزخم.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'ابدأ الحركة من تراجع لوحي الكتف. السيطرة على مرحلة الإطالة.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'خطوة للخلف مع خفض ركبتك الخلفية نحو الأرض. تبقى الركبة الأمامية محاذية للكاحل.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'خطوة للأمام مع خفض ركبتك الخلفية نحو الأرض. تبقى الركبة الأمامية محاذية للكاحل. ادفع للأعلى.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'خطوة للأمام مع خفض ركبتك الخلفية. استمر في التقدم للأمام بالتناوب بين الأرجل بشكل مستمر.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'خطوة داخل شريط فخ. قدم في عرض الورك. اخفض نفسك ممسكًا بالمقابض بظهر مستقيم. ادفع من خلال قدميك لتمديد الوركين والركبتين في وقت واحد.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'اتخذ خطوات طويلة لإشراك عضلات المؤخرة بشكل أكبر.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'يقوم تمرين زوتمان بتدريب ثني وتمديد الساعد.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'يجب أن يرعى الشريط ساقيك طوال الحركة. ركز على تمدد أوتار الركبة أثناء الهبوط.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'كلما ارتفع السطح، كلما زاد عمل الجزء العلوي من الصدر.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'يؤكد المقعد المائل على الجزء العلوي من الصدر. حافظ على تراجع شفرات كتفك طوال الحركة.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'النسخة المائلة أسهل وتشغل الجزء السفلي من الصدر.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'كلما كان جسمك أفقيًا، كلما كان الأمر أصعب. حافظ دائمًا على نشاطك الأساسي.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'الحركة تأتي من الوركين، وليس الظهر. حافظ على استقامة ظهرك خلال مرحلة الدفع.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'مقعد الواعظ يلغي استخدام الزخم. لا تدع الوزن ينخفض ​​في الأسفل.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'يعتبر الاندفاع العكسي أكثر أمانًا للركبتين من الاندفاع الأمامي.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'الدوران يأتي من الخصر وليس الرأس.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'يزيد تجعيد الساق أثناء الجلوس من نطاق الحركة. تجنب رفع عضلات المؤخرة عن المقعد.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'الدعم يزيل الضغط القطني. التركيز على التراجع.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'يقلل شريط المصيدة الضغط على العمود الفقري. حافظ على كتفيك متماشيا مع المقابض.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'الوزن في الأمام يساعد في الوضعية العمودية. حافظ على محاذاة ركبتيك.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'استخدم وزنًا خفيفًا. أبقِ ساعديك ثابتين على فخذيك.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'بيد واحدة وركبة واحدة على مقاعد البدلاء. اسحب الدمبل نحو جانبك مع إبقاء مرفقك قريبًا من جسمك. اخفض ببطء.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'مع رفع الحديد فوق رأسك، انزل إلى وضعية القرفصاء مع إبقاء ذراعيك مستقيمتين ومستقرتين. ارجع للأعلى مع الحفاظ على محاذاة الحديد.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'مع وضع ذراعيك أمام الكابل أو باستخدام الدمبل، اسحب الأداة نحو وجهك مع إبقاء مرفقيك مرتفعين. افصل بين يديك واجعل قبضتيك بالقرب من أذنيك. العودة ببطء.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'مع جسمك مائل تحت شريط منخفض، أمسك بقبضة منبسطة. اسحب صدرك إلى الشريط مع إبقاء جسمك جامدًا. اخفض ببطء.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'مع وضع قدميك على سطح مرتفع، اخفض صدرك نحو الأرض. ادفع لأعلى للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'مع وضع يديك على سطح مرتفع، قم بخفض صدرك نحو يديك. ادفع لأعلى للعودة إلى وضع البداية.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'مع وضع يديك على حافة المقعد، تقدم للأمام مع إخراج عضلات المؤخرة. قم بخفض جسمك مع ثني مرفقيك إلى 90 درجة. رفع.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'مع إمالة جذعك وثني مرفقك بزاوية 90 درجة، قم بمد ذراعك للخلف إلى الامتداد الكامل. العودة ببطء.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'مع الجزء العلوي من ظهرك على مقاعد البدلاء والوزن على الوركين. ادفع الوركين إلى الأعلى مع الضغط على عضلات المؤخرة. العودة ببطء.',
    },
    'pl': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'Wykonaj ruch powoli i pod kontrolą. Utrzymaj prawidłową postawę.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Zacznij od umiarkowanego ciężaru, aby opanować technikę.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Oddychaj głęboko. Nigdy nie forsuj się ponad naturalny zakres.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Utrzymaj zaangażowanie mięśni core przez cały czas. Kontroluj fazę ekscentryczną.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': 'Utrzymaj stabilność mięśni core przez całe ćwiczenie.',
      'Lower slowly': 'Opuszczaj powoli', 'lower slowly': 'opuszczaj powoli',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Oddychaj głęboko',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Używaj pełnego zakresu ruchu.',
      'Keep your feet shoulder-width apart.': 'Ustaw stopy na szerokość barków.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'Ścisły chwyt zwiększa zakres ruchu. Zacznij od wycofania.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'Bliski chwyt izoluje triceps. Utrzymuj ciało w linii prostej.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'Chwyt supinowany zwiększa zaangażowanie bicepsa. Unikaj używania pędu.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Wyreguluj siedzisko: kolana nie powinny być nadmiernie wyprostowane.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Zawsze ląduj miękko. Nie blokuj kolan.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Unikaj pędu. Skoncentruj się na unoszeniu miednicy.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Unikaj podnoszenia łokci powyżej wysokości ramion. Szerszy chwyt zmniejsza ryzyko uderzenia.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Unikaj rotacji ramion. Skup się wyłącznie na ruchu pionowym.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Unikaj kołysania tułowia. Kontroluj obie fazy.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Sztanga z przodu barków z wysokimi łokciami. Zejdź na dół, utrzymując tułów jak najbardziej pionowo. Popchnij z powrotem do góry.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Ustaw nogę w pozycji rozciągniętej, utrzymując tułów w pozycji pionowej. Przytrzymaj przez 20-30 sekund.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Ustaw nogę w pozycji rozciągniętej, plecy proste. Wytrzymaj 20-30 sekund, oddychając głęboko.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Wyciągnij nogę na zewnątrz w odwiedzeniu, kontrolując ruch. Wracaj powoli. Utrzymuj stabilność rdzenia.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Przesuń nogę w kierunku środka w przywiedzeniu, kontrolując ruch. Wracaj powoli. Utrzymuj stabilność rdzenia.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Napnij mięśnie brzucha przez całe ćwiczenie. Kontroluj fazę ekscentryczną.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'Nie przeprostuj ramion w fazie otwierania. Skoncentruj się na skurczu klatki piersiowej.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Nie pozwól, aby Twoje plecy się wygięły. Zacznij od częściowych wdrożeń.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Nie pozwól, aby biodra opadały w dół. Ściągnij łopatki.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Nie unoś bioder. Przytrzymaj skurcz u góry przez sekundę.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Nie blokuj kolan w wyprostowaniu. Stopy znajdujące się wyżej na platformie bardziej angażują pośladki.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Nie ciągnij za szyję. Skoncentruj się na skurczu brzucha.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Nie podnoś ramion powyżej wysokości ramion. Obróć nadgarstki lekko w dół (jakbyś nalewał wodę), aby odizolować boczną część mięśnia naramiennego.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Nie unoś bioder. Trzymaj ramiona nad nadgarstkami.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'Nie zaokrąglaj pleców w żadnym miejscu. Zaangażuj rdzeń przed pociągnięciem.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Nie zaokrąglaj pleców. Kontroluj fazę ekscentryczną.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'Nie zaokrąglaj pleców. Kontroluj fazę rozciągania.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'Nie zaokrąglaj pleców. Zacznij od lekkiego ciężaru.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Nie używaj kołysania ciałem. Skoncentruj się na izolowaniu mięśnia pośladkowego średniego.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'Nie używaj pędu. Skoncentruj się na izolowaniu przywodzicieli.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'Nie używaj pędu. Skoncentruj się na skurczu.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Hantle pozwalają na większy zakres ruchu. Przez cały ruch trzymaj łopatki ściągnięte.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'Stopy szersze niż szerokość ramion, z palcami skierowanymi na zewnątrz. Opuść się w dół, chwytając sztangę chwytem wewnętrznym. Naciskaj nogami i jednocześnie rozciągaj biodra, utrzymując proste plecy.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Zegnij łokcie, przenosząc ciężar w stronę ramion. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Całkowicie wyprostuj ramiona w fazie koncentrycznej. Wróć powoli do pozycji wyjściowej, kontrolując ruch.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Chwyć drążek nachwytem pronowanym na szerokość barków. Zaczynając od wyprostowanych ramion, podciągnij ciało do góry, aż broda odsunie się od drążka. Opuść się powoli z powrotem do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Chwyć drążek nachwytem supinacyjnym (dłonie skierowane do siebie) na szerokość barków. Zaczynając od wyprostowanych ramion, podciągnij ciało do góry, aż broda odsunie się od drążka. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Chwyć poręcze z wyprostowanymi ramionami. Opuść ciało, pochylając się lekko do przodu i zginając łokcie. Wykonaj pompki w górę, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'Wisząc na drążku lub leżąc, unieś nogi do góry, kontrolując ruch. Obniż się powoli.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'Wysokie łokcie zapobiegają przesuwaniu się sztangi. Wymaga dużej mobilności nadgarstków i kostek.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Przytrzymaj skurcz u góry przez sekundę. Unikaj pędu.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Przytrzymaj skurcz u góry przez sekundę. Trzymaj brodę w kierunku klatki piersiowej.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Utrzymuj skurcz u góry. Unikaj kompensacji plecami.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Trzymaj końce liny po bokach. Obracaj linę nad głową i skacz, gdy przechodzi ona pod twoimi stopami.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'W pozycji leżącej, opierając się na przedramionach i palcach stóp. Twoje ciało tworzy linię prostą od głowy do pięt. Przytrzymaj, napinając rdzeń.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'W pozycji leżącej z rękami na szerokości barków. Opuść klatkę piersiową w kierunku podłogi, zginając łokcie. Wypchnij się w górę, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej, utrzymując ciało w linii prostej.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'W pozycji push-up. Na zmianę szybko przyciągnij kolana do klatki piersiowej, utrzymując biodra nisko.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'W pozycji rozdzielonej. Opuść ciało, zginając przednie kolano. Wypchnij się w górę, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Trzymaj przeciwną stopę całkowicie na podłodze. Tułów wyprostowany.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Trzymaj ramię równolegle do podłogi. Unikaj pędu.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Trzymaj ramiona prosto. Skoncentruj się na skurczu mięśni najszerszych.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Trzymaj plecy płasko, a rdzeń zaangażowany. Unikaj kołysania tułowia.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Trzymaj plecy w pozycji neutralnej. Pociągnij w stronę talii lub klatki piersiowej. Pod koniec ruchu napnij mięśnie pleców.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Trzymaj plecy równolegle do podłogi. Pod koniec ruchu lekko obróć tułów.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Trzymaj klatkę piersiową uniesioną, a kolana w jednej linii z palcami stóp. Nie pozwól, aby kolana zapadły się do wewnątrz.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Trzymaj rdzeń napięty i proste plecy. Unikaj nadmiernego prostowania kręgosłupa lędźwiowego.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Trzymaj rdzeń zaangażowany, aby chronić plecy. Unikaj nadmiernego prostowania kręgosłupa lędźwiowego.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Utrzymuj swój rdzeń zaangażowany. Dostosuj prędkość do swojego poziomu sprawności.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Utrzymuj swój rdzeń zaangażowany. Unikaj nadmiernego prostowania kręgosłupa.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Trzymaj łokcie na wysokości ramion lub nieco powyżej. Niezbędny dla zdrowia stożka rotatorów.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Trzymaj łokcie blisko ciała. Unikaj rozszerzania łokci.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Trzymaj łokcie unieruchomione po bokach. Chwyt neutralny podkreśla mięsień ramienno-promieniowy nad bicepsem.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Trzymaj łokcie nieruchomo, skierowane w stronę sufitu. Kontroluj zejście.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Trzymaj łokcie nieruchomo podczas całego ruchu. Skoncentruj się na pełnym skurczu u góry.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Trzymaj łokcie nieruchomo. Nie używaj pędu.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Trzymaj łokcie nieruchomo. Skoncentruj się na pełnym skurczu.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Trzymaj łokcie nieruchomo. Skoncentruj się na pełnym wyproście.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Trzymaj łokcie skierowane w stronę sufitu i blisko głowy. Głowa długa jest maksymalnie aktywowana w pozycji rozciągniętej.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Trzymaj przednie kolano w jednej linii z palcami stóp. Koryguje nierównowagę mięśniową pomiędzy nogami.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Trzymaj piętę na podłodze. Zegnij kolano, aby rozciągnąć mięsień płaszczkowaty.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Trzymaj biodra w jednej linii. Nie pozwól, aby opadły w dół.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Staraj się skakać nisko. Do obracania liny używaj nadgarstków, a nie ramion.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Trzymaj kolano skierowane w stronę podłogi. Unikaj nadmiernego prostowania pleców.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Trzymaj kolana w jednej linii z palcami stóp. Pozycja stopy zmienia najbardziej zaangażowany mięsień.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Trzymaj kolana w jednej linii z palcami stóp. Pozycja sumo zmniejsza ścieżkę sztangi.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Utrzymuj poziom miednicy. Zacznij od lekkiego ciężaru.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Trzymaj łopatki ściągnięte. Kontroluj opadanie przez co najmniej 2 sekundy.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Trzymaj ramiona zrelaksowane. Dostosuj tempo do pożądanej intensywności.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Utrzymuj tułów stabilnie, unikając kołysania. Kontroluj zejście.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Utrzymuj tułów w pozycji pionowej i napięty rdzeń. Unikaj sytuacji, w której przednie kolano wychodzi poza palce stóp.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Trzymaj tułów w pozycji pionowej, aby odizolować triceps. Im niżej zejdziesz, tym większe zaangażowanie klatki piersiowej.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Trzymaj nadgarstki w pozycji neutralnej. Odwrotne ugięcie wzmacnia mięśnie przedramienia.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'Klękanie z kołem z przodu. Obróć koło do przodu, opuszczając ciało w kierunku podłogi. Pociągnij koło z powrotem w stronę kolan.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Pochylenie się do przodu zwiększa zaangażowanie klatki piersiowej. Pozycja pionowa izoluje triceps.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Połóż się z ugiętymi kolanami. Przyciągnij ramiona do kolan, napinając mięśnie brzucha. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Połóż się z uniesionymi nogami. Przyciągnij kolana do klatki piersiowej, unosząc miednicę. Wracaj powoli.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Połóż się twarzą w dół na maszynie z podkładkami na kostkach. Zegnij kolana, zbliżając pięty do pośladków. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Połóż się na ławce z hantlami w każdej ręce. Opuść hantle w stronę klatki piersiowej, utrzymując nadgarstki stabilnie. Popchnij mocno w górę, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Połóż się na ławce z hantlami w każdej ręce. Opuść ramiona na boki, utrzymując lekkie zgięcie łokcia. Unieś hantle w górę po łuku, jakbyś przytulał drzewo. Wracaj powoli.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Połóż się na ławce z uchwytem na szerokość barków. Opuść sztangę, trzymając łokcie blisko tułowia. Wypchnij się w górę, napinając triceps.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Połóż się na ławce z narzędziem nad klatką piersiową i wyciągnij ręce. Zegnij łokcie, opuszczając ciężar w stronę czoła. Przedłuż powrót do pozycji.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Połóż się na ławce z narzędziem nad klatką piersiową, ramiona prawie wyciągnięte. Opuść ciężar za głowę, utrzymując lekko ugięte łokcie. Wróć do pozycji wyjściowej po łuku.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Połóż się na ławce ze stopami na podłodze. Chwyć sztangę szerzej niż szerokość barków. Opuść sztangę do klatki piersiowej, utrzymując łokcie pod kątem około 45 stopni. Mocno pchnij do góry.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Połóż się na ławce opadającej z zabezpieczonymi stopami. Chwyć narzędzie szerzej niż szerokość ramion. Opuść do dolnej części klatki piersiowej. Naciśnij mocno, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Połóż się na pochyłej podporze ze zwisającymi ciężarkami. Pociągnij w kierunku tułowia, napinając mięśnie grzbietu. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Opuść się do przysiadu, a następnie energicznie podskocz w górę. Wyląduj miękko, uginając kolana.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Opuść się do przysiadu, połóż ręce na podłodze i przeskocz stopy do pozycji pompki. Wykonaj pompkę, podskocz stopami w stronę dłoni, a następnie podskocz z rękami nad głową.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Utrzymuj stałe tempo. Prawidłowa postawa podczas całego ćwiczenia.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Utrzymuj wyprostowaną postawę z lekkim pochyleniem do przodu. Wykonuj naprzemienne kroki w stałym tempie. Wyląduj ze stopą w połowie kroku.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Utrzymuj to samo zgięcie łokcia podczas całego ruchu. Skoncentruj się na skurczu klatki piersiowej pod koniec ruchu.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Utrzymuj to samo zgięcie łokcia. Kontroluj opadanie przez 2 sekundy.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Utrzymuj lekkie zgięcie łokcia. Pulower jest jednym z niewielu ćwiczeń rozciągających mięśnie grzbietu.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Umiarkowane napięcie, nigdy ból. Wydech podczas rozciągania.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'Na rękach i kolanach lub stojąc przy kablu. Wyciągnij nogę do tyłu, ściskając pośladek. Wracaj powoli.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'Leżąc na boku, oprzyj się na przedramieniu, ciało w linii prostej. Unieś biodra, utrzymując tę ​​pozycję.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Pedałuj utrzymując stałe tempo. Trzymaj plecy w pozycji neutralnej.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Fazę podnoszenia wykonaj z supinacją. Obróć nadgarstki do pronacji u góry. Dolny z pronowanym uchwytem. Wróć do supinacji na dole.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Wykonuj ruch kontrolując zarówno fazę ekscentryczną, jak i koncentryczną. Utrzymuj swój rdzeń zaangażowany.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Wykonuj ruch kontrolując zarówno fazę ekscentryczną, jak i koncentryczną. Trzymaj łopatki ściągnięte.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Wykonuj ruch eksplozywnie w górę lub do przodu. Wyląduj miękko, uginając kolana. Kontroluj lądowanie.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Wykonuj ruch powoli w obu fazach. Pauza na dole zwiększa rozciągnięcie łydki.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Wykonuj rotację płynnie i w sposób ciągły. Wyciskanie Arnolda to jedno z niewielu ćwiczeń angażujących wszystkie włókna mięśniowe.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Ułóż dłonie w kształcie rombu pod klatką piersiową. Opuść ciało, trzymając łokcie blisko tułowia. Wypchnij się w górę, napinając triceps.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Ustaw się w maszynie do hack squatów z ramionami pod poduszkami. Zejdź, uginając kolana pod kątem 90 stopni, a następnie wypchnij się w górę.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Naciskaj głównie stopą na podniesioną powierzchnię. Trzymaj tułów w pozycji pionowej.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Naciskaj nogami, następnie odchyl tułów do tyłu i na koniec przyciągnij wiosło do brzucha. Odwróć kolejność w drodze powrotnej.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Wymaga doskonałej mobilności ramion, bioder i kostek. Zacznij bez ciężaru.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Ściągnij łopatki i trzymaj je zablokowane. Nie odbijaj ciężaru od klatki piersiowej.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Ściągnij łopatki, aby ustabilizować bark.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Obróć się od talii, a nie tylko od ramion.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Obróć tułów, przyciągając jeden łokieć do przeciwnego kolana. Powtórz z drugiej strony.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Obróć nadgarstek na zewnątrz u góry, aby zmaksymalizować szczyt. Utrzymuj stabilny tułów.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Siedź z hantlami na wysokości ramion i dłońmi skierowanymi do siebie. Naciśnij w górę, obracając nadgarstki na zewnątrz, aż dłonie będą skierowane do przodu. Opuść wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Siedź z łokciem opartym na wewnętrznej stronie uda. Zegnij łokieć, przybliżając hantle do ramienia. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Siedź z podniesionymi stopami i tułowiem pod kątem 45 stopni. Obracaj tułów z boku na bok, opierając dłonie na podłodze obok bioder.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Sekwencja: nogi, potem tułów i ramiona podczas ciągnięcia.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Usiądź przy maszynie do ściągania najszerszego odcinka ciała i chwyć drążek szerokim, pronowanym chwytem. Przyciągnij drążek do klatki piersiowej, odchylając tułów lekko do tyłu. Kontroluj powrót do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Usiądź na maszynie do ściągania najszerszego odcinka ciała z chwytem bliskim lub neutralnym. Przyciągnij drążek do klatki piersiowej, trzymając łokcie blisko ciała. Kontroluj powrót.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Usiądź przy niskim kablu, opierając stopy na wspornikach. Pociągnij uchwyt w stronę talii, utrzymując proste plecy. Napnij mięśnie pleców i powoli wróć.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Usiądź przy maszynie z podkładkami na kostkach. Wyciągnij nogi w górę, napinając mięśnie czworogłowe. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Usiądź przy maszynie z podkładkami na kostkach. Zegnij kolana, zbliżając pięty do pośladków. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Usiądź na ławce kaznodziei z rękami opartymi na podkładce. Zegnij łokcie, przybliżając narzędzie do ramion. Opuszczaj powoli, prawie do pełnego wyprostu.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Usiądź na maszynie, opierając plecy o podkładkę. Ułóż łokcie na poduszkach. Przesuń ramiona w stronę środka, napinając klatkę piersiową. Wróć powoli do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Usiądź na maszynie ze stopami na platformie na szerokości bioder. Opuść się, zginając kolana do 90 stopni. Naciskaj, prostując nogi.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Usiądź na ławce skośnej ze stopami opartymi na podłodze. Chwyć narzędzie szerzej niż szerokość ramion. Opuść do górnego poziomu klatki piersiowej. Naciśnij mocno, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Usiądź z przedramionami na udach. Chwyć narzędzie chwytem supinacyjnym. Zegnij nadgarstki w górę i powoli opuść.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Rozsuń linę u dołu, aby zmaksymalizować skurcz. Trzymaj łokcie nieruchomo.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Stojąc na środku kabla, z jednym uchwytem na rękę. Trzymaj ramiona lekko ugięte. Przesuń ręce w stronę środka, krzyżując je. Wróć powoli do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'Stojąc przy wysokim kablu z liną. Łokcie trzymaj po bokach tułowia. Popchnij linę w dół, oddzielając jej końce. Wracaj powoli.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'Stojąc przy wysokim kablu. Łokcie trzymaj po bokach tułowia. Naciśnij w dół, całkowicie rozciągając ramiona. Wracaj powoli.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Stojąc twarzą do wysokiego kabla z prawie wyciągniętymi ramionami. Przyciągnij sztangę do ud, tworząc łuk, trzymając ramiona prosto. Wróć powoli do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Stojąc przed ławką. Połóż jedną stopę na podwyższonej powierzchni i popchnij ją w górę. Opuszczaj powoli, kontrolując ruch.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'Stojąc na jednej nodze. Opuść tułów do przodu, utrzymując plecy proste, podczas gdy wolna noga rozciąga się do tyłu. Wróć do pozycji pionowej, napinając pośladki.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'Stojąc lub siedząc z narzędziem na wysokości ramion. Wypchnij się w górę, całkowicie rozciągając ramiona. Opuszczaj powoli wracając do pozycji wyjściowej z ciężarem na wysokości ramion.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'Stojąc lub siedząc z narzędziem na wysokości ramion. Wypchnij się w górę, całkowicie rozciągając ramiona. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'Stojąc lub siedząc z narzędziem nad głową, z wyciągniętymi ramionami. Zegnij łokcie, opuszczając ciężar za głowę. Przedłuż powrót do góry.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Stojąc z hantlami w każdej ręce po bokach. Unieś ramiona w bok na wysokość barków, łokcie lekko ugięte. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Stojąc z ciężarkami w każdej ręce po bokach. Podnieś ramiona w kierunku uszu, ściskając pułapki. Przytrzymaj skurcz przez sekundę, a następnie powoli opuść.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Stojąc z hantlami po bokach, z neutralnym chwytem (kciuki do góry). Zegnij łokcie, przyciągając hantle do ramion. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Stanie ze stopami na szerokość bioder. Zawias w biodrach, przesuwając ciężar między nogami, a następnie gwałtownie popchnij biodra do przodu, przesuwając ciężar do wysokości ramion.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Stanie ze stopami na szerokość bioder. Opuść sztangę wzdłuż nóg, utrzymując lekko ugięte kolana i proste plecy. Opuść się, aż poczujesz napięcie w ścięgnach podkolanowych, a następnie wróć do góry.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Stanie ze stopami na szerokość bioder. Opuść się z wyprostowanymi plecami i klatką piersiową do góry. Wciśnij stopy w ziemię i jednocześnie wyprostuj biodra i kolana, trzymając sztangę blisko nóg.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Stojąc ze stopami na szerokość ramion, trzymaj hantle przed klatką piersiową. Zejdź na dół, trzymając klatkę piersiową uniesioną do góry. Wróć do góry, naciskając pięty.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Stanie ze stopami na szerokość ramion. Opuść ciało, uginając kolana i biodra, jakbyś siedział na krześle. Opuść się, aż uda znajdą się równolegle do podłogi. Przebij się przez pięty.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Stojąc ze złączonymi stopami. Wykonaj szeroki krok w bok, trzymając przeciwną stopę nieruchomo. Opuść się w tę stronę, zginając kolano.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Stojąc ze sztangą na ramionach. Pochyl tułów do przodu, utrzymując proste plecy i lekko ugięte kolana. Poczuj napięcie w ścięgnach podkolanowych. Wróć do pozycji pionowej.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Stań z narzędziem przed udami, używając pronowanego chwytu. Pociągnij w stronę podbródka, trzymając łokcie wyżej niż nadgarstki. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Stań z narzędziem przed udami. Unieś ręce przed siebie na wysokość barków, łokcie lekko ugięte. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Stanie z narzędziem z pronowanym chwytem (dłonie skierowane w dół). Zegnij łokcie, przybliżając narzędzie do ramion. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Stanie z narzędziem przy użyciu chwytu supinacyjnego. Zegnij łokcie, przybliżając narzędzie do ramion, utrzymując łokcie unieruchomione po bokach tułowia. Opuść się powoli wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Stojąc z tułowiem nachylonym pod kątem 45 stopni. Chwyć sztangę nachwytem pronowanym. Pociągnij w stronę brzucha, utrzymując plecy w pozycji neutralnej. Obniż się powoli.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Stań z piętami nad krawędzią platformy. Podnieś się na palcach, ściskając łydki. Opuść się powoli, pozwalając piętom opaść poniżej poziomu platformy.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Zacznij od umiarkowanego tempa i stopniowo je zwiększaj.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Zacznij od ściągnięcia łopatek. Kontroluj fazę ekscentryczną.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Zacznij od ściągnięcia łopatek. Nie odchylaj tułowia zbyt daleko do tyłu.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Rozpocznij ruch od ściągnięcia łopatek. Unikaj używania pędu.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Rozpocznij ruch od ściągnięcia łopatek. Kontroluj fazę wydłużania.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Wykonaj krok do tyłu, opuszczając tylne kolano w kierunku podłogi. Przednie kolano pozostaje w jednej linii z kostką.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Wykonaj krok do przodu, opuszczając tylne kolano w kierunku podłogi. Przednie kolano pozostaje w jednej linii z kostką. Popchnij z powrotem do góry.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Wykonaj krok do przodu, opuszczając tylne kolano. Kontynuuj krok do przodu, ciągle naprzemiennie nogami.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Wejdź do środka pułapki. Stopy na szerokość bioder. Opuść się, chwytając uchwyty z prostymi plecami. Przepychaj stopy, jednocześnie rozciągając biodra i kolana.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Wykonuj długie kroki, aby bardziej zaangażować pośladki.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'Uginanie Zottmana ćwiczy zarówno zgięcie, jak i wyprost przedramienia.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'Sztanga powinna dotykać nóg podczas całego ruchu. Podczas schodzenia skup się na rozciągnięciu ścięgna podkolanowego.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Im wyższa powierzchnia, tym bardziej pracuje górna klatka piersiowa.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Ławka skośna podkreśla górną część klatki piersiowej. Przez cały ruch trzymaj łopatki ściągnięte.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'Wersja pochylona jest łatwiejsza i angażuje dolną część klatki piersiowej.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Im bardziej poziome jest twoje ciało, tym jest to trudniejsze. Zawsze utrzymuj zaangażowanie rdzenia.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'Ruch pochodzi z bioder, a nie z pleców. Podczas fazy pchania trzymaj plecy prosto.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'Ławka kaznodziei eliminuje użycie pędu. Nie pozwól, aby ciężar spadł na dół.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'Wykrok w tył jest bezpieczniejszy dla kolan niż wypad w przód.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'Rotacja pochodzi z talii, a nie głowy.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'Uginanie nóg w pozycji siedzącej zwiększa zakres ruchu. Unikaj podnoszenia pośladków z siedzenia.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'Podparcie eliminuje obciążenie lędźwiowe. Skup się na cofaniu.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'Drążek pułapkowy zmniejsza obciążenie kręgosłupa. Trzymaj ramiona w jednej linii z uchwytami.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'Ciężar z przodu pomaga w utrzymaniu pionowej postawy. Trzymaj kolana w jednej linii.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Użyj lekkiego ciężaru. Trzymaj przedramiona nieruchomo na udach.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Z jedną ręką i jednym kolanem na ławce. Pociągnij hantle w swoją stronę, trzymając łokieć blisko ciała. Obniż się powoli.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Trzymając sztangę nad głową, zejdź do przysiadu, utrzymując ramiona proste i stabilne. Wróć do góry, trzymając sztangę w jednej linii.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Trzymając ręce z przodu na linie lub z hantlami, pociągnij przyrząd w stronę twarzy, utrzymując łokcie wysoko. Rozdziel ręce, zbliżając pięści do uszu. Wracaj powoli.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Trzymając ciało pochylone pod niską drążkiem, chwyć nachwytem pronowanym. Przyciągnij klatkę piersiową do drążka, utrzymując ciało w sztywności. Obniż się powoli.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Trzymając stopy na podwyższonej powierzchni, opuść klatkę piersiową w kierunku podłogi. Wykonaj pompki w górę, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Trzymając dłonie na podwyższonej powierzchni, opuść klatkę piersiową w stronę dłoni. Wykonaj pompki w górę, wracając do pozycji wyjściowej.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Opierając ręce na krawędzi ławki, wykonaj krok do przodu z wyciągniętymi pośladkami. Opuść ciało, zginając łokcie do 90 stopni. Podnieś.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Z tułowiem nachylonym i łokciem zgiętym pod kątem 90 stopni, wyciągnij ramię do tyłu, aż do pełnego wyprostu. Powoli wróć.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Z górną częścią pleców na ławce i ciężarem na biodrach. Wypchnij biodra w górę, napinając pośladki. Wracaj powoli.',
    },
    'ro': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'Execută mișcarea lent și controlat. Menține o postură corectă.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Începe cu o greutate moderată pentru a stăpâni tehnica.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Respiră adânc. Nu forța niciodată peste limita ta naturală.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Menține mușchii core angajați pe tot parcursul exercițiului. Controlează faza excentrică.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': 'Menține core-ul stabil pe tot parcursul exercițiului.',
      'Lower slowly': 'Coboară lent', 'lower slowly': 'coboară lent',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Respiră adânc',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Folosește amplitudinea completă de mișcare.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'O prindere strânsă mărește aria de mișcare. Începeți de la retragere.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'O prindere strânsă izolează tricepsul. Ține-ți corpul în linie dreaptă.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'O prindere în supinație crește angajarea bicepsului. Evitați utilizarea impulsului.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Reglați scaunul: genunchii nu ar trebui să se hiperextendă.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Aterizați întotdeauna încet. Nu vă blocați genunchii.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Evitați impulsul. Concentrați-vă pe ridicarea pelvisului.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Evitați să ridicați coatele peste înălțimea umerilor. O prindere mai largă reduce riscul de impact.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Evitați să vă rotiți umerii. Concentrați-vă doar pe mișcarea verticală.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Evitați să vă balansați trunchiul. Controlați ambele faze.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Mreană pe partea din față a umerilor cu coatele înalte. Coborâți ținând trunchiul cât mai vertical posibil. Împinge înapoi în sus.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Aduceți piciorul într-o poziție de întindere, ținând trunchiul drept. Țineți 20-30 de secunde.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Aduceți piciorul într-o poziție de întindere cu spatele drept. Țineți 20-30 de secunde, respirând profund.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Aduceți piciorul în exterior în abducție controlând mișcarea. Întoarce-te încet. Păstrează-ți miezul stabil.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Aduceți piciorul spre centru în aducție controlând mișcarea. Întoarce-te încet. Păstrează-ți miezul stabil.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Contractați-vă abdomenul pe tot parcursul exercițiului. Controlați faza excentrică.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'Nu vă hiperextindeți brațele în timpul fazei de deschidere. Concentrați-vă pe contracția pieptului.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Nu lăsați spatele să se arcuiască. Începeți cu lansări parțiale.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Nu lăsați șoldurile să se încline în jos. Retrageți omoplații.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Nu ridicați șoldurile. Țineți contracția în partea de sus pentru o secundă.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Nu blocați genunchii în extensie. Picioarele mai sus pe platformă angajează mai mult fesierii.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Nu vă trageți de gât. Concentrați-vă pe contracția abdominală.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Nu ridicați brațele peste înălțimea umerilor. Rotiți încheieturile ușor în jos (ca și când turnați apă) pentru a izola deltoidul lateral.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Nu ridicați șoldurile. Ține-ți umerii peste încheieturile mâinii.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'Nu vă rotunjiți spatele în niciun moment. Angajați-vă miezul înainte de a trage.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Nu vă rotunjiți spatele. Controlați faza excentrică.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'Nu vă rotunjiți spatele. Controlați faza de întindere.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'Nu vă rotunjiți spatele. Începeți cu o greutate mică.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Nu utilizați balansul corporal. Concentrați-vă pe izolarea gluteus medius.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'Nu folosi impulsul. Concentrați-vă pe izolarea adductorilor.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'Nu folosi impulsul. Concentrați-vă pe contracție.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Ganterele permit o gamă mai mare de mișcare. Țineți omoplații retractați pe tot parcursul mișcării.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'Picioarele sunt mai late decât lățimea umerilor, cu degetele îndreptate spre exterior. În jos, ținând mreana cu o prindere interioară. Împingeți cu picioarele și extindeți șoldurile simultan, ținând spatele drept.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Flexează-ți coatele aducând greutatea către umeri. Coborâți încet.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Întindeți-vă complet brațele în faza concentrică. Reveniți încet la poziția de pornire controlând mișcarea.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Prindeți bara cu o prindere pronată la lățimea umerilor. Începând cu brațele întinse, trageți corpul în sus până când bărbia eliberează bara. Coborâți încet înapoi la poziția de pornire.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Prindeți bara cu o prindere supinată (palmele îndreptate spre dvs.) la lățimea umerilor. Începând cu brațele întinse, trageți corpul în sus până când bărbia eliberează bara. Coborâți încet.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Prindeți barele paralele cu brațele întinse. Coborâți corpul aplecându-vă ușor înainte și îndoind coatele. Împingeți în sus revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'Atârnat de bară sau culcat, ridică picioarele în sus controlând mișcarea. Coborâți încet.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'Coatele înalte împiedică mreana să alunece. Necesită o mobilitate semnificativă a încheieturii și gleznelor.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Țineți contracția în partea de sus pentru o secundă. Evitați impulsul.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Țineți contracția în partea de sus pentru o secundă. Ține-ți bărbia spre piept.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Țineți contracția în partea de sus. Evitați să compensați cu spatele.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Țineți capetele frânghiei în lateral. Rotiți frânghia deasupra capului și săriți când trece pe sub picioare.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'În poziție culcat, sprijinindu-vă pe antebrațe și degetele de la picioare. Corpul tău formează o linie dreaptă de la cap la călcâi. Țineți prin contractarea miezului dvs.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'În poziție culcat cu mâinile la lățimea umerilor. Coborâți pieptul spre podea îndoind coatele. Împingeți în sus revenind la poziția inițială ținând corpul în linie dreaptă.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'În poziție de push-up. Alternativ, aduceți rapid genunchii spre piept, menținând șoldurile jos.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'Într-o poziție divizată. Coborâți corpul îndoind genunchiul din față. Împingeți în sus revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Țineți piciorul opus complet pe podea. Trunchiul drept.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Păstrați brațul superior paralel cu podeaua. Evitați impulsul.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Ține-ți brațele drepte. Concentrați-vă pe contracția laterală.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Ține-ți spatele plat și miezul angajat. Evitați să vă balansați trunchiul.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Ține-ți spatele într-o poziție neutră. Trageți spre talie sau piept. Contractați mușchii spatelui la sfârșitul mișcării.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Ține spatele paralel cu podeaua. Rotiți-vă ușor trunchiul la sfârșitul mișcării.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Ține-ți pieptul sus și genunchii aliniați cu degetele de la picioare. Nu lăsați genunchii să se prăbușească spre interior.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Ține-ți miezul angajat și spatele drept. Evitați hiperextensia coloanei vertebrale lombare.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Păstrați-vă miezul angajat pentru a vă proteja spatele. Evitați hiperextensia coloanei vertebrale lombare.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Păstrează-ți nucleul angajat. Adaptează viteza la nivelul tău de fitness.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Păstrează-ți nucleul angajat. Evitați hiperextinderea coloanei vertebrale.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Țineți coatele la înălțimea umerilor sau puțin deasupra. Esențial pentru sănătatea manșetei rotatorilor.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Ține-ți coatele aproape de corp. Evitați să vă evazați coatele.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Ține-ți coatele fixate în lateral. Prindere neutră subliniază brahioradialul peste biceps.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'Ține-ți coatele fixate îndreptate spre tavan. Controlează coborârea.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Ține-ți coatele fixate pe tot parcursul mișcării. Concentrați-vă pe contracția completă în partea de sus.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Ține-ți coatele fixate. Nu folosi impulsul.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Ține-ți coatele fixate. Concentrați-vă pe contracția completă.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Ține-ți coatele fixate. Concentrați-vă pe extensia completă.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Țineți coatele îndreptate spre tavan și aproape de cap. Capul lung este activat maxim în poziția întinsă.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Țineți genunchiul din față aliniat cu degetele de la picioare. Corectează dezechilibrele musculare dintre picioare.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Ține călcâiul pe podea. Îndoiți genunchiul pentru a întinde soleul.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Ține-ți șoldurile aliniate. Evitați să le lăsați să cadă în jos.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Ține-ți săriturile scăzute. Folosește-ți încheieturile, nu brațele, pentru a roti frânghia.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Țineți genunchiul îndreptat spre podea. Evitați hiperextinderea spatelui.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Ține-ți genunchii aliniați cu degetele de la picioare. Poziția piciorului schimbă cel mai antrenat mușchi.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Ține-ți genunchii aliniați cu degetele de la picioare. Poziția de sumo reduce traseul mrenei.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Păstrează-ți pelvisul la nivel. Începeți cu o greutate mică.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Țineți omoplații retractați. Controlați coborârea timp de cel puțin 2 secunde.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Ține-ți umerii relaxați. Adaptați ritmul la intensitatea dorită.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Păstrați-vă trunchiul stabil evitând balansarea. Controlează coborârea.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Ține-ți trunchiul drept și miezul angajat. Evitați să vă lăsați genunchiul din față să treacă pe lângă degetele de la picioare.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Ține-ți trunchiul vertical pentru a izola tricepsul. Cu cât cobori mai jos, cu atât este mai mare angajarea pieptului.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Ține-ți încheieturile într-o poziție neutră. Curla inversă întărește mușchii antebrațului.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'Îngenuncheat cu roata în față. Rotiți roata înainte coborând corpul spre podea. Trageți roata înapoi spre genunchi.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Aplecarea în față crește implicarea în piept. Poziția verticală izolează tricepsul.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Întinde-te cu genunchii îndoiți. Adu umerii spre genunchi contractând abdomenul. Coborâți încet.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Întinde-te cu picioarele ridicate. Adu-ți genunchii spre piept ridicând pelvisul. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Întindeți-vă cu fața în jos pe aparat cu tampoane pe glezne. Flechează-ți genunchii aducând călcâiele spre fesieri. Coborâți încet.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Întindeți-vă pe bancă cu o ganteră în fiecare mână. Coborâți ganterele spre piept, păstrând încheieturile stabile. Împingeți ferm în sus, revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Întindeți-vă pe bancă cu o ganteră în fiecare mână. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Întindeți-vă pe bancă cu o prindere la lățimea umerilor. Coborâți mreana ținând coatele aproape de trunchi. Împingeți în sus strângând tricepsul.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Întindeți-vă pe bancă cu instrumentul deasupra pieptului, cu brațele întinse. Flechează coatele, coborând greutatea spre frunte. Extindeți revenirea la poziție.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Întindeți-vă pe bancă cu instrumentul deasupra pieptului, cu brațele aproape întinse. Coborâți greutatea în spatele capului, ținând coatele ușor îndoite. Reveniți la poziția inițială într-un arc.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Întinde-te pe bancă cu picioarele pe podea. Prindeți mreana mai lat decât lățimea umerilor. Coborâți mreana la piept, ținând coatele la aproximativ 45 de grade. Împingeți ferm în sus.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Întindeți-vă pe banca de declin cu picioarele asigurate. Prindeți instrumentul mai lat decât lățimea umerilor. Mai jos spre pieptul inferior. Împingeți ferm revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Întindeți-vă pe suportul înclinat cu greutățile atârnând. Trageți spre trunchi contractând dorsalul. Coborâți încet.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Coborâți într-o ghemuit, apoi săriți în sus exploziv. Aterizează ușor îndoind genunchii.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Coborâți-vă într-o ghemuială, puneți mâinile pe podea și săriți cu picioarele într-o poziție de push-up. Efectuați o împingere, săriți picioarele spre mâini, apoi săriți cu brațele deasupra capului.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Menține un ritm constant. Poziția corectă pe tot parcursul exercițiului.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Mentineti o pozitie verticala cu o usoara aplecare inainte. Alternează pașii într-un ritm constant. Aterizează cu piciorul la mijlocul pasului.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Mențineți aceeași îndoire a cotului pe tot parcursul mișcării. Concentrați-vă pe contracția pieptului la sfârșitul mișcării.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Mențineți aceeași îndoire a cotului. Controlați coborârea timp de 2 secunde.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Mențineți ușoară îndoire a cotului. Puloverul este unul dintre puținele exerciții care întinde lat.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Tensiune moderată, niciodată durere. Expiră în timp ce te întinzi.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'Pe mâini și genunchi sau stând la cablu. Întinde-ți piciorul înapoi strângând fesierii. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'Pe partea ta sprijinindu-te pe antebraț cu corpul în linie dreaptă. Ridicați șoldurile menținând poziția.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'Pedale menținând un ritm constant. Ține-ți spatele într-o poziție neutră.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Efectuați faza de ridicare cu o prindere supinată. Rotiți încheieturile la pronație în partea de sus. Jos cu o prindere pronată. Reveniți la supinat în partea de jos.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Efectuați mișcarea controlând atât fazele excentrice, cât și cele concentrice. Păstrează-ți nucleul angajat.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Efectuați mișcarea controlând atât fazele excentrice, cât și cele concentrice. Țineți omoplații retractați.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Efectuați mișcarea exploziv în sus sau înainte. Aterizează ușor îndoind genunchii. Controlați aterizarea.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Efectuați mișcarea încet în ambele faze. Pauza de jos crește întinderea gambei.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Efectuați rotația fluid și continuu. Presa Arnold este unul dintre puținele exerciții care angajează toate fibrele musculare.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Poziționați mâinile în formă de diamant sub piept. Coborâți corpul ținând coatele aproape de trunchi. Împingeți în sus strângând tricepsul.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Poziționați-vă în mașina de ghemuit cu umerii sub tampoane. Coborâți îndoind genunchii la 90 de grade, apoi împingeți în sus.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Împingeți în principal cu piciorul pe suprafața ridicată. Ține-ți trunchiul drept.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Împingeți cu picioarele, apoi lăsați-vă trunchiul înapoi, în cele din urmă trageți vâsla spre abdomen. Inversați ordinea la retur.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Necesită o mobilitate excelentă a umerilor, șoldurilor și gleznelor. Începeți fără greutate.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Retrageți omoplații și țineți-i blocați. Nu aruncați greutatea pe piept.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Retrageți omoplații pentru a stabiliza umărul.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Rotiți de la talie, nu doar de la brațe.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Rotiți-vă trunchiul aducând un cot spre genunchiul opus. Repetați din cealaltă parte.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Rotiți încheietura mâinii spre exterior în partea de sus pentru a maximiza vârful. Păstrează-ți trunchiul stabil.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Asezat cu gantere la inaltimea umerilor si palmele indreptate spre tine. Apăsați în sus, rotindu-vă încheieturile spre exterior, până când palmele sunt îndreptate înainte. Coborâți revenirea la poziția inițială.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Asezat cu cotul sprijinit pe interiorul coapsei. Flexează-ți cotul aducând haltera spre umăr. Coborâți încet.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Asezat cu picioarele ridicate si trunchiul la 45 de grade. Rotiți-vă trunchiul dintr-o parte în alta, aducând mâinile pe podea, lângă șolduri.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Secvență: picioare, apoi trunchi și brațe în timpul tragerii.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Așezați-vă la mașina de tragere lat și prindeți bara cu o prindere pronată largă. Trageți bara spre piept, aplecându-vă trunchiul ușor înapoi. Controlați revenirea la poziția de pornire.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Stați la mașina de tragere lat cu o prindere apropiată sau neutră. Trageți bara spre piept, ținând coatele aproape de corp. Controlați returul.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Stai la cablul jos cu picioarele pe suporturi. Trageți mânerul spre talie, ținând spatele drept. Contractați mușchii spatelui și reveniți încet.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Stai la aparat cu tampoane pe glezne. Intinde-ti picioarele in sus contractand cvadricepsul. Coborâți încet.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Stai la aparat cu tampoane pe glezne. Flechează-ți genunchii aducând călcâiele spre fesieri. Coborâți încet.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Stai la banca predicatorului cu brațele sprijinite pe suport. Flechează coatele aducând instrumentul spre umeri. Coborâți încet aproape până la extinderea completă.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Stați în mașină cu spatele sprijinit de suport. Poziționați coatele pe plăcuțe. Adu-ți brațele spre centru contractând pieptul. Reveniți încet la poziția de pornire.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Stați în mașină cu picioarele pe platformă la lățimea șoldurilor. Coborâți îndoind genunchii la 90 de grade. Împingeți prin extinderea picioarelor.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Stați pe banca înclinată cu picioarele pe podea. Prindeți instrumentul mai lat decât lățimea umerilor. Coborâți până la nivelul superior al pieptului. Împingeți ferm revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Stai cu antebrațele pe coapse. Prindeți instrumentul cu o prindere supinată. Flexiți încheieturile în sus și coborâți încet.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Întindeți frânghia în partea de jos pentru a maximiza contracția. Ține-ți coatele fixate.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Stând în centrul cablului cu un mâner pe mână. Ține-ți brațele ușor îndoite. Adu-ți mâinile spre centru traversându-le. Reveniți încet la poziția de pornire.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'Stând la cablul înalt cu frânghia. Ține-ți coatele fixate pe părțile laterale ale trunchiului. Împingeți frânghia în jos, separând capetele. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'Stând la cablul înalt. Ține-ți coatele fixate pe părțile laterale ale trunchiului. Împingeți în jos, extinzând complet brațele. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Stând cu fața la cablul înalt, cu brațele aproape întinse. Aduceți bara spre coapse într-un arc ținând brațele drepte. Reveniți încet la poziția de pornire.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Stând în fața unei bănci. Așezați un picior pe suprafața ridicată și împingeți în sus. Coborâți încet controlând mișcarea.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'Stând pe un picior. Coborâți trunchiul înainte, ținând spatele drept în timp ce piciorul liber se extinde în spate. Reveniți în poziția verticală strângând fesierii.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'În picioare sau așezat cu instrumentul la înălțimea umerilor. Împingeți în sus, extinzându-vă complet brațele. Coborâți, revenind încet la poziția inițială, cu greutatea la înălțimea umerilor.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'În picioare sau așezat cu instrumentul la înălțimea umerilor. Împingeți în sus, extinzându-vă complet brațele. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'În picioare sau așezat cu mașina deasupra capului, brațele întinse. Flechează coatele scăzând greutatea din spatele capului. Extindeți revenirea în sus.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Stați în picioare cu o ganteră în fiecare mână, pe partea laterală. Ridicați brațele lateral până la înălțimea umerilor, ținând coatele ușor îndoite. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Stând cu o greutate în fiecare mână, de lângă tine. Ridică umerii spre urechi strângând capcanele. Țineți contracția pentru o secundă, apoi coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Stați în picioare cu gantere în lateral, cu o prindere neutră (degetul mare în sus). Flexează-ți coatele aducând ganterele spre umerii tăi. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Stând cu picioarele la lățimea șoldurilor. Balamală la șolduri balansând greutatea dintre picioare, apoi conduceți exploziv șoldurile înainte, balansând greutatea până la înălțimea umerilor.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Stând cu picioarele la lățimea șoldurilor. Coborâți mreana de-a lungul picioarelor, ținând genunchii ușor îndoiți și spatele drept. Coborâți până când simțiți tensiune în ischiochimbilari apoi întoarceți-vă în sus.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Stând cu picioarele la lățimea șoldurilor. Coborâți cu spatele drept și cu pieptul în sus. Împingeți picioarele în pământ și extindeți șoldurile și genunchii simultan, ținând bara aproape de picioare.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Stând cu picioarele la lățimea umerilor, țineți o gantere în fața pieptului. Coboară ținând pieptul sus. Reveniți sus împingându-vă prin călcâie.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Stând cu picioarele la lățimea umerilor. Coborâți corpul îndoind genunchii și șoldurile ca și cum ați fi așezat pe un scaun. Coborâți până când coapsele sunt paralele cu podeaua. Împingeți-vă prin călcâie.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Stând cu picioarele împreună. Faceți un pas lateral larg ținând fix piciorul opus. Coborâți spre acea parte îndoind genunchiul.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Stând cu mreana pe umeri. Înclinați-vă trunchiul înainte ținând spatele drept și genunchii ușor îndoiți. Simțiți întinderea ischiochimbilor. Reveniți în poziția verticală.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Stați cu instrumentul în fața coapselor folosind o prindere pronată. Trageți spre bărbie ținând coatele mai sus decât încheieturile. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Stând cu instrumentul în fața coapselor. Ridică-ți brațele în fața ta la înălțimea umerilor, ținând coatele ușor îndoite. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'În picioare cu instrumentul folosind o prindere pronată (palmele cu fața în jos). Flechează coatele aducând instrumentul spre umeri. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Stând cu instrumentul folosind o prindere în supinație. Flexează-ți coatele aducând instrumentul spre umeri, ținând coatele fixate pe părțile laterale ale trunchiului. Coborâți încet revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Stând cu trunchiul înclinat la 45 de grade. Prinde mreana cu o prindere pronată. Trageți spre abdomen păstrând spatele neutru. Coborâți încet.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Stați cu călcâiele de pe marginea unei platforme. Ridică-te pe degetele de la picioare strângându-ți gambele. Coborâți încet, permițând călcâielor să scadă sub nivelul platformei.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Începeți într-un ritm moderat și creșteți treptat.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Începeți de la retragerea omoplaților. Controlați faza excentrică.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Începeți de la retragerea omoplaților. Nu vă aplecați trunchiul prea mult înapoi.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Începeți mișcarea de la retragerea omoplaților. Evitați utilizarea impulsului.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Începeți mișcarea de la retragerea omoplaților. Controlați faza de prelungire.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Faceți un pas înapoi coborând genunchiul din spate spre podea. Genunchiul din față rămâne aliniat cu glezna.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Faceți un pas înainte coborând genunchiul din spate spre podea. Genunchiul din față rămâne aliniat cu glezna. Împinge înapoi în sus.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Faceți un pas înainte coborând genunchiul din spate. Continuați să faceți un pas înainte, alternând picioarele continuu.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Intră în bara capcană. Picioare la lățimea șoldurilor. Coborâți-vă prinzând mânerele cu spatele drept. Împingeți prin picioare extinzând șoldurile și genunchii simultan.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Fă pași lungi pentru a-ți antrena mai mult fesierii.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'Curl Zottman antrenează atât flexia, cât și extensia antebrațului.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'Bara ar trebui să-ți pășească picioarele pe tot parcursul mișcării. Concentrează-te pe întinderea ischio-coarbei în timpul coborârii.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Cu cât suprafața este mai mare, cu atât mai mult funcționează pieptul superior.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'Banca înclinată accentuează partea superioară a pieptului. Țineți omoplații retractați pe tot parcursul mișcării.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'Versiunea înclinată este mai ușoară și cuplează pieptul inferior.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Cu cât corpul tău este mai orizontal, cu atât este mai greu. Ține-ți mereu nucleul angajat.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'Mișcarea vine din șolduri, nu din spate. Ține-ți spatele drept în timpul fazei de împingere.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'Banca predicatorului elimină utilizarea impulsului. Nu lăsați greutatea să scadă în partea de jos.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'Fanterea inversă este mai sigură pentru genunchi decât atacul înainte.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'Rotația vine din talie, nu din cap.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'Curl piciorului așezat mărește aria de mișcare. Evitați să vă ridicați fesierii de pe scaun.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'Suportul elimină stresul lombar. Concentrați-vă pe retragere.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'Bara de capcană reduce stresul asupra coloanei vertebrale. Păstrați umerii aliniați cu mânerele.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'Greutatea din față ajută la postura verticală. Ține-ți genunchii aliniați.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Utilizați o greutate mică. Țineți antebrațele nemișcate pe coapse.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Cu o mână și un genunchi pe bancă. Trageți gantera spre o parte, ținând cotul aproape de corp. Coborâți încet.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'Cu mreana deasupra capului, coboară într-o ghemuială ținând brațele drepte și stabile. Reveniți sus ținând mreana aliniată.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Cu brațele în față la cablu sau cu gantere, trageți instrumentul spre față ținând coatele sus. Separați-vă mâinile aducând pumnii lângă urechi. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Cu corpul înclinat sub o bară joasă, prindeți cu o prindere pronată. Trage-ți pieptul spre bară, ținându-ți corpul rigid. Coborâți încet.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Cu picioarele pe o suprafață ridicată, coboară pieptul spre podea. Împingeți în sus revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Cu mâinile pe o suprafață ridicată, coboară pieptul spre mâini. Împingeți în sus revenind la poziția de pornire.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Cu mâinile pe marginea unei bănci, faceți un pas înainte cu fesierii afară. Coborâți corpul îndoind coatele la 90 de grade. Împingeți în sus.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Cu trunchiul înclinat și cotul îndoit la 90 de grade, întindeți brațul înapoi până la extensie completă. Întoarce-te încet.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Cu partea superioară a spatelui pe o bancă și cu greutatea pe șolduri. Împingeți șoldurile în sus, strângând fesele. Întoarce-te încet.',
    },
    'hu': {
      'Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.': 'Végezd el a mozgást lassan és kontrolláltan. Tartsd meg a helyes testtartást.',
      'Start with moderate weight to master the technique.': 'Kezdj mérsékelt súllyal a technika elsajátításához.',
      'Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.': 'Lélegezz mélyen. Soha ne erőltesd természetes tartományodon túl.',
      'Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Tartsd a törzsizmokat feszítve az egész gyakorlat alatt. Ellenőrizd az excentrikus fázist.',
      'Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.': 'Tartsd stabil a törzset az egész gyakorlat alatt.',
      'Lower slowly': 'Lassan ereszd le', 'lower slowly': 'lassan ereszd le',
      'Breathe deeply': 'Lélegezz mélyen',
      'Use a full range of motion.': 'Használd a teljes mozgástartományt.',
      'A close grip increases the range of motion. Start from retraction.': 'A szoros markolat növeli a mozgási tartományt. Kezdje a visszahúzással.',
      'A close grip isolates the triceps. Keep your body in a straight line.': 'A szoros markolat elszigeteli a tricepszt. Tartsa a testét egyenes vonalban.',
      'A supinated grip increases bicep engagement. Avoid using momentum.': 'A hátradőlt markolat növeli a bicepsz kapcsolatát. Kerülje a lendület használatát.',
      'Adjust the seat: your knees should not hyperextend.': 'Állítsa be az ülést: a térdének nem szabad túlnyúlnia.',
      'Always land softly. Do not lock your knees.': 'Mindig lágyan szálljon le. Ne zárja be a térdét.',
      'Avoid momentum. Focus on lifting the pelvis.': 'Kerülje a lendületet. Koncentrálj a medence felemelésére.',
      'Avoid raising your elbows above shoulder height. A wider grip reduces the risk of impingement.': 'Kerülje a könyökök vállmagasság fölé emelését. A szélesebb markolat csökkenti az ütközés kockázatát.',
      'Avoid rotating your shoulders. Focus only on the vertical movement.': 'Kerülje a vállak forgatását. Csak a függőleges mozgásra koncentráljon.',
      'Avoid swinging your torso. Control both phases.': 'Kerülje a törzs kilengését. Irányítsd mindkét fázist.',
      'Barbell on the front of the shoulders with high elbows. Descend keeping the torso as vertical as possible. Push back up.': 'Súly a vállak elülső részén, magas könyökökkel. Emelkedjünk le úgy, hogy a törzset a lehető legfüggőlegesebben tartsuk. Nyomja vissza felfelé.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position keeping your torso upright. Hold for 20-30 seconds.': 'Hozd a lábadat nyújtó helyzetbe úgy, hogy a törzsed egyenesen maradjon. Tartsa 20-30 másodpercig.',
      'Bring your leg into a stretch position with your back straight. Hold for 20-30 seconds breathing deeply.': 'Hozd a lábadat nyújtó helyzetbe egyenes háttal. Tartsa 20-30 másodpercig mély lélegzetet.',
      'Bring your leg outward in abduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Húzza kifelé a lábát az emberrablás során, és irányítsa a mozgást. Lassan térjen vissza. Tartsa a magját stabilan.',
      'Bring your leg toward the center in adduction controlling the movement. Return slowly. Keep your core stable.': 'Húzza a lábát a középpont felé az addukcióban, és irányítsa a mozgást. Lassan térjen vissza. Tartsa a magját stabilan.',
      'Contract your abs throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Összehúzza a hasát a gyakorlat során. Az excentrikus fázis szabályozása.',
      'Do not hyperextend your arms during the opening phase. Focus on the chest contraction.': 'Ne nyújtsa túl a karját a nyitási szakaszban. Összpontosítson a mellkas összehúzódására.',
      'Do not let your back arch. Start with partial rollouts.': 'Ne hagyja, hogy a háta ívben íveljen. Kezdje részleges közzététellel.',
      'Do not let your hips sag downward. Retract your shoulder blades.': 'Ne hagyja, hogy a csípője leereszkedjen. Húzza vissza a lapockáit.',
      'Do not lift your hips. Hold the contraction at the top for a second.': 'Ne emelje fel a csípőjét. Tartsa az összehúzódást a tetején egy másodpercig.',
      'Do not lock your knees in extension. Feet higher on the platform engage the glutes more.': 'Ne zárja ki a térdét. A platformon magasabban lévő lábak jobban érintik a farizmokat.',
      'Do not pull your neck. Focus on the abdominal contraction.': 'Ne húzza a nyakát. Fókuszáljon a hasi összehúzódásra.',
      'Do not raise your arms above shoulder height. Rotate your wrists slightly downward (as if pouring water) to isolate the lateral deltoid.': 'Ne emelje a karját vállmagasság fölé. Forgassa kissé lefelé a csuklóját (mintha vizet öntött volna), hogy elszigetelje az oldalsó deltoidot.',
      'Do not raise your hips. Keep your shoulders over your wrists.': 'Ne emelje fel a csípőjét. Tartsa a vállát a csuklóján.',
      'Do not round your back at any point. Engage your core before pulling.': 'Soha ne kerekítse a hátát. Húzás előtt kapcsolja be a magot.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Ne kerekítse a hátát. Az excentrikus fázis szabályozása.',
      'Do not round your back. Control the stretch phase.': 'Ne kerekítse a hátát. Irányítsd a nyújtási fázist.',
      'Do not round your back. Start with a light weight.': 'Ne kerekítse a hátát. Kezdje egy könnyű súllyal.',
      'Do not use body swing. Focus on isolating the gluteus medius.': 'Ne használjon testlengést. Fókuszáljon a gluteus medius izolálására.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the adductors.': 'Ne használjon lendületet. Koncentráljon az adduktorok izolálására.',
      'Do not use momentum. Focus on the contraction.': 'Ne használjon lendületet. Összpontosítson az összehúzódásra.',
      'Dumbbells allow a greater range of motion. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'A súlyzók nagyobb mozgástartományt tesznek lehetővé. Tartsa a lapockáit behúzva a mozgás során.',
      'Feet wider than shoulder width with toes pointing outward. Lower down gripping the barbell with an inner grip. Push with your legs and extend your hips simultaneously keeping your back straight.': 'A láb szélesebb, mint a váll szélessége, a lábujjak kifelé mutatnak. Engedje le a súlyzót belső markolattal megfogva. Nyomja meg a lábával és nyújtsa ki a csípőjét, miközben a hátát egyenesen tartja.',
      'Flex your elbows bringing the weight toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, hogy a súlyt a vállai felé vigye. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Fully extend your arms in the concentric phase. Return slowly to the starting position controlling the movement.': 'Teljesen nyújtsd ki a karjaidat a koncentrikus fázisban. Lassan térjen vissza a kiinduló helyzetbe a mozgás irányításával.',
      'Grip the bar with a pronated grip at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly back to the starting position.': 'Fogja meg a rudat pronált markolattal a váll szélességében. Kinyújtott karokkal kezdve húzza felfelé a testét, amíg az álla meg nem engedi a rudat. Lassan ereszkedj vissza a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Grip the bar with a supinated grip (palms facing you) at shoulder width. Starting with arms extended, pull your body up until your chin clears the bar. Lower slowly.': 'Fogja meg a rudat szupinált markolattal (tenyérrel maga felé) a váll szélességében. Kinyújtott karokkal kezdve húzza felfelé a testét, amíg az álla meg nem engedi a rudat. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Grip the parallel bars with arms extended. Lower your body by leaning slightly forward and bending your elbows. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Fogja meg a párhuzamos rudakat nyújtott karokkal. Enyhén előre dőlve és a könyökét hajlítva engedje le testét. Nyomja felfelé, visszatérve a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Hanging from the bar or lying down, raise your legs upward controlling the movement. Lower slowly.': 'A rúdról lógva vagy fekve emelje fel a lábát a mozgás irányításával. Lassan engedje le.',
      'High elbows prevent the barbell from sliding. It requires significant wrist and ankle mobility.': 'A magas könyökök megakadályozzák a súlyzó elcsúszását. Jelentős csukló- és bokamozgást igényel.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Avoid momentum.': 'Tartsa az összehúzódást a tetején egy másodpercig. Kerülje a lendületet.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Keep your chin toward your chest.': 'Tartsa az összehúzódást a tetején egy másodpercig. Tartsa az állát a mellkasa felé.',
      'Hold the contraction at the top. Avoid compensating with your back.': 'Tartsa az összehúzódást a tetején. Kerülje a háttal való kompenzálást.',
      'Hold the ends of the rope at your sides. Rotate the rope overhead and jump as it passes under your feet.': 'Fogja meg a kötél végeit az oldalain. Forgassa el a kötelet a feje fölött, és ugorjon, ahogy elhalad a lába alatt.',
      'In a prone position resting on your forearms and toes. Your body forms a straight line from head to heels. Hold by contracting your core.': 'Hanyatt fekvő helyzetben az alkaron és a lábujjakon támaszkodva. A tested egyenes vonalat alkot a fejtől a sarkáig. Tartsa össze a mag összehúzásával.',
      'In a prone position with hands at shoulder width. Lower your chest toward the floor by bending your elbows. Push upward returning to the starting position keeping your body in a straight line.': 'Hanyatt fekvésben, kezekkel vállszélességben. Engedje le a mellkasát a padló felé a könyökök hajlításával. Nyomja felfelé, visszatérve a kiindulási helyzetbe, miközben a testét egyenes vonalban tartja.',
      'In a push-up position. Alternately bring your knees toward your chest quickly while keeping your hips low.': 'Push-up helyzetben. Felváltva húzza gyorsan a térdét a mellkasa felé, miközben a csípőjét alacsonyan tartja.',
      'In a split stance position. Lower your body by bending your front knee. Push upward returning to the starting position.': 'Osztott állásban. Engedje le testét az elülső térd hajlításával. Nyomja felfelé, visszatérve a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Keep the opposite foot completely on the floor. Torso upright.': 'Tartsa az ellenkező lábfejet teljesen a padlón. A törzs függőlegesen.',
      'Keep the upper arm parallel to the floor. Avoid momentum.': 'Tartsa a felkarját párhuzamosan a padlóval. Kerülje a lendületet.',
      'Keep your arms straight. Focus on the lat contraction.': 'Tartsa egyenesen a karját. Koncentrálj a lat kontrakcióra.',
      'Keep your back flat and your core engaged. Avoid swinging your torso.': 'Tartsa laposan a hátát, és rögzítse a magját. Kerülje a törzs kilengését.',
      'Keep your back in a neutral position. Pull toward your waist or chest. Contract your back muscles at the end of the movement.': 'Tartsa a hátát semleges helyzetben. Húzza a dereka vagy a mellkasa felé. A mozgás végén húzza össze a hátizmokat.',
      'Keep your back parallel to the floor. Rotate your torso slightly at the end of the movement.': 'Tartsa a hátát párhuzamosan a padlóval. A mozgás végén forgassa el kissé a törzsét.',
      'Keep your chest up and your knees aligned with your toes. Do not let your knees collapse inward.': 'Tartsa a mellkasát felfelé, a térdét pedig a lábujjakkal egy vonalban. Ne hagyja, hogy a térd befelé omoljon.',
      'Keep your core engaged and your back straight. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Tartsa a magját rögzítve, a hátát pedig egyenesen. Kerülje az ágyéki gerinc túlnyúlását.',
      'Keep your core engaged to protect your back. Avoid hyperextending your lumbar spine.': 'Tartsa rögzítve a magját, hogy megvédje a hátát. Kerülje az ágyéki gerinc túlnyúlását.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Adapt the speed to your fitness level.': 'Tartsa lekötve a magját. A sebességet edzettségi szintjéhez igazítsa.',
      'Keep your core engaged. Avoid hyperextending your spine.': 'Tartsa lekötve a magját. Kerülje a gerinc túlnyúlását.',
      'Keep your elbows at shoulder height or slightly above. Essential for rotator cuff health.': 'Tartsa a könyökét vállmagasságban vagy kissé magasabban. Elengedhetetlen a rotátor mandzsetta egészségéhez.',
      'Keep your elbows close to your body. Avoid flaring your elbows.': 'Tartsa a könyökét közel a testéhez. Kerülje a könyökök kiszélesedését.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed at your sides. The neutral grip emphasizes the brachioradialis over the bicep.': 'Könyökét tartsa rögzítve az oldalain. A semleges markolat kiemeli a brachioradialis a bicepsz felett.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed pointing toward the ceiling. Control the descent.': 'A könyökét tartsa rögzítve a mennyezet felé. Irányítsd a süllyedést.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed throughout the movement. Focus on the full contraction at the top.': 'Könyökét tartsa rögzítve a mozgás során. Összpontosítson a teljes összehúzódásra a tetején.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Do not use momentum.': 'Tartsa rögzítve a könyökét. Ne használjon lendületet.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full contraction.': 'Tartsa rögzítve a könyökét. Összpontosítson a teljes összehúzódásra.',
      'Keep your elbows fixed. Focus on the full extension.': 'Tartsa rögzítve a könyökét. Összpontosítson a teljes kiterjesztésre.',
      'Keep your elbows pointing toward the ceiling and close to your head. The long head is maximally activated in the stretched position.': 'Tartsa a könyökét a mennyezet felé, és közel a fejéhez. A hosszú fej maximálisan aktiválódik nyújtott helyzetben.',
      'Keep your front knee aligned with your toes. It corrects muscle imbalances between legs.': 'Tartsa az elülső térdét egy vonalban a lábujjaival. Kijavítja a lábak közötti izmok egyensúlyhiányát.',
      'Keep your heel on the floor. Bend your knee to stretch the soleus.': 'Tartsa a sarkát a padlón. Hajlítsa be a térdét a talp nyújtásához.',
      'Keep your hips aligned. Avoid letting them sag downward.': 'Tartsa a csípőjét egy vonalban. Kerülje el, hogy leereszkedjenek.',
      'Keep your jumps low. Use your wrists, not your arms, to rotate the rope.': 'Tartsa alacsonyan az ugrásait. A kötél forgatásához használja a csuklóját, ne a karját.',
      'Keep your knee pointing toward the floor. Avoid hyperextending your back.': 'Tartsa a térdét a padló felé. Kerülje a hát túlzott megnyújtását.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The foot position changes the most engaged muscle.': 'Tartsa a térdét a lábujjakkal egy vonalban. A láb helyzete megváltoztatja a leginkább érintett izmot.',
      'Keep your knees aligned with your toes. The sumo stance reduces the barbell path.': 'Tartsa a térdét a lábujjakkal egy vonalban. A szumóállás csökkenti a súlyzó útját.',
      'Keep your pelvis level. Start with a light weight.': 'Tartsa vízszintesen a medencéjét. Kezdje egy könnyű súllyal.',
      'Keep your shoulder blades retracted. Control the descent for at least 2 seconds.': 'Tartsa a lapockáit behúzva. Irányítsa az ereszkedést legalább 2 másodpercig.',
      'Keep your shoulders relaxed. Adapt the pace to the desired intensity.': 'Tartsa nyugodtan a vállát. Igazítsa a tempót a kívánt intenzitáshoz.',
      'Keep your torso stable avoiding swinging. Control the descent.': 'Tartsa a törzsét stabilan, elkerülve a kilengést. Irányítsd a süllyedést.',
      'Keep your torso upright and core engaged. Avoid letting your front knee go past your toes.': 'Tartsa a törzsét függőlegesen, és a törzset rögzítse. Kerülje el, hogy az elülső térd túllépjen a lábujjain.',
      'Keep your torso vertical to isolate the triceps. The lower you go, the greater the chest engagement.': 'Tartsa függőlegesen a törzsét a tricepsz izolálásához. Minél lejjebb mész, annál nagyobb a mellkasi kötődés.',
      'Keep your wrists in a neutral position. The reverse curl strengthens the forearm muscles.': 'Tartsa a csuklóit semleges helyzetben. A fordított göndörítés erősíti az alkar izmait.',
      'Kneeling with the wheel in front. Roll the wheel forward lowering your body toward the floor. Pull the wheel back toward your knees.': 'Térdelés a kerékkel elöl. Forgassa előre a kereket, és engedje le testét a padló felé. Húzza vissza a kereket a térdéhez.',
      'Leaning forward increases chest engagement. The vertical position isolates the triceps.': 'Az előrehajlás növeli a mellkasi terhelést. A függőleges helyzet elszigeteli a tricepszt.',
      'Lie down with your knees bent. Bring your shoulders toward your knees contracting your abs. Lower slowly.': 'Feküdj le hajlított térddel. Húzza a vállát a térd felé, összehúzva a hasát. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Lie down with your legs raised. Bring your knees toward your chest lifting your pelvis. Return slowly.': 'Feküdj fel emelt lábakkal. Húzza a térdét a mellkasa felé, és emelje fel a medencéjét. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'Lie face down on the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Feküdjön arccal lefelé a gépen, párnákkal a bokán. Hajlítsa meg a térdét, hogy a sarkát a fenék felé fordítsa. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower the dumbbells toward your chest keeping your wrists stable. Push upward firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Feküdj a padon, mindkét kezében egy-egy súlyzóval. Engedje le a súlyzókat a mellkasa felé, és tartsa stabilan a csuklóját. Erősen nyomja felfelé, és térjen vissza a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Lie on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand. Lower your arms laterally maintaining a slight elbow bend. Bring the dumbbells upward in an arc as if hugging a tree. Return slowly.': 'Feküdj a padon, mindkét kezében egy-egy súlyzóval. Enyhe könyökhajlítással engedje le a karját oldalirányban. Húzza felfelé a súlyzókat ívben, mintha egy fát ölelne át. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'Lie on the bench with a shoulder-width grip. Lower the barbell keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Feküdj a padon vállszélességű markolattal. Engedje le a súlyzót úgy, hogy könyöke közel legyen a törzséhez. Nyomd felfelé a tricepszedet.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight toward your forehead. Extend returning to the position.': 'Feküdj a padon úgy, hogy a munkaeszköz a mellkasa felett legyen, kinyújtott karokkal. Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, és csökkentse a súlyt a homloka felé. Hosszabbítsa meg a pozícióba való visszatérést.',
      'Lie on the bench with the implement above your chest, arms nearly extended. Lower the weight behind your head keeping your elbows slightly bent. Return to the starting position in an arc.': 'Feküdj a padon úgy, hogy a munkaeszköz a mellkasa felett legyen, a karokat majdnem kinyújtva. Engedje le a súlyt a feje mögé, miközben könyökét kissé behajlította. Egy ívben térjünk vissza a kiinduló helyzetbe.',
      'Lie on the bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the barbell wider than shoulder width. Lower the barbell to your chest keeping your elbows at about 45 degrees. Push upward firmly.': 'Feküdj a padon úgy, hogy a lábad a padlón legyen. Fogja meg a súlyzót a vállszélességnél szélesebben. Engedje le a súlyzót a mellkasához, könyökét körülbelül 45 fokos szögben tartva. Erősen nyomja felfelé.',
      'Lie on the decline bench with your feet secured. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the lower chest. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Feküdj a zuhanópadon rögzített lábbal. Fogja meg a munkagépet a vállszélességnél szélesebben. Lejjebb a mellkas alsó részéig. Erősen nyomja vissza a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Lie on the inclined support with the weights hanging. Pull toward your torso contracting your lats. Lower slowly.': 'Feküdj a ferde támasztékra úgy, hogy a súlyok lógnak. Húzza a törzse felé, összehúzza a latt. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Lower into a squat then jump upward explosively. Land softly by bending your knees.': 'Engedj le guggolásba, majd robbanásszerűen ugorj felfelé. Térd hajlításával lágyan landolj.',
      'Lower into a squat, place your hands on the floor and jump your feet into a push-up position. Perform a push-up, jump your feet toward your hands, then jump up with your arms overhead.': 'Engedjen le guggolásba, tegye a kezét a padlóra, és ugorja a lábát fekvőtámasz helyzetbe. Végezzen fekvőtámaszt, ugorja a lábát a kezeihez, majd ugorjon fel karokkal a feje fölött.',
      'Maintain a steady pace. Correct posture throughout the exercise.': 'Tartson állandó tempót. Helyes testtartás a gyakorlat során.',
      'Maintain an upright posture with a slight forward lean. Alternate steps at a steady pace. Land with your foot at mid-step.': 'Tartson egyenes testtartást, enyhén előre dőlve. Váltott lépések egyenletes ütemben. Lépés közepén szálljon le a lábával.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend throughout the movement. Focus on the chest contraction at the end of the movement.': 'Tartsa ugyanazt a könyökhajlítást a mozgás során. Összpontosítson a mellkas összehúzódására a mozgás végén.',
      'Maintain the same elbow bend. Control the descent for 2 seconds.': 'Tartsa ugyanazt a könyökhajlítást. Irányítsd az ereszkedést 2 másodpercig.',
      'Maintain the slight elbow bend. The pullover is one of the few exercises that stretches the lat.': 'Tartsa meg az enyhe könyökhajlítást. A pulóver azon kevés gyakorlatok egyike, amelyek nyújtják a latot.',
      'Moderate tension, never pain. Exhale as you stretch.': 'Mérsékelt feszültség, soha nem fáj. Nyújtás közben lélegezzen ki.',
      'On hands and knees or standing at the cable. Extend your leg backward squeezing the glute. Return slowly.': 'Kézen és térden, vagy a kábelnél állva. Nyújtsa ki a lábát hátrafelé a farizmot szorítva. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'On your side resting on your forearm with your body in a straight line. Lift your hips maintaining the position.': 'Az oldaladon az alkarodra támaszkodva, a tested egyenes vonalban. Emelje fel a csípőjét a pozíció megtartásával.',
      'Pedal maintaining a steady pace. Keep your back in a neutral position.': 'A pedál egyenletes tempót tart fenn. Tartsa a hátát semleges helyzetben.',
      'Perform the lifting phase with a supinated grip. Rotate your wrists to pronation at the top. Lower with a pronated grip. Return to supinated at the bottom.': 'Hajtsa végre az emelési fázist szupinált markolattal. Forgassa a csuklóit pronációig a tetején. Lejjebb pronált markolattal. Térjen vissza a supinált aljára.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your core engaged.': 'Végezze el a mozgást mind az excentrikus, mind a koncentrikus fázis vezérlésével. Tartsa lekötve a magját.',
      'Perform the movement controlling both eccentric and concentric phases. Keep your shoulder blades retracted.': 'Végezze el a mozgást mind az excentrikus, mind a koncentrikus fázis vezérlésével. Tartsa a lapockáit behúzva.',
      'Perform the movement explosively upward or forward. Land softly by bending your knees. Control the landing.': 'Hajtsa végre a mozgást robbanásszerűen felfelé vagy előre. Térd hajlításával lágyan landolj. Irányítsd a leszállást.',
      'Perform the movement slowly in both phases. The pause at the bottom increases the calf stretch.': 'Lassan hajtsa végre a mozgást mindkét fázisban. Az alján lévő szünet növeli a vádli nyújtását.',
      'Perform the rotation fluidly and continuously. The Arnold press is one of the few exercises that engages all the muscle fibers.': 'Folyékonyan és folyamatosan végezze a forgatást. Az Arnold press egyike azon kevés gyakorlatoknak, amelyek az összes izomrostot lekötik.',
      'Position your hands in a diamond shape under your chest. Lower your body keeping your elbows close to your torso. Push upward squeezing your triceps.': 'Helyezze a kezét gyémánt alakban a mellkasa alá. Engedje le a testét úgy, hogy a könyöke közel legyen a törzséhez. Nyomd felfelé a tricepszedet.',
      'Position yourself in the hack squat machine with shoulders under the pads. Descend by bending your knees to 90 degrees then push upward.': 'Helyezze magát a hack guggoló gépbe úgy, hogy vállai a párnák alatt legyenek. Térd 90 fokos behajlításával ereszkedj le, majd nyomd felfelé.',
      'Push mainly with the foot on the elevated surface. Keep your torso upright.': 'Főleg lábbal nyomja a megemelt felületen. Tartsa függőlegesen a törzsét.',
      'Push with your legs, then lean your torso back, finally pull the oar toward your abdomen. Reverse the order on the return.': 'Lábaival nyomd, majd döntsd hátra a törzsed, végül húzd a hasad felé az evezőt. Fordítsa meg a sorrendet a visszaküldéskor.',
      'Requires excellent shoulder, hip and ankle mobility. Start without weight.': 'Kiváló váll-, csípő- és bokamozgást igényel. Kezdje súly nélkül.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades and keep them locked. Do not bounce the weight off your chest.': 'Húzza vissza a lapockáit, és tartsa zárva. Ne verje le a súlyt a mellkasáról.',
      'Retract your shoulder blades to stabilize the shoulder.': 'Húzza vissza a lapockáit, hogy stabilizálja a vállát.',
      'Rotate from the waist, not just from the arms.': 'Forgasd a deréktól, ne csak a karoktól.',
      'Rotate your torso bringing one elbow toward the opposite knee. Repeat from the other side.': 'Forgassa el a törzsét úgy, hogy az egyik könyökét az ellenkező térd felé tolja. Ismételje meg a másik oldalról.',
      'Rotate your wrist outward at the top to maximize the peak. Keep your torso stable.': 'Forgassa kifelé a csuklóját a tetején, hogy maximalizálja a csúcsot. Tartsa stabilan törzsét.',
      'Seated with dumbbells at shoulder height and palms facing you. Press upward rotating your wrists outward until your palms face forward. Lower returning to the initial position.': 'Súlyzókkal ülve vállmagasságban, tenyérrel Ön felé. Nyomja felfelé a csuklóját kifelé forgatva, amíg a tenyere előre néz. Engedje vissza a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Seated with your elbow resting on your inner thigh. Flex your elbow bringing the dumbbell toward your shoulder. Lower slowly.': 'Üljön úgy, hogy a könyöke a belső combján nyugszik. Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, és húzza a súlyzót a vállához. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Seated with your feet raised and torso at 45 degrees. Rotate your torso from side to side bringing your hands to the floor beside your hips.': 'Üljön felemelt lábbal, a törzs pedig 45 fokban legyen. Forgassa el a törzsét egyik oldalról a másikra úgy, hogy a kezét a csípője mellett a padlóra helyezze.',
      'Sequence: legs then torso then arms during the pull.': 'Sorrend: húzás közben lábak, majd törzs, majd karok.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine and grip the bar with a wide pronated grip. Pull the bar toward your chest leaning your torso slightly back. Control the return to the starting position.': 'Üljön a lat lehúzó géphez, és széles pronás markolattal fogja meg a rudat. Húzza a rudat a mellkasa felé, enyhén hátradöntve a törzsét. Irányítsd a kiinduló helyzetbe való visszatérést.',
      'Sit at the lat pulldown machine with a close or neutral grip. Pull the bar toward your chest keeping your elbows close to your body. Control the return.': 'Üljön a lat lehúzó géphez szoros vagy semleges markolattal. Húzza a rudat a mellkasa felé úgy, hogy könyökét a testéhez közel tartva. Irányítsd a visszatérést.',
      'Sit at the low cable with your feet on the supports. Pull the handle toward your waist keeping your back straight. Contract your back muscles and return slowly.': 'Üljön az alacsony kábelnél úgy, hogy a lába a támasztékokon legyen. Húzza a fogantyút a dereka felé, és tartsa egyenesen a hátát. Húzza össze a hátizmokat, és lassan térjen vissza.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Extend your legs upward contracting your quadriceps. Lower slowly.': 'Üljön a géphez párnákkal a bokán. Nyújtsa ki a lábát felfelé, összehúzva a négyfejű izmát. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Sit at the machine with pads on your ankles. Flex your knees bringing your heels toward your glutes. Lower slowly.': 'Üljön a géphez párnákkal a bokán. Hajlítsa meg a térdét, hogy a sarkát a fenék felé fordítsa. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Sit at the preacher bench with your arms resting on the pad. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly almost to full extension.': 'Ülj le a prédikátorpadra, és tedd a karjaidat a párnán. Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, hogy a munkaeszközt a vállai felé tolja. Lassan engedje le majdnem teljes kinyúlásig.',
      'Sit in the machine with your back resting against the pad. Position your elbows on the pads. Bring your arms toward the center contracting your chest. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Üljön be a gépbe úgy, hogy a hátát a párnának támasztja. Helyezze a könyökét a párnákra. Hozd a karjaidat a középpont felé, összehúzva a mellkasodat. Lassan térjen vissza a kiinduló helyzetbe.',
      'Sit in the machine with your feet on the platform at hip width. Lower by bending your knees to 90 degrees. Push by extending your legs.': 'Üljön be a gépbe úgy, hogy a lába a platformon csípő szélességben legyen. Engedje le térdének 90 fokos hajlításával. Lábaid kinyújtásával nyomd.',
      'Sit on the incline bench with your feet on the floor. Grip the implement wider than shoulder width. Lower to the upper chest level. Push firmly returning to the starting position.': 'Üljön le a lejtős padra úgy, hogy a lába a padlón legyen. Fogja meg a munkagépet a vállszélességnél szélesebben. Lejjebb a mellkas felső szintjére. Erősen nyomja vissza a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Sit with your forearms on your thighs. Grip the implement with a supinated grip. Flex your wrists upward and lower slowly.': 'Üljön az alkarjával a combján. Fogja meg a munkaeszközt szupinált markolattal. Hajlítsa fel a csuklóját, és lassan engedje le.',
      'Spread the rope apart at the bottom to maximize the contraction. Keep your elbows fixed.': 'Feszítse szét a kötelet alul, hogy maximalizálja az összehúzódást. Tartsa rögzítve a könyökét.',
      'Standing at the center of the cable with one handle per hand. Keep your arms slightly bent. Bring your hands toward the center crossing them. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Álljon a kábel közepén, kézenként egy fogantyúval. Tartsa a karját kissé behajlítva. Vidd a kezeid a középpont felé, keresztezve őket. Lassan térjen vissza a kiinduló helyzetbe.',
      'Standing at the high cable with the rope. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push the rope downward separating the ends. Return slowly.': 'A magas kábelnél állva a kötéllel. A könyökét tartsa rögzítve a törzs oldalán. Nyomja le a kötelet a végeit elválasztva. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'Standing at the high cable. Keep your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Push downward fully extending your arms. Return slowly.': 'A magas kábelnél állva. A könyökét tartsa rögzítve a törzs oldalán. Nyomja lefelé teljesen kinyújtva a karját. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'Standing facing the high cable with your arms almost extended. Bring the bar toward your thighs in an arc keeping your arms straight. Return slowly to the starting position.': 'Szinte kinyújtott karokkal állva a magas kábellel szemben. Húzza a rudat a combja felé ívben, és tartsa egyenesen a karját. Lassan térjen vissza a kiinduló helyzetbe.',
      'Standing in front of a bench. Place one foot on the elevated surface and push upward. Lower slowly controlling the movement.': 'Egy pad előtt állva. Helyezze az egyik lábát a megemelt felületre, és nyomja felfelé. Lassan engedje le a mozgást irányítva.',
      'Standing on one leg. Lower your torso forward keeping your back straight while your free leg extends behind. Return to the upright position squeezing your glutes.': 'Egy lábon állva. Engedje le a törzsét előre úgy, hogy a háta egyenes maradjon, miközben a szabad láb hátranyúlik. Térjen vissza függőleges helyzetbe, és szorítsa össze a fenékjét.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly returning to the starting position with the weight at shoulder height.': 'Állva vagy ülve a munkaeszközzel vállmagasságban. Nyomja felfelé teljesen kinyújtva a karját. Lassan ereszkedjen le, és térjen vissza a kiindulási helyzetbe, a súly vállmagasságban legyen.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement at shoulder height. Push upward fully extending your arms. Lower slowly.': 'Állva vagy ülve a munkaeszközzel vállmagasságban. Nyomja felfelé teljesen kinyújtva a karját. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing or seated with the implement overhead, arms extended. Flex your elbows lowering the weight behind your head. Extend returning up.': 'Állva vagy ülve a munkaeszköz feje fölött, kinyújtott karokkal. Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, csökkentve a súlyt a feje mögött. Hosszabbítsa meg a visszatérést.',
      'Standing with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Raise your arms laterally to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Állj egy-egy súlyzóval mindkét kezedben az oldaladon. Emelje fel karjait oldalirányban vállmagasságig, könyökét enyhén behajlítva. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with a weight in each hand at your sides. Raise your shoulders toward your ears squeezing your traps. Hold the contraction for a second then lower slowly.': 'Állj súllyal mindkét kezedben az oldaladon. Emelje fel a vállát a füle felé, és szorítsa össze a csapdáit. Tartsa az összehúzódást egy másodpercig, majd lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with dumbbells at your sides with a neutral grip (thumbs up). Flex your elbows bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Súlyzókkal az oldaladon állva, semleges markolattal (hüvelykujj felfelé). Hajlítsa meg a könyökét úgy, hogy a súlyzókat a vállad felé vigye. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Hinge at the hips swinging the weight between your legs, then explosively drive your hips forward swinging the weight up to shoulder height.': 'Álló lábbal csípő szélességben. A csípőnél csukd össze a súlyt a lábaid között, majd robbanásszerűen hajtsd előre a csípődet, lendítsd a súlyt vállmagasságig.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower the barbell along your legs keeping your knees slightly bent and back straight. Descend until you feel tension in the hamstrings then return up.': 'Álló lábbal csípő szélességben. Engedje le a súlyzót a lábai mentén úgy, hogy a térdét enyhén behajlítva és a hátát egyenesen tartva. Emelkedj le, amíg feszültséget nem érzel a combhajlító izomzatban, majd térj vissza.',
      'Standing with feet at hip width. Lower with your back straight and chest up. Push your feet into the ground and extend hips and knees simultaneously keeping the bar close to your legs.': 'Álló lábbal csípő szélességben. Engedje le egyenes háttal és felfelé mellkassal. Nyomja a lábát a talajba, és egyszerre nyújtsa ki a csípőt és a térdét úgy, hogy a rudat közel tartsa a lábához.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width, hold a dumbbell in front of your chest. Descend keeping your chest up. Return up by pushing through your heels.': 'Állva váll szélességben lábbal, tartson egy súlyzót a mellkasa előtt. A mellkasát felfelé tartva ereszkedjen le. Térj vissza a sarkadon keresztül.',
      'Standing with feet at shoulder width. Lower your body by bending your knees and hips as if sitting on a chair. Descend until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels.': 'Álló lábbal vállszélességben. Engedje le testét térdének és csípőjének hajlításával, mintha egy széken ülne. Emelkedj le, amíg a combod párhuzamos nem lesz a padlóval. Push through your heels.',
      'Standing with feet together. Take a wide lateral step keeping the opposite foot fixed. Lower toward that side by bending your knee.': 'Együtt lábbal állva. Tegyen egy széles oldalsó lépést az ellenkező lábfej rögzítésével. Engedje le az oldal felé a térd hajlításával.',
      'Standing with the barbell on your shoulders. Lean your torso forward keeping your back straight and knees slightly bent. Feel the stretch in your hamstrings. Return to the upright position.': 'Álljon a súlyzóval a vállán. Döntse előre a törzsét, tartsa egyenesen a hátát és enyhén hajlítva a térdét. Érezd a feszítést a combhajlítóidban. Térjen vissza függőleges helyzetbe.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs using a pronated grip. Pull toward your chin keeping your elbows higher than your wrists. Lower slowly.': 'Álljon a munkaeszközzel a combja előtt, pronált markolat segítségével. Húzza az álla felé úgy, hogy a könyökét magasabban tartsa, mint a csuklóját. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with the implement in front of your thighs. Raise your arms in front of you to shoulder height keeping your elbows slightly bent. Lower slowly.': 'Álljon a munkaeszközzel a combja előtt. Emelje fel a karját maga elé vállmagasságig, könyökét enyhén behajlítva. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with the implement using a pronated grip (palms facing down). Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders. Lower slowly.': 'Álljon a munkaeszközzel egy kinyújtott markolat segítségével (tenyér lefelé néz). Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, hogy a munkaeszközt a vállai felé tolja. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with the implement using a supinated grip. Flex your elbows bringing the implement toward your shoulders keeping your elbows fixed at the sides of your torso. Lower slowly returning to the starting position.': 'Állás a munkaeszközzel, hátradőlt markolat segítségével. Hajlítsa meg a könyökét, hogy a munkaeszközt a vállai felé mozdítsa, miközben könyökét a törzs oldalain rögzítse. Lassan ereszkedjen le, visszatérve a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'Standing with torso inclined at 45 degrees. Grip the barbell with a pronated grip. Pull toward your abdomen keeping your back neutral. Lower slowly.': 'Állva 45 fokos ferde törzstel. Fogja meg a súlyzót pronált markolattal. Húzza a hasa felé úgy, hogy a háta semleges legyen. Lassan engedje le.',
      'Standing with your heels off the edge of a platform. Rise onto your toes squeezing your calves. Lower slowly allowing your heels to drop below the platform level.': 'Álljon úgy, hogy a sarka levált az emelvény széléről. Emelkedj fel a lábujjaidra, és szorítsd össze a vádlit. Lassan engedje le, hogy a sarka a platform szintje alá süllyedjen.',
      'Start at a moderate pace and gradually increase.': 'Kezdje mérsékelt ütemben, és fokozatosan növelje.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the eccentric phase.': 'Kezdje a lapockák visszahúzásával. Az excentrikus fázis szabályozása.',
      'Start from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Do not lean your torso too far back.': 'Kezdje a lapockák visszahúzásával. Ne döntse túlságosan hátra a törzsét.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Avoid using momentum.': 'Kezdje a mozgást a lapockák visszahúzódásától. Kerülje a lendület használatát.',
      'Start the movement from the retraction of the shoulder blades. Control the lengthening phase.': 'Kezdje a mozgást a lapockák visszahúzódásától. Irányítsd a hosszabbítási fázist.',
      'Step backward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle.': 'Lépjen hátra, és engedje le a hátsó térdét a padló felé. Az elülső térd egy vonalban marad a bokával.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee toward the floor. The front knee stays aligned with the ankle. Push back up.': 'Lépjen előre, és engedje le a hátsó térdét a padló felé. Az elülső térd egy vonalban marad a bokával. Nyomja vissza felfelé.',
      'Step forward lowering your rear knee. Continue stepping forward alternating legs continuously.': 'Lépjen előre, leengedve a hátsó térdét. Folyamatosan lépkedjen előre váltakozó lábakkal.',
      'Step inside the trap bar. Feet at hip width. Lower yourself gripping the handles with a straight back. Push through your feet extending hips and knees simultaneously.': 'Lépjen be a csapórúdba. Lábak csípő szélességben. Egyenes háttal ereszkedjen le a fogantyúknál fogva. Nyomd át a lábaidat úgy, hogy egyszerre nyújtsd ki a csípőt és a térdedet.',
      'Take long steps to engage your glutes more.': 'Tegyen hosszú lépéseket, hogy jobban lekösse a farizmokat.',
      'The Zottman curl trains both flexion and extension of the forearm.': 'A Zottman curl edzi az alkar hajlítását és nyújtását.',
      'The bar should graze your legs throughout the movement. Focus on the hamstring stretch during the descent.': 'A rúdnak a mozgás során végig kell legelnie a lábát. Az ereszkedés során összpontosítson a combhajlító nyújtásra.',
      'The higher the surface, the more the upper chest works.': 'Minél magasabb a felület, annál jobban működik a mellkas felső része.',
      'The incline bench emphasizes the upper chest. Keep your shoulder blades retracted throughout the movement.': 'A lejtős pad kiemeli a mellkas felső részét. Tartsa a lapockáit behúzva a mozgás során.',
      'The inclined version is easier and engages the lower chest.': 'A ferde változat könnyebb, és a mellkas alsó részét érinti.',
      'The more horizontal your body, the harder it is. Always keep your core engaged.': 'Minél vízszintesebb a tested, annál keményebb. Mindig tartsa lekötve a magját.',
      'The movement comes from the hips, not the back. Keep your back straight during the push phase.': 'A mozgás a csípőből jön, nem a hátból. Tartsa egyenesen a hátát a tolófázisban.',
      'The preacher bench eliminates the use of momentum. Do not let the weight drop at the bottom.': 'A prédikátor pad kiküszöböli a lendület használatát. Ne hagyja, hogy a súly leessen az alján.',
      'The reverse lunge is safer for the knees than the forward lunge.': 'A fordított kitörés biztonságosabb a térd számára, mint az előrefelé történő kitörés.',
      'The rotation comes from the waist, not the head.': 'A forgás a derékból jön, nem a fejből.',
      'The seated leg curl increases the range of motion. Avoid lifting your glutes off the seat.': 'Az ülő lábhajlítás növeli a mozgási tartományt. Kerülje a farizmok felemelését az ülésről.',
      'The support eliminates lumbar stress. Focus on retraction.': 'A támogatás megszünteti az ágyéki stresszt. Koncentrálj a visszahúzásra.',
      'The trap bar reduces stress on the spine. Keep your shoulders in line with the handles.': 'A csapórúd csökkenti a gerinc terhelését. Tartsa a vállát egy vonalban a fogantyúkkal.',
      'The weight in front helps with vertical posture. Keep your knees aligned.': 'Az elülső súly segíti a függőleges testtartást. Tartsa a térdét egy vonalban.',
      'Use a light weight. Keep your forearms still on your thighs.': 'Használjon könnyű súlyt. Tartsa az alkarját továbbra is a combján.',
      'With one hand and one knee on the bench. Pull the dumbbell toward your side keeping your elbow close to your body. Lower slowly.': 'Egy kézzel és egy térddel a padon. Húzza a súlyzót az oldala felé úgy, hogy a könyökét közel tartsa a testéhez. Lassan engedje le.',
      'With the barbell overhead, descend into a squat keeping your arms straight and stable. Return up keeping the barbell aligned.': 'A súlyzóval a feje fölött ereszkedjen le egy guggolásba, és tartsa egyenesen és stabilan a karját. Térjen vissza úgy, hogy a súlyzót egyenesen tartsa.',
      'With your arms in front at the cable or with dumbbells, pull the implement toward your face keeping elbows high. Separate your hands bringing your fists near your ears. Return slowly.': 'Karjait előre a kábelnél vagy súlyzókkal húzza az arca felé a munkaeszközt úgy, hogy könyökét magasan tartsa. Válasszuk szét a kezünket úgy, hogy az öklünket a fülünkhöz közelítsük. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'With your body inclined under a low bar, grip with a pronated grip. Pull your chest to the bar keeping your body rigid. Lower slowly.': 'Ha a testet egy alacsony rúd alá dönti, akkor a markolatot pronált markolattal. Húzza a mellkasát a rúdhoz, miközben testét mereven tartja. Lassan engedje le.',
      'With your feet on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward the floor. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Lábait emelt felületre helyezve engedje le a mellkasát a padló felé. Nyomja felfelé, visszatérve a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'With your hands on an elevated surface, lower your chest toward your hands. Push up returning to the starting position.': 'Kezével emelt felületen engedje le a mellkasát a kezei felé. Nyomja felfelé, visszatérve a kiindulási helyzetbe.',
      'With your hands on the edge of a bench, step forward with your glutes out. Lower your body bending your elbows to 90 degrees. Push up.': 'Tartsa a kezét a pad szélén, és lépjen előre fenékkel. Engedje le testét a könyökét hajlítva 90 fokra. Nyomja felfelé.',
      'With your torso inclined and elbow bent at 90 degrees, extend your arm backward to full extension. Slowly return.': 'Döntött törzs és 90 fokban hajlított könyök mellett nyújtsa ki a karját hátrafelé a teljes kinyújtásig. Lassan térjen vissza.',
      'With your upper back on a bench and weight on your hips. Push your hips upward squeezing your glutes. Return slowly.': 'Felső hátával egy padon, súlyával a csípőjén. Tolja felfelé a csípőjét, és szorítsa össze a farizmokat. Lassan térjen vissza.',
    },
  };
  final langMap = _langTips[lang];
  if (langMap == null) return en;
  // Sort by length descending for longest-match-first
  final entries = langMap.entries.toList()..sort((a, b) => b.key.length.compareTo(a.key.length));
  String result = en;
  for (final e in entries) {
    if (result.contains(e.key)) {
      result = result.replaceAll(e.key, e.value);
    }
  }
  return result;
}


